after the delivery of the corresponding deliverable and its acceptance by CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"594\">Taxes will be applicable as per prevailing government norms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"626\"><strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"626\">PENALTY TERMS</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"798\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the terms and conditions mentioned in <strong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"797\">Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025 Raipur dated 20/02/2025</strong>.</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"428\">\r\n<p data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"428\">CHiPS will constitute an <strong data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"227\">Evaluation Committee</strong> whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"627\">A <strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"449\">presentation</strong> will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (<strong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"623\">Via Video Conference</strong>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"769\">During the presentation by the companies, the <strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"739\">Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates</strong> (<strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"765\">Via Video Conference</strong>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"845\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"845\">The <strong data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"818\">marking for presentation and interview</strong> will be done as follows:<br><br></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>&bull; Approach and Methodology <br>&bull; Understanding of the Project Framework <br>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project <br>&bull; Prior experience in project interaction with senior Government officials <br>&bull; Prior exposure to Auditing Government projects <br>&bull; Resource deployment at multiple government offices in multiple locations <br>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs of project management</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Suitability of profile <br>&bull; Years of relevant experience <br>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework <br>&bull; Ability to Negotiate / Persuade / Influence <br>&bull; Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report / monitor the key SLAs <br>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"467\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this <strong data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"178\">EoI document</strong> carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this <strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"257\">EoI Notice</strong>. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"603\">The <strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"513\">last date for submission of response</strong> is <strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"531\">23/06/2025</strong>. Any response received after the above deadline will be <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"600\">rejected</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"684\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"866\"><strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"700\">CEO, CHiPS</strong><br data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\">State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\">Raipur &ndash; 492001<br data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"755\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"768\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"784\">ceochips@nic.in</a>, <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"807\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a><br data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"810\"><strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"821\">Tel:</strong> +91-771-4014158 | <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"848\">Fax:</strong> +91-771-4014158</p>','<ul data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"441\">\r\n<li data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"157\"><strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"155\">Signed copy of this EOI</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"352\">\r\n<p data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"352\"><strong data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"171\">Resumes</strong> of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per <em data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"350\">Empanelment Tender No-165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025 Raipur dated 20/02/2025</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"441\">\r\n<p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"441\"><strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"371\">Presentation</strong> showing strategy and action plan for conducting <em data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"439\">Impact Assessment</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-10-30 21:14:42',4,1,'2025-10-30 21:13:37',34,'2025-10-30 21:14:42',NULL,'2025-10-30 21:15:12',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-10-30',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','For Selection of TPA under CGSWAN Project','2025-06-06','2025-06-12','2025-06-23 00:00:00','2025-06-27 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-12',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/36AZpBZcuRw6iWdcra7WCNetyi4vhNeEorj3KnpG.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,10987625,0,0,1977772.5,12965397.5,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (19,0,69,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/Bharatnet-3/PMU/DPR/2024',1,'BharatNet Phase-III DPR Preparation','12','<p data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"478\">Chhattisgarh Infotech and Biotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), the nodal agency of the Department of Information Technology and Biotechnology, Government of Chhattisgarh, invites technical proposals to undertake <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"406\">Advisory Services for preparation of the Detailed Project Report (DPR)</strong> for the <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"446\">BharatNet Phase III Project</strong> in the State of Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"847\">BharatNet Phase III being a high-value project, CHiPS hereby invites proposals from <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"614\">Tier-I Firms empaneled under CHiPS Empanelment</strong> (as per Tender No. <em data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"685\">68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020 dated 31/10/2020</em>) to submit a proposal based on the <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"819\">Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR, and Deployment Duration</strong> as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',2,34,'2024-10-23 21:32:54',0,0,NULL,NULL,19257600,962880,20220480,0,18,5,'<p>CHiPS, Government of Chhattisgarh intends to engage a strategic consulting firm for setting up a Project Management Unit (PMU) for Preparation of Detailed Project Report (DPR) for BharatNet Phase III and assistance in Project Implementation for BharatNet in the State of Chhattisgarh, along with the required support in the field. The PMU shall be comprising a team of well-experienced and qualified professionals in the field of Telecom, infrastructure, finance, education, project management, procurement, information technology implementation, IEC and BCC activities, to help in planning and execute the Department&rsquo;s vision to become the leading State in the country having better Telecom infrastructure.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"170\"><strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"168\">Scope of Work</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"210\"><strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"208\">Preparation and Approval of DPR -</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<li data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"327\">\r\n<p data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"327\">Prepare a detailed work plan for the preparation of the Detailed Project Report (DPR) for BharatNet Phase III.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"456\">\r\n<p data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"456\">Conduct baseline surveys, assessments, and studies to collect data and information required for the preparation of the DPR.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"713\">Undertake consultations with stakeholders, including communities, government bodies, and private sector partners to ensure that the DPR reflects ground realities, aligns with local needs and priorities, and is socially and environmentally sustainable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"931\">Conduct an industry consultation with relevant stakeholders from a specific industry to gather insights, feedback, or advice to understand the need of project are informed and concerns of those directly impacted.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1218\">Prepare technical specifications, designs, Bill of Quantities (BOQ), and cost estimates and financial analysis of the project, including capital and operational costs, revenue streams, and funding sources, for the infrastructure to be established under BharatNet Phase III project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1391\">The team of experts should consist of professionals with relevant technical expertise, including project management, engineering, technology, procurement, and finance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1577\">The team should be well-versed in the relevant regulations and policies governing the sector, have significant experience in similar projects, and a proven track record of success.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1760\">Additionally, the PMU shall also develop conceptual framework and roadmap for revenue generation from created network infrastructure of BharatNet Phase-III from various methods.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1940\">Support CHIPS to Build capacity of government officials and other project stakeholders for the preparation, implementation, and management of the BharatNet Phase III project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1987\">Co-ordinate with concerned stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2068\">Provide technical assistance and oversight during the approval of the DPR.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2243\">Prepare risk mitigation strategies, including identification of potential risks, their probability, and impact, and develop contingency plans to mitigate their effects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2421\">Prepare a detailed procurement plan, including tender documents, evaluation criteria, and specifications, for the selection of required agencies under BharatNet Phase-III.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"3205\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"3205\"><strong data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2463\">Bid Management for selection of &ndash;</strong><br data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2466\">&bull; MSI for BharatNet Phase-III Connectivity<br data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2514\">&bull; TSP for providing Bandwidth at Block/ Gram Panchayat/ Village Level<br data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2589\">&bull; TPA for audit of the BharatNet Phase-III Network<br data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2645\">&bull; Any other agency required under Bharatnet Phase-III project<br data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2712\">&bull; Preparation of Terms of Reference and bid documents (EOI/ RFP) for procurement of necessary goods, services, and other allied services.<br data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2855\">&bull; Conduct meetings to incorporate suggestions in the tender documents from stakeholders.<br data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2949\">&bull; Floating of EOI/ RFP and in scheduling pre-bid meeting. CHiPS will facilitate the same.<br data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3044\">&bull; Drafting responses to pre-bid queries and any corrigendum/ addendum.<br data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3120\">&bull; Assist in drafting of contracts and onboarding of service providers/ agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3389\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3389\">Additionally, the PMU shall also develop conceptual framework and roadmap for revenue generation from created network infrastructure of BharatNet Phase-III from various methods.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3559\">Support in drafting proposals for infrastructure development to seek grant-in-aid under Central schemes and secure funding from the CSR/ DBN Fund (erstwhile USOF).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3643\">Revision of DPR (if required), has to be done as and when required by agency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3812\">Co-ordinate and follow-up with Govt. of India (DoT, USOF etc.) to get the approval for fund to implement Bharatnet Phase III project in the State of Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3942\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3942\">Support for day-to-day activities like meeting, preparing minutes of the meeting, presentation, note etc. on regular basis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3943\" data-end=\"4081\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"4081\">Any task required for preparation of DPR for Bharatnet phase III and onboarding of required agencies through bid management process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4082\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4130\">Any other work assigned by CEO/ACEO CHIPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"206\"><strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"206\">PAYMENT TERMS</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"315\">Payment to the selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<li data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"439\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"400\">man-month basis</strong> as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"685\">\r\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"685\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHIPS/CHiPS, the selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man-month payment in the event that the bidder has performed its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"768\">\r\n<p data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"768\">The payment shall be payable after <strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"765\">review of the Project Review Committee</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"1061\">During the cool-off period between the submission of the Detailed Project Report (DPR) and its approval from the Government of India, <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"956\">no payment will be made for the cool-off period</strong>. The payment shall start from the date when approval of fund is received from the Government of India.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1093\"><strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1093\">PENALTY TERMS</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1182\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed <strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1179\">current empanelment terms</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"509\"><strong data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"263\">CHIPS/CHiPS</strong> will constitute an <strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"307\">Evaluation Committee</strong> whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"685\">\r\n<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"685\">A <strong data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"530\">presentation</strong> will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"861\">During the presentation by the companies, the <strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"776\">proposed candidates may be interviewed</strong> (face to face / virtually through video conferencing) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"938\">The <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"910\">marking for presentation and interview</strong> will be done as follows &ndash;<br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"width: 52.3112%;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 47.6888%;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.3112%;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.6888%;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.3112%;\"><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.6888%;\"><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.3112%;\">&bull;&bull; Approach and Methodology <br>&bull; Understanding of the Project <br>&bull; Prior exposure in similar government projects related to Telecom Consulting/Telecom Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ along with experience in Telecom sector for Government Projects.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.6888%;\">&bull; Suitability of the profile&nbsp;<br>&bull; Educational Qualification <br>&bull; Years of relevant Experience <br>&bull; Experience of Working in Government Projects <br>&bull; Communication abilities <br>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key aspects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"454\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"592\">The last date for submission of response is <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"524\">08/11/2024; 05:00 PM</strong>. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"673\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"861\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"687\">The CEO,</strong><br data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"690\"><strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"732\">CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,</strong><br data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"735\"><strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"754\">Raipur &ndash; 492001</strong><br data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"767\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"783\">ceochips@nic.in</a>, <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"806\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a><br data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"809\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"817\">Tel:</strong> +91-771-4014158&emsp;&emsp;<strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"843\">Fax:</strong> +91-771-4014158</p>','<ul data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"348\">\r\n<li data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"161\">\r\n<p data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"161\">Signed copy of this EOI</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"211\">\r\n<p data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"211\">Copy of Approach and Methodology Presentation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"348\">\r\n<p data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"348\">Resumes of the proposed resources (The format of resumes will be as per Empanelment Tender No. <strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"345\">68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020</strong>)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-10-30 21:40:43',4,1,'2025-10-30 21:39:35',34,'2025-10-30 21:40:43',NULL,'2025-10-30 21:41:12',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-10-30',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Project Management Unit (PMU) for â€œPreparation of Detailed Project Report (DPR) for BharatNet Phase IIIâ€','2024-10-23','2024-10-28','2024-11-08 00:00:00','2024-11-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-12',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/emCdP1Wa2k2n7CzEBB1zolgLz8O6Rt6Jkcz73ynw.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,6449032.26,0,0,1160825.81,7609858.06,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (20,0,58,'EOI/CHiPS/KO2.0/PMU/2025',1,'PMU cum TPA for Khanij 2.0','12','<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"465\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), the nodal agency of the Department of Electronics &amp; Information Technology, Government of Chhattisgarh, is implementing the <strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"332\">&ldquo;Khanij Online 2.0 Project&rdquo;</strong>, as detailed in the Scope of Work, and has envisaged appointing a <strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"462\">Program Management Unit (PMU) cum Third Party Auditor (TPA)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"628\">This section provides general information about the Issuer, important dates and addresses, and the overall eligibility criteria for the participating agencies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"911\">The objective of the assignment is to provide assistance to CHiPS with advisory services, supervision, and monitoring of the entire project, including designing and validation of infrastructure (active and passive), project execution, and O&amp;M under the Khanij Online 2.0 Project.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"1114\">The successful bidder onboarded through this EOI shall take over the PMU responsibilities from the existing PMU (if any) working on the project and deliver the scope of work defined in this document.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1395\">CHiPS invites all <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1156\">empaneled agencies</strong> (as per Tender No. <strong data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1212\">68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020</strong>) to submit a proposal based on the <strong data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1367\">Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, Terms of Reference (TOR), and Deployment Duration</strong> as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',2,34,'2025-04-11 00:27:18',0,0,NULL,NULL,33417600,1670880,35088480,0,18,5,'<p data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"384\"><strong data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"177\">Khanij Online</strong> is an integrated web-based <strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"245\">Mines and Minerals Management System</strong> developed for the Department of Mineral Resources, Government of Chhattisgarh, to administer and regulate mineral reserves in the state.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"778\">The <strong data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"415\">Khanij Online Project</strong> has successfully completed <strong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"507\">Functional, Security, Performance, and Vulnerability Testing</strong> through <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"524\">STQC</strong> and is currently in the <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"583\">Operations &amp; Maintenance Phase</strong>. The project has been recognized nationally, having received the <strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"694\">National e-Governance Silver Award (2019)</strong> for <em data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"775\">Excellence in Government Process Re-engineering for Digital Transformation</em>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1200\">The existing <strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"810\">Khanij Online</strong> system efficiently caters to business requirements and now needs to be <strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"914\">migrated to a cloud platform</strong> on a <em data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"936\">lift-and-shift</em> basis, followed by further enhancements. The upgraded version empowers each registered stakeholder &mdash; <strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1113\">lessee, licensee, trader, end-use plant, vehicle owner, and transporter</strong> &mdash; including <strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1161\">regulatory government officials</strong>, to act as a <strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1197\">center of delivery</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1524\">The project has streamlined core processes of mining administration through automation and has made a significant contribution to <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1348\">e-Governance</strong> in the state. With the growing needs of the sector and the <strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1465\">vision of the Directorate of Geology and Mining (DGM)</strong>, the project is now evolving into <strong data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1521\">Khanij Online 2.0</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1562\">About Khanij Online 2.0</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1626\">The enhanced version, <strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1607\">Khanij Online 2.0</strong>, is designed to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1683\">Improve operational efficiency through <strong data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1680\">mobility</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1812\">Enhance control over <strong data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1725\">minor minerals</strong> via an <strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1764\">Offline Desktop Application</strong> for areas with limited internet connectivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1897\">Implement <strong data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1845\">vehicle tracking</strong> for monitoring mineral movement within the state.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1982\">Leverage technology for <strong data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1942\">trend analysis</strong> across mining and related activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2090\">Enable <strong data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2026\">real-time analytics dashboards</strong> for stakeholders to monitor their key performance parameters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2231\"><strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2113\">Khanij Online 2.0</strong> aims to integrate these functionalities and take mining governance to the next level of <strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2228\">digital transformation</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2267\"><strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2267\">Proposed Enhancements</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2432\">The conceptual model of <strong data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2314\">Khanij Online 2.0</strong> requires migration of the existing system to the <strong data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2388\">cloud infrastructure</strong> and enhancement of the following modules:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2460\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2460\"><strong data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2458\">Mobile Application</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2497\"><strong data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2495\">Offline Desktop Application</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2527\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2527\"><strong data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2525\">Establishment Module</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2570\"><strong data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2568\">Analytics (Business Intelligence)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2617\"><strong data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2617\">Operational Support Units (24x7)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2721\">For uninterrupted operational support, the following dedicated units will function in <strong data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2718\">24x7 mode</strong>:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2872\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2788\"><strong data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2737\">Helpdesk</strong> &ndash; for resolving technical issues faced by users.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2872\"><strong data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2824\">Field Units (District Level)</strong> &ndash; for user handholding and on-ground support.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"222\">Scope of Work as a PMU</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"314\">Looking into the complexity of the project, the scope of work is divided into two parts.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"366\">As a PMU &mdash; Scope of Work under the Project:</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<li data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<p data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"525\">The PMU shall ensure a structured transition plan and smooth knowledge transfer of the Khanij Online application from the existing System Integrator (SI).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"812\">This includes a complete takeover of the application in its as-is condition, covering all developments, enhancements, databases, source codes, user manuals, Software Requirement Specifications (SRS), design documents, integrations, and infrastructure at the State Data Center (SDC).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"1035\">The PMU must oversee the migration of the application to the cloud, ensuring the seamless transfer of all hardware supplied by the existing SI and other critical components required for uninterrupted system operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1085\">Business Continuity &amp; Operational Support</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1224\">The PMU shall ensure the continuity of business operations facilitated by Khanij Online, maintaining its performance and availability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1351\">This includes ongoing portal support, renewal of IT services, software and hardware subscriptions, and license management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1514\">Enhancements must be made to accommodate both major and minor minerals, along with the prompt resolution of tickets/issues to maintain operational efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1576\">High Availability (HA) &amp; Disaster Recovery (DR) Setup</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1715\">The PMU must establish a robust High Availability (HA) and Disaster Recovery (DR) framework for Khanij Online on cloud infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1927\">The migration of the existing Khanij Online (CHiMMS) application and data from SDC (on-premises) to a MeitY-empanelled cloud service provider must be executed efficiently while ensuring HA and DR compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2018\">Post-migration, the PMU shall drive further enhancements to develop Khanij Online 2.0.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2057\">Mobile Application Development</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2192\">The PMU shall ensure the development of a mobile application for all stakeholders, compatible with both Android and iOS platforms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2333\">The mobile application must support both online and offline functionalities to ensure seamless operations in varying network conditions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2382\">Offline Dispatch Application Development</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2690\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2543\">The PMU shall design and develop an offline-capable application for desktops, laptops, and tablets to support stakeholders involved in the dispatch process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2690\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2690\">This application will enable uninterrupted operations for users experiencing fluctuating or no internet connectivity at their dispatch points.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2734\">Development of Establishment Module</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2943\">The PMU shall design and develop an establishment module incorporating workflow-based processes for leave and Annual Confidential Report (ACR) management for Directorate of Geology and Mining (DGM) users.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3056\">The module must also include a Change Request Management system to efficiently handle process modifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3093\">Training &amp; Capacity Building</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3254\">The PMU shall design and execute a structured training and capacity-building program to ensure the successful implementation and operation of Khanij Online.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3408\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3408\">Regular training sessions shall be conducted for stakeholders to familiarize them with system enhancements, as per the schedule defined by DGM/CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3475\">Any other work assigned by DGM / CHiPS related to the project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3480\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3550\">The Scope of Khanij Online 2.0 will cover the following aspects:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3764\"><strong data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3557\">A)</strong> Ensure the continuity of the existing Khanij Online application.<br data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3625\"><strong data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3631\">B)</strong> Design and development, implementation, and maintenance of Khanij Online 2.0 application with Service Oriented Architecture (SOA).</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"4645\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"4357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"4357\">Mines and Management System in Khanij Online 2.0 with Establishment Module, Change Request Module, Integration with other departments, Banks, weighing meters and other associated applications &mdash; The PMU shall carry out a detailed systems study to prepare/refine the Functional Requirements Specifications and formulate the System and Software Requirements Specifications documents incorporating the functional specifications and standards provided by the CHiPS/DGM. The PMU shall ensure the proper design and timely development of the Service Oriented Architecture for Khanij Online 2.0.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4373\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4373\">Mobile App</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4404\">Desktop based application</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4438\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4438\">Application hosting on cloud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4461\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4461\">Disaster Recovery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4498\">Operational Acceptance of Cloud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4556\">Operations, Maintenance &amp; Support for Cloud Services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4615\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4615\">Provisioning Cloud Services for Additional Quantities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4616\" data-end=\"4645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4619\" data-end=\"4645\">Cloud Services Checklist</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4970\">For detailed scope of Work, the bidders are requested to refer to the &ldquo;RFP for selection of system Integrator for Ensuring Continuity of Khanij Online (CHiMMS) application and Design, Development, Implementation and Maintenance of Khanij Online 2.0. RFP no. 62157/CEO/CHiPS/KhanijOnline2.0/RFP/202 Dated 13th March 2020.&rdquo;</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4972\" data-end=\"4975\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"5008\">5. Scope of Work as a TPA</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5068\">1. Resource Deployment Verification Report (One-Time)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5069\" data-end=\"5862\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5069\" data-end=\"5176\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5176\">Conduct a comprehensive audit of manpower deployment to ensure compliance with the operator&rsquo;s contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5177\" data-end=\"5265\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5265\">Verify the qualifications, experience, and number of deployed resources at the site.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5266\" data-end=\"5325\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5268\" data-end=\"5325\">Cross-check actual deployment against the project plan.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5430\">Ensure the System Integrator (SI) has deployed the required personnel with the necessary skill sets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5431\" data-end=\"5545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5545\">Validate key roles such as Project Manager, Engineers, and Technicians to confirm adherence to contract terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5546\" data-end=\"5642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5642\">Confirm the occurrence of the Kick-Off meeting and ensure all key stakeholders were present.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5643\" data-end=\"5743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5645\" data-end=\"5743\">Review meeting minutes to verify discussions on project milestones, risks, and responsibilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5744\" data-end=\"5862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5862\">Audit project mobilization activities to confirm readiness, including equipment, tools, and resource availability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5864\" data-end=\"5934\">2. System Requirement Specification (SRS) Audit Report (One-Time)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5935\" data-end=\"6396\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5935\" data-end=\"6067\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5937\" data-end=\"6067\">Conduct a detailed review of the SRS document to ensure completeness and accuracy of functional and non-functional requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6068\" data-end=\"6153\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6070\" data-end=\"6153\">Verify alignment of the SRS with project objectives and stakeholder expectations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6154\" data-end=\"6259\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6156\" data-end=\"6259\">Perform a gap analysis to identify any missing or ambiguous requirements and provide recommendations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6260\" data-end=\"6324\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6262\" data-end=\"6324\">Confirm formal approval of the SRS by relevant stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6325\" data-end=\"6396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6396\">Ensure version control and documentation of all changes in the SRS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6458\">3. Installation &amp; Commissioning Audit Report (One-Time)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6459\" data-end=\"7013\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6459\" data-end=\"6545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6461\" data-end=\"6545\">Audit the installation and configuration of ICCC equipment and associated systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6546\" data-end=\"6638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6548\" data-end=\"6638\">Verify the pilot testing of the Vehicle Tracking System (VTS) with selected GPS devices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6639\" data-end=\"6716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6641\" data-end=\"6716\">Ensure testing covers all critical functionalities and failure scenarios.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6717\" data-end=\"6818\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6719\" data-end=\"6818\">Assess pilot test results to confirm system performance and compliance with project requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6819\" data-end=\"6907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6821\" data-end=\"6907\">Certify the success of the Proof of Concept (POC) or identify areas for improvement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6908\" data-end=\"7013\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6910\" data-end=\"7013\">Oversee the User Acceptance Testing (UAT) process and issue certification upon successful completion.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7015\" data-end=\"7055\">4. UAT Compliance Report (One-Time)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7056\" data-end=\"7433\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7056\" data-end=\"7124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7058\" data-end=\"7124\">Verify that all identified issues during UAT have been resolved.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7125\" data-end=\"7215\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7127\" data-end=\"7215\">Ensure system functionality aligns with expectations in a production-like environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7216\" data-end=\"7275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7218\" data-end=\"7275\">Audit the SI&rsquo;s deliverables for contractual compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7276\" data-end=\"7353\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7278\" data-end=\"7353\">Identify and document any non-compliance or deviations from agreed terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7354\" data-end=\"7433\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7356\" data-end=\"7433\">Provide final recommendations for system approval and deployment readiness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7435\" data-end=\"7478\">5. Audit of STQC/CERT-IN Certification</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7479\" data-end=\"7802\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7479\" data-end=\"7589\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7481\" data-end=\"7589\">Audit the certification process to ensure compliance with STQC/CERT-IN security and performance standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7590\" data-end=\"7676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7592\" data-end=\"7676\">Verify the accreditation of the certifying body and completeness of documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7677\" data-end=\"7743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7679\" data-end=\"7743\">Provide recommendations for rectification of any shortcomings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7744\" data-end=\"7802\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7746\" data-end=\"7802\">Validate the authenticity of the issued certification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"7804\" data-end=\"7854\">6. Go-Live Readiness Certification (One-Time)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7855\" data-end=\"8190\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7855\" data-end=\"7919\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7857\" data-end=\"7919\">Verify completion of all critical activities before Go-Live.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7920\" data-end=\"8010\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7922\" data-end=\"8010\">Ensure dependencies such as final testing, training, and data migration are addressed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8011\" data-end=\"8075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8013\" data-end=\"8075\">Conduct risk assessment and recommend mitigation strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8076\" data-end=\"8138\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8078\" data-end=\"8138\">Confirm stakeholder approvals before moving to production.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8139\" data-end=\"8190\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8141\" data-end=\"8190\">Issue a formal Go-Live readiness certification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8192\" data-end=\"8256\">7. Operations &amp; Maintenance (O&amp;M) Audit Reports (Quarterly)</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8257\" data-end=\"8731\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8257\" data-end=\"8344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8259\" data-end=\"8344\">Conduct quarterly audits of the Annual Maintenance Contract (AMC) and O&amp;M services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8345\" data-end=\"8417\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8347\" data-end=\"8417\">Analyze service levels, response times, and maintenance performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8418\" data-end=\"8538\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8420\" data-end=\"8538\">Assess SI&rsquo;s compliance with Service Level Agreements (SLAs) and recommend penalties or corrective actions if needed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8539\" data-end=\"8623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8541\" data-end=\"8623\">Provide strategic recommendations for improving efficiency and service delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8624\" data-end=\"8731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8626\" data-end=\"8731\">Issue a final assessment report summarizing audit findings and suggestions for future contract renewal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"242\"><strong data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"136\">Payment Terms</strong><br data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"139\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<li data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"361\">\r\n<p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"361\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"624\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligation in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"699\">The payment shall be payable after review of Project Review Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"722\">Penalty Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<li data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"824\">Additional Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed current empanelment 2020 terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<li data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"725\">CHiPS will constitute an <strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"352\">Evaluation Committee</strong> whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"725\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in similar areas of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"896\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed (face to face/virtually through video conferencing) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"957\">The evaluation criteria for this EOI will be as follows:<br><br></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&bull; Approach and Methodology <br>&bull; Understanding of the Project Framework <br>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project <br>&bull; Prior experience in project interaction with senior government officials <br>&bull; Prior exposure to implementing government projects in process re-engineering, if applicable <br>&bull; Resource deployment at multiple government offices in multiple locations <br>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Suitability of profile <br>&bull; Years of relevant experience <br>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework, if applicable <br>&bull; Ability to negotiate / persuade / influence, if/as applicable <br>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs <br>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"451\"><strong data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"140\">Bidder agencies are advised</strong> to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"592\">The last date for submission of response is <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"524\">28 April 2025, 05:00 PM</strong>. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"742\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:<br data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"674\"><strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"740\">CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"722\">Raipur &ndash; 492001.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"848\"><strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"754\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"770\">ceochips@nic.in</a>, <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"793\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a><br data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"796\"><strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"804\">Tel:</strong> +91-771-4014158&emsp;&emsp;<strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"830\">Fax:</strong> +91-771-4014158</p>','<ul data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"337\">\r\n<li data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"135\">\r\n<p data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"135\">Signed copy of this EOI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"185\">\r\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"185\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"337\">\r\n<p data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"337\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number 68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-10-31 00:33:25',4,1,'2025-10-31 00:32:43',34,'2025-10-31 00:33:25',NULL,'2025-10-31 00:33:54',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-10-31',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Program Management Unit (PMU) cum TPA for Khanij Online 2.0 Project','2025-04-11','2025-04-16','2025-04-28 00:00:00','2025-05-02 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-13',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/oeSVV03B1BR2f0Mb90W6uLLO4qsFaELVrBBHgnrJ.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,24465333.33,0,0,4403760,28869093.33,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (21,0,63,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/2025',1,'PMU for SWS, Land Management System and IWMMS projects','12','<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"370\"><strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"101\">CHiPS</strong> is inviting all empaneled agencies (as per the <strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"213\">Tender No. 68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020 dated 31/10/2020</strong>) to submit a proposal based on <strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"342\">Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration</strong> as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',2,34,'2025-05-13 00:49:50',0,0,NULL,NULL,14160000,708000,14868000,0,18,5,'<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"439\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) serves as the nodal agency and primary driver of IT growth and the implementation of digital initiatives in the state of Chhattisgarh. In this capacity, CHiPS oversees the execution of numerous IT projects aimed at enhancing governance and public service delivery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"698\">To ensure the effective and efficient implementation of three of its key ongoing projects, CHiPS plans to onboard a dedicated <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"600\">Project Management Unit (PMU)</strong>. This PMU will play a crucial role in streamlining project execution and operational oversight.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"751\">The details of the three projects are as follows:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"826\"><strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"826\">Single Window System for Department of Commerce &amp; Industries</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1093\">Enhancing the current Single Window System (SWS) presents a valuable opportunity to significantly improve service delivery by making it more seamless, efficient, and user-centric. Transitioning to a next-generation SWS is essential for several compelling reasons:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1131\">Enhancing Ease of Doing Business</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1176\">Facilitating Data-Driven Decision-Making</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1224\">Improving User Experience and Accessibility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1261\">Streamlining Financial Processes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1307\">Promoting Transparency and Accountability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1358\">Supporting Economic Growth and Competitiveness</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1403\">Future-Proofing with Scalable Technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1452\">Addressing Current Gaps for Long-Term Impact</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1617\"><strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1473\">Project Status:</strong> Vendor on-boarding is in progress<br data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1510\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1553\">Project Delivery Timeline (For the SI):</strong> 6 months for implementation phase and 33 months for O&amp;M phase</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1622\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1720\">Land Management System for Chhattisgarh State Industrial Development Corporation (CSIDC)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"2140\">CSIDC is developing a Land Management System (LMS) to support automation, efficiency, scalability, security, ease of use, and interoperability. The LMS system shall comprise of <strong data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1926\">Land Allotment Services</strong> including Land Allotment and Land Bank. Further, the post-allotment services will include <strong data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2138\">Transfer and Permissions, Plot Modifications and Other Requests, Land Surrender, Land Transfer Service, and Payments.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2315\"><strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2153\">Status:</strong> Vendor on-boarded and implementation is in progress<br data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2208\"><strong data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2251\">Project Delivery Timeline (For the SI):</strong> 16 weeks for implementation phase and 36 months for O&amp;M phase</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2434\"><strong data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2434\">Industrial Waste Management and Monitoring System for Chhattisgarh Environment Conservation Board (CECB)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2806\">CECB plans to develop a centralized IT application with an integrated mobile app to streamline the issuance of <strong data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2583\">No Objection Certificates (NOCs)</strong> for industrial waste disposal and ensure efficient monitoring. This system will digitize the NOC application, approval, and monitoring processes while providing real-time data and insights into waste disposal activities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"3203\">The system will address two key disposal methods:<br data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2860\">a) <strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2878\">Landfilling</strong> &ndash; Industries must apply for an NOC specifying waste type, disposal location, and quantity. The NOC to be issued by the Regional Office (RO).<br data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3022\">b) <strong data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3054\">Reuse by Other Industries</strong> &ndash; No NOC is required, but reuser industries must be approved by the respective ROs, and the movement of waste for reuse process will be monitored.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3323\">The project aims to simplify workflows, enhance transparency, and support compliance with environmental regulations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3497\"><strong data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3336\">Status:</strong> Vendor on-boarded and implementation is in progress<br data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3391\"><strong data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3434\">Project Delivery Timeline (For the SI):</strong> 8 weeks for implementation phase and 24 months for O&amp;M phase</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"208\">The role of the PMU under this contract shall be:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"213\">\r\n<h4 data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"271\"><strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"271\">Common Scope of Work for all the three projects</strong></h4>\r\n<ol data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<li data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"365\">\r\n<p data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"365\">Advice CHiPS on best practices around technology project implementation and operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"468\">\r\n<p data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"468\">Coordinate and liaise with government departments as necessary based on the instruction of CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"573\">\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"573\">Oversee the implementation of all the three projects by the successful bidders (system integrator).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"779\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"779\">Review of work done by system integrator (Milestone deliverables), validating the project deliverables and provide recommendation on milestone deliverable completion and payment to CHiPS for approval.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"952\">Validating work milestone completion, service level data, Quarterly Governance Report (QGR) and recommending payment for the projects awarded to the system integrator.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1036\">Undertake Unit &amp; System testing and facilitate UAT and submit report to CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1177\">Continuously monitor project implementation and operations to ensure the project is meeting its intended objectives and service levels.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1289\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1289\">Proactively identify and resolve operational issues, coordinating with stakeholders and vendors as needed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1382\">Identify potential risks and develop mitigation strategies to address them proactively.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1539\">Maintain thorough documentation and provide regular reports on implementation progress, operational performance, user feedback, and improvement areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1613\">PMU will perform any other job assigned by CHiPS from time to time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&bull; Approach and Methodology</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Suitability of profile</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&bull; Understanding of the Project Requirements</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Years of relevant experience</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such a specific kind of a project</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Relevant certifications</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&bull; Prior experience in similar contact center projects</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Good understanding of projects in the government and public sector</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&bull; Prior consulting engagements in IT / Technology domain</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Prior experience of IT implementation monitoring and operations management in the government sector</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>',NULL,'<ul data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<li data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"604\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"604\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"749\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"822\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows &ndash;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-69012463-b720-8321-a14e-45abf0080357-4\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-152\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"aa3c5054-11f3-458a-8787-29816852f5b2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"338\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"477\">The last date for submission of response is <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"409\">27/05/2025; 18:00 Hrs</strong>; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"722\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:<br data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"559\"><strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"622\">CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"607\">Raipur 492001</strong><br data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"667\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"642\">ceochips@nic.in</a>, <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"665\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></strong><br data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"670\"><strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"678\">Tel:</strong> +91-771-4014158; <strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"704\">Fax:</strong> +91 771-4014158</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>','<ul data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n<li data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"216\">Signed copy of this EOI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"295\">\r\n<p data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"295\">Experience of the bidding firm along with relevant Work Orders/ documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"346\">\r\n<p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"346\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"502\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"499\">68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-10-31 00:54:46',4,1,'2025-10-31 00:53:57',34,'2025-10-31 00:54:46',NULL,'2025-10-31 00:55:24',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-10-31',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of PMU for SWS, Land Management System and IWMMS projects','2025-05-13','2025-05-19','2025-05-27 00:00:00','2025-06-03 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-13',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/PrmGZZbHPOaYruDJklgk09ExJf8nvWyDivzXJjyF.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,11419354.84,0,0,2055483.87,13474838.71,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (22,0,90,'EOI/e-procurement/PMU/2025',1,'PMU for GePNIC e-Procurement','12','<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"234\">CHiPS is the nodal agency for implementation of IT &amp; e-Governance projects in the State. Presently<br data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"101\">CHiPS is working on a fast pace to implement e-Governance projects for the benefit of people and<br data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"200\">Government as well in the State.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"541\">E-Procurement Project is one of the crucial project for the State which primarily aims to providing<br data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"338\">Automation of the procurement transactions reduces human error, enhances the integrity of the data,<br data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"440\">brings in transparency to the Government procurements and facilitates standardization of processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"886\">The Government of Chhattisgarh was the second to adopt electronic mode of procurement in the year<br data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"643\">2007, with specific objectives of bringing in more transparency in the procurement procedure and<br data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"742\">practices, ensure confidentiality, integrity, and authenticity of all transaction and data between the<br data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"847\">procuring entities and the suppliers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1639\">However, with the expiry of the arrangement with the existing SI (Ms. Mjunction Services Limited) and<br data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\">changing needs of the user departments and the need for a holistic approach to e-Procurement<br data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1087\">implementation to meet the goal of an end-to-end e-Government Procurement system for all the<br data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1182\">government and public sector entities in the State, CHiPS is looking forward to implement Government<br data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1285\">eProcurement System of National Informatics Centre, GePNIC&copy; -- a single product to cater to varied<br data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1386\">requirements, to provide software as a service, agile development and deployment, segregation of<br data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1485\">development and implementation, seamless incremental version changes, load handling, process to<br data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1583\">handle malfunction or unforeseen events and many more.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1974\"><strong data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1663\">Reason for GePNIC:</strong> The existing e-Procurement solution implemented in the State has high<br data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1736\">dependency on System Integrators as well as high cost of implementation. However, National<br data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1829\">Informatics Centre, MeitY has developed e-Procurement software system as a product for facilitating<br data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1931\">Electronic Procurement across Government.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2302\">GePNIC is implemented in 24 states, 7 UT&rsquo;s and 750+ Central Government Organizations. 86% of India<br data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2077\">uses GePNIC for electronics procurement system. Apart from above after the completion of the project<br data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2180\">period, department will not have to go through a new tender process every time for selection of new<br data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2282\">system integrator.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2424\">Presently there is immediate and crucial requirement for manpower in Proposed GePNIC e-Procurement<br data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2405\">Project of CHiPS.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2573\">This section provides general information about the Issuer, important dates and addresses and the overall<br data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2534\">eligibility criteria for the parties.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2713\">The objective of the assignment is to provide assistance to CHiPS for selection of PMU for the e-<br data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2675\">Procurement Project to facilitate: -</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"4315\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2948\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2948\">Developing and implementing procurement strategies: Overseeing the purchasing of products or<br data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2813\">services to meet operational needs Analytic reasoning: Using data, market research, and supplier<br data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2915\">contracts to make decisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3067\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3067\">Financial analysis: Analyzing financial data to determine a company\'s future needs and long-<br data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3047\">term strategies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3183\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3183\">Budgeting: Creating and managing budgets, including budgets for departments or divisions<br data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3162\">within a company</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3272\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3272\">Financial reporting: Preparing reports of findings, conclusions, or recommendations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3273\" data-end=\"3387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3387\">Financial operations: Ensuring that all financial operational tasks are completed accurately and<br data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3375\">on time</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3483\">Manage the project end to end using Project Management Practices. Some of the key aspects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3927\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3571\">Project Plan preparation and update actual timelines vis-&agrave;-vis planned timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3691\">Project Financials &ndash; ensure proper management of project financials covering withdrawals, expenditure and income</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3854\">Review presentations &ndash; prepare presentations for review by senior leadership of CHiPS/state. Presentations should clearly communicate the intended message.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3927\">Resource Management - Manage resource assignment, work allocation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"4046\">Strategic advice: Providing strategic advice and guidance to help businesses adapt to digital<br data-start=\"4024\" data-end=\"4027\">transformation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4163\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4163\">Solution development: Designing solutions and formulating roadmaps to help businesses<br data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4138\">achieve their goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4249\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4249\">Training and development: Training and developing others within the organization</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4315\">Technology evaluation: Evaluating emerging technologies etc</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4602\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">CHIPS is inviting all empanelled agencies Tier 1 and Tier 2 (as per the Tender No.<br data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4402\">165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation<br data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4492\">Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned<br data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4590\">in this EOI.</p>',2,34,'2025-06-06 01:12:23',0,0,NULL,NULL,10322243.52,516112.18,10838355.7,0,18,5,'<p data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"788\"><strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"310\">Chhattisgarh is one of the few states that have implemented the e-Procurement system as early as 2007</strong> through CHiPS in a Public Private Partnership mode (PPP) partnering with an SI selected through an RFP process. Since then, the e-Procurement system was quickly adopted by majority of the departments, and the value and volumes of procurement through the e-Procurement system during this period indicates the success of this initiative. The total of <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"678\">48,991 tenders</strong> having worth of <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"715\">Rs. 92,396.38 Cr</strong> was processed using e-Procurement System till the new system in place.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"1609\">However, with the expiry of the arrangement with the SI and changing needs of the user departments and the need for a holistic approach to e-GP implementation to meet the goal of an end-to-end Procurement system for all the government and public sector entities in the State, CHiPS, under Department of Electronics and Information Technology, Government of Chhattisgarh, thereafter in the year 2015, through <strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1235\">M/s Mjunction (System Integrator)</strong> has designed &amp; implemented the <strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1346\">ERP-based Commercial-Off-The-Shelf (COTS) Integrated e-Procurement solution</strong> for all the departments and organizations of the Chhattisgarh government. It may be appreciated that, based on advanced business intelligence tools and unique algorithms, the analytics-powered e-Procurement solution has a high degree of visibility and control.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"2119\">The Integrated e-Procurement System implemented in the state is its uniqueness and has the most advanced feature of analytics to identify features like PAN number, segregation of bidders and department officials, mapping of the basic business rules of tendering like multiple bidding, collusion or probability of any cartel formation which no other system in the entire country has. These features helped nodal agency, CHiPS to alert the departments about probability of collusion and other material facts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2216\">The Integrated e-Procurement model goes beyond the existing e-tendering process. It includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2260\">Registration of suppliers / contractors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2282\">Indent management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2298\">e-Tendering</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2312\">e-Auction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2336\">Contract management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2351\">e-Payments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2366\">Accounting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2400\">Management Information System</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2961\">The entire Integrated e-Procurement process has designed to avoid human interface i.e., supplier and buyer interaction during pre-bidding and post-bidding stages. The application ensures total anonymity of the participating suppliers, even to the buyers, until the bids are opened on the platform. The e-Procurement application provides automatic bid evaluation based on the evaluation parameters given to the system. These improved processes have eliminated subjectivity in receipt and evaluation of bids and has reduced corruption to a significant extent.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3647\">To bring in transparency in Integrated e-Procurement, tender documents containing all details are hosted on the Integrated e-Procurement website. The documents can be downloaded by the interested suppliers free of cost, from the day of publication of a tender. Suppliers/bidders are no more dependent on the officials for various details. At any time in the procurement cycle, any person associated with the transaction can check and know the status of the transaction and also at every stage of the tender activities bidders/suppliers get the email/SMS alert on their mail-id/mobile no. This saves time and effort involved in finding out the status of a tender, purchase order etc.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3943\">An <strong data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3701\">e-Payment Facility (Multiple Payment Gateway)</strong> is integrated with Integrated e-Procurement System for payment of Tender Processing Fees, Earnest Money Deposit (EMD). This is to be done to &lsquo;Minimize Human Intervention&rsquo; thereby minimizing any possibility of disclosure of bidder identity.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"4196\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"4025\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4025\">Online payments can be done through Credit/Debit card, Net banking, NeFT/RTGS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4064\">Completely secure and confidential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4112\">Online EMD refunds are done within T+2 days</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4196\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4196\">No need for bidders to visit the department office for any payments and refunds</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4943\">However, with the expiry of the arrangement with the existing SI (<strong data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4298\">Ms. Mjunction Services Limited</strong>) and changing needs of the user departments and the need for a holistic approach to e-Procurement implementation to meet the goal of an end-to-end e-Government Procurement system for all the government and public sector entities in the State, CHiPS is looking forward to implement <strong data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4655\">Government e-Procurement System of National Informatics Centre, GePNIC&copy;</strong> &mdash; a single product to cater to varied requirements, to provide software as a service, agile development and deployment, segregation of development and implementation, seamless incremental version changes, load handling, process to handle malfunction or unforeseen events and many more.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4945\" data-end=\"5274\"><strong data-start=\"4945\" data-end=\"4967\">Reason for GePNIC:</strong><br data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4970\">The existing e-Procurement solution implemented in the State has high dependency on System Integrators as well as high cost of implementation. However, National Informatics Centre, MeitY has developed e-Procurement software system as a product for facilitating Electronic Procurement across Government.</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5609\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5279\" data-end=\"5366\">GePNIC is implemented in 24 states, 7 UT&rsquo;s and 750+ Central Government Organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5431\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5370\" data-end=\"5431\">86% of India uses GePNIC for electronic procurement system.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5432\" data-end=\"5609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5435\" data-end=\"5609\">Apart from above, after the completion of the project period, department will not have to go through a new tender process every time for selection of new system integrator.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5611\" data-end=\"5614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5616\" data-end=\"5682\"><strong data-start=\"5616\" data-end=\"5650\">Current Implementation Status:</strong><br data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5653\"><strong data-start=\"5653\" data-end=\"5680\">Module Adoption Status:</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"6236\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"5781\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"5781\">\r\n<th data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"5694\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sr. No.</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"5694\" data-end=\"5718\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Modules Adopted</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"5718\" data-end=\"5781\" data-col-size=\"md\">Department</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5883\" data-end=\"6236\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5883\" data-end=\"5929\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5883\" data-end=\"5887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5887\" data-end=\"5910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">e-Tendering</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5910\" data-end=\"5929\">166 Departments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"5976\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"5934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Vendor Registration</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"5976\">166 Departments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"6023\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"5981\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"5981\" data-end=\"6004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">MIS &amp; Accounting</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6004\" data-end=\"6023\">166 Departments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6024\" data-end=\"6070\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6024\" data-end=\"6028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6028\" data-end=\"6051\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online Payment</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6051\" data-end=\"6070\">166 Departments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6116\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6075\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6075\" data-end=\"6098\">Contract</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6098\" data-end=\"6116\">17 Departments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6117\" data-end=\"6192\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6117\" data-end=\"6121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6121\" data-end=\"6144\">e-Auction</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6144\" data-end=\"6192\">MRD Department, CMDC, Civil Supply, and UADD</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6236\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">7</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"6197\" data-end=\"6220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Indent</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6236\">1 Department</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"219\">1. Sr. Consultant (Information Technology) (01 Post)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"3139\">\r\n<li data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"423\"><strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"270\">e-Procurement System Design &amp; Architecture:</strong> Lead the design and architecture of the e-Procurement system, ensuring it aligns with best practices, business requirements, and regulatory standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"603\"><strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"459\">Project Planning &amp; Execution:</strong> Develop detailed project plans for the e-Procurement implementation, ensuring timely delivery, resource management, and adherence to budgets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"812\"><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"644\">Technical Consultation &amp; Strategy:</strong> Provide expert advice on the selection and integration of technologies that will optimize the e-Procurement process, including automation, security, and scalability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"988\"><strong data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"838\">System Integration:</strong> Oversee the integration of the e-Procurement platform with other existing systems (ERP, CRM, etc.), ensuring smooth data flow and interoperability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1186\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1025\">Vendor Selection &amp; Management:</strong> Support the process of selecting and managing technology vendors and service providers for the e-Procurement system, ensuring they meet performance standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1371\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1371\"><strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1236\">Customization, Development &amp; Configuration:</strong> Guide the development or customization of features within the e-Procurement platform to meet the specific needs of the organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1576\"><strong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1400\">Security &amp; Compliance:</strong> Ensure the e-Procurement system adheres to all security protocols, data privacy regulations, and industry standards, such as ISO/IEC 27001, IT Acts, GFR, CVC, and GDPR, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1773\"><strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1621\">Performance Monitoring &amp; Optimization:</strong> Oversee the monitoring of system performance, troubleshooting issues, and implementing improvements to enhance system efficiency and user experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1962\"><strong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1815\">Stakeholder Engagement &amp; Reporting:</strong> Act as the primary point of contact for all technical stakeholders, providing regular updates on project status, risks, and performance metrics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2160\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2160\"><strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1998\">Training &amp; Capacity Building:</strong> Develop and conduct training programs for internal stakeholders (procurement team, users, etc.) on the e-Procurement system&rsquo;s functionality and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2336\"><strong data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2185\">Change Management:</strong> Lead efforts to manage change within the organization as new e-Procurement tools and processes are adopted, ensuring smooth transition and adoption.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2541\"><strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2371\">Post-Implementation Support:</strong> Provide ongoing technical support after the system is live, ensuring continuous operation, troubleshooting, and enhancements based on user feedback and evolving needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2726\"><strong data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2574\">Documentation &amp; Reporting:</strong> Create and maintain comprehensive technical documentation, including system design, process flows, and user manuals for future reference and updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2911\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2911\"><strong data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2756\">Continuous Improvement:</strong> Identify opportunities for continuous improvement in the e-Procurement system, driving innovations that optimize procurement processes and reduce costs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"3011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"3011\"><strong data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2948\">Migration and Exit Management:</strong> Manage migration and exit from the current system to GePNIC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3139\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3139\"><strong data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3036\">Additional Duties:</strong> Perform any additional duties related to finance or any other task as assigned by senior management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3144\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3199\">2. Consultant (Information Technology) (02 Posts)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"5740\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3371\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3371\"><strong data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3236\">System Requirements Analysis:</strong> Assist in gathering and analyzing business requirements for the e-Procurement system, ensuring they align with organizational goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3555\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3555\"><strong data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3400\">Technology Evaluation:</strong> Assist in evaluating and recommending appropriate technologies, platforms, and tools for the development and implementation of the e-Procurement system.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3716\"><strong data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3584\">System Design Support:</strong> Collaborate in the design and architecture of the e-Procurement platform, ensuring scalability, performance, and user-centricity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3894\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3894\"><strong data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3743\">Integration Support:</strong> Assist in integrating the e-Procurement system with other internal systems (ERP, CRM, etc.), ensuring seamless data exchange and process automation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"4073\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"4073\"><strong data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"3931\">Customization &amp; Configuration:</strong> Support the customization and configuration of the e-Procurement platform to meet specific business requirements and procurement workflows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4243\"><strong data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4102\">Security &amp; Compliance:</strong> Ensure the e-Procurement system complies with security standards and legal regulations (e.g., data privacy laws, procurement rules, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4423\"><strong data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4278\">Testing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong> Assist in testing the system for functionality, performance, security, and usability, ensuring that it meets quality standards before go-live.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4567\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4567\"><strong data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4447\">Training Support:</strong> Help develop training materials and provide training to end-users on how to effectively use the e-Procurement system.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4743\"><strong data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4609\">Troubleshooting &amp; Issue Resolution:</strong> Provide technical support for troubleshooting and resolving system issues during the implementation and post-implementation phases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4744\" data-end=\"4915\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4915\"><strong data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4764\">Documentation:</strong> Assist in creating technical documentation, including system specifications, user guides, and operational manuals for future reference and training.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"5090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4918\" data-end=\"5090\"><strong data-start=\"4918\" data-end=\"4942\">Vendor Coordination:</strong> Coordinate with third-party vendors, ensuring smooth delivery of the e-Procurement system components as per project timelines and specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5285\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5285\"><strong data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5125\">Post-Implementation Support:</strong> Provide ongoing technical support to ensure the smooth operation of the e-Procurement system, including resolving bugs and implementing minor system updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5472\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5472\"><strong data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5330\">Monitoring &amp; Performance Optimization:</strong> Assist in monitoring system performance, identifying potential issues, and recommending enhancements to optimize the platform&rsquo;s efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5473\" data-end=\"5634\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5634\"><strong data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5502\">Continuous Improvement:</strong> Suggest and implement improvements to the system based on user feedback, changing business needs, and technological advancements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5635\" data-end=\"5740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5740\"><strong data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5659\">Additional Duties:</strong> Perform additional accounting tasks as assigned by senior management or CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"33\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"33\">Payment Terms Schedule</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n<li data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"135\">Payment to the selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n<li data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"262\">\r\n<p data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"262\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a <strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"223\">man-month basis</strong> as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n<p data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"533\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, the selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man-month payment in the event that the selected bidder has performed its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"538\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"565\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"565\">Penalty Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"644\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"644\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"644\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"580\">Penalty</strong>, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n<li data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"572\">\r\n<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"572\">CHiPS will constitute an <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"371\">Evaluation Committee</strong> whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"750\">A <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"593\">presentation</strong> will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"888\">During the presentation by the companies, the <strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"857\">proposed candidates will be interviewed (face-to-face)</strong> by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1207\">Any <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"908\">deviation</strong> from the proposal and resource CV submitted as a bid response to this EOI would not be considered and would be duly ruled as rejection. Therefore, bidders are instructed that the <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1128\">actual resource who will be deployed</strong> for the assignment should be present for the interview (in person/Skype/VC).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1283\">The <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1256\">marking for presentation and interview</strong> will be done as follows:</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"5149\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"2099\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"2099\">\r\n<th data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1754\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1310\">Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"2099\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1779\">Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"5149\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3729\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3384\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2929\">50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3729\"><strong data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3398\">50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"4544\">\r\n<td data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"4199\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3759\">Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4544\"><strong data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4228\">Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"5149\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4841\" data-col-size=\"xl\">&bull; Approach and Methodology <br>&bull; Understanding of the Project <br>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project <br>&bull; Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management <br>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"4841\" data-end=\"5149\">&bull; Suitability of profile <br>&bull; Years of relevant experience <br>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework <br>&bull; Ability to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence <br>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs <br>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','<ul data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"552\">\r\n<li data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"206\"><strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"64\">Bidder agencies</strong> are advised to study this <strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"123\">Expression of Interest (EoI)</strong> document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this notice.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"411\">\r\n<p data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"411\">Submission of a proposal in response to this EoI shall be deemed to be done <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"324\">after careful study and examination</strong> of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"479\">\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"479\">The <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"458\">last date for submission of response</strong> is <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"476\">23/06/2025</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"552\">Any response received <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"549\">after the above deadline will be rejected</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"557\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"619\"><strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"619\">Preferred Mode of Communication for Query Resolution</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"951\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"628\">To:</strong><br data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"631\"><strong data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"658\">Chief Executive Officer</strong><br data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"661\"><strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"712\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)</strong><br data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"715\">State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room,<br data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"771\">Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh &ndash; 492001<br data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"816\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"825\">Tel.:</strong> +91-771-4014158<br data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"854\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"896\">ceochips@nic.in</a>, <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"951\" data-is-last-node=\"\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></p>','<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-69012463-b720-8321-a14e-45abf0080357-17\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-176\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"13258926-f368-4f45-8ef0-e9c543af56ec\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"308\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"71\">\r\n<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"71\"><strong data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"52\">Signed copy</strong> of this <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"68\" data-is-only-node=\"\">EOI</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"126\">\r\n<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"126\"><strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"124\">Copy of Approach and Methodology Presentation.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"308\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"185\"><strong data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"153\">Resumes of resources</strong> that will face the interview.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"308\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"308\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"308\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"215\">format of resumes</strong> shall be <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"308\" data-is-last-node=\"\">as per empanelment tender number 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment dated 20/02/2025.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,'555555','2025-10-31 01:17:18',4,1,'2025-10-31 01:16:26',34,'2025-10-31 01:17:18',NULL,'2025-10-31 01:17:39',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-10-31',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EOI) for Selection of PMU for e-Procurement project (GePNIC)','2025-06-06','2025-06-12','2025-06-23 00:00:00','2025-06-27 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-13',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/zDb6Zy6wGMbtr2AYxLfWzsFWdF8ytJoCPKFn8I40.pdf',NULL,0,2,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (23,0,69,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/NeVA/2025',1,'PMU for NeVA Project','12','<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"315\">The <strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"83\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), Government of Chhattisgarh</strong>, is seeking to establish a <strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"144\">Project Management Unit (PMU)</strong> with professional consultants for the <strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"227\">planning, implementation, and monitoring</strong> of the <strong data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"312\">National e-Vidhan Application (NeVA) Project &ndash; One Nation One Application</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"597\">The <strong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"337\">NeVA Project</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"365\">Mission Mode Project</strong> under <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"389\">Digital India</strong>, aims to <strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"468\">digitize and make the functioning of State Legislatures paperless</strong>. The <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"491\">scope of work</strong> for the PMU will broadly encompass <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"594\">preparation of DPR, project management, and contract management</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"809\">The <strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"610\">PMU</strong> will provide <strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"674\">end-to-end consultancy support and handholding</strong> in <strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"722\">planning, implementation, and monitoring</strong> of the <strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"746\">NeVA Project</strong> for <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"773\">Vidhansabha Bhavan</strong> in the <strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"806\">State of Chhattisgarh</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"1130\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"820\">CHiPS</strong> is inviting all <strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"866\">Tier-1 empaneled agencies</strong> (as per the <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"970\">Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, dated 20/02/2025</strong>) to submit a proposal based on <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1100\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR, and Deployment Duration</strong> as mentioned in this <strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1129\">EOI</strong>.</p>',2,34,'2025-06-04 11:11:01',0,0,NULL,NULL,18691200,934560,19625760,0,18,5,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"320\">The <strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"52\">National e-Vidhan Application (NeVA) Project</strong> outlines the potential areas of computerization, aiming to make the <strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"152\">State Legislature Paperless</strong> through <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"222\">electronic laying of all papers on the table of the House</strong>, along with the <strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"282\">design, development, and implementation</strong> of a <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"317\">standard e-Vidhan product</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"869\">It includes <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"352\">e-Connectivity</strong> to all <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"392\">State Government Departments</strong>, <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"410\">connectivity</strong> to the <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"466\">National Informatics Centre Network (NICNET)</strong> / <strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"505\">National Knowledge Network (NKN)</strong> for e-Vidhan deployment, <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"560\">Mail/Internet empowerment</strong>, and other <strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"592\">network services</strong> to the <strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"625\">State/UT Legislatures</strong>. The project will also ensure <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"672\">ICT services</strong> to the <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"716\">Members of the State Legislature</strong> and establish <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"791\">Dynamic Guidelines for Indian Government Websites (GIGW)</strong> compliant websites for all State Legislatures using a <strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"866\">common framework</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1429\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This project aims to provide <strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"926\">digital infrastructure</strong> at the <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"964\">State Legislative Assembly</strong>, including the <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1070\">offices of the Hon&rsquo;ble Speaker, Hon&rsquo;ble Deputy Speaker, Secretary, and senior officers</strong>, by setting up <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1114\">Local Area Network (LAN)</strong> / <strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1144\">Wide Area Network (WAN)</strong> for <strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1173\">Internet empowerment</strong> and establishing an <strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1219\">e-Facilitation Center</strong> for <strong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1255\">Elected Legislative Members</strong>. It also includes <strong data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1305\">electronic laying of papers</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1344\">customization of dynamic websites</strong>, and development of a <strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1389\">mobile application</strong> to support seamless digital governance.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"115\">The role of the <strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"72\">Project Management Unit (PMU)</strong> under this contract shall be as follows:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"2025\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"277\">\r\n<p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"277\">Provide strategic advisory to <strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"159\">CHiPS</strong> based on industry standards for effective planning, budgeting, implementation, and management of <strong data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"274\">NeVA Projects</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"399\">\r\n<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"399\">Requirement gathering, preparation of <strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"335\">AS-IS Report</strong> and <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"356\">To-Be Report</strong>, and identification of <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"396\">GAP Analysis</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"469\">\r\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"469\">Preparation and submission of <strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"466\">Detailed Project Report (DPR)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"721\">\r\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"721\">Preparation of <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"520\">Request for Proposals (RFPs)</strong> and execution of the <strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"568\">bid process management</strong>, facilitating the onboarding of selected vendors and drafting the agreement along with validation of documents submitted by the <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"718\">System Integrator</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"875\">Supervise the project during the implementation phase till completion by the selected system integrator to ensure alignment with defined objectives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1027\">Review and validate deliverables carried out by the system integrator, and recommend payment invoices submitted by the system integrator to CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1128\">Verify and recommend <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1090\">Quarterly Governance Reports (QGR)</strong> submitted by the system integrator.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1392\">Verify and recommend <strong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1182\">Low Level Design Document</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1214\">High Level Design Document</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1223\">SRS</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1243\">System Testing</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1278\">User Acceptance Testing (UAT)</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1311\">System Readiness Report</strong> submitted by the system integrator, along with comprehensive reports to CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1534\">Monitor <strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1430\">project implementation</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1462\">operation &amp; maintenance</strong> to ensure alignment with intended goals and service level agreements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1667\">Proactively address operational challenges by coordinating with relevant stakeholders and vendors to ensure timely resolution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1762\">Identify potential project risks in advance and develop actionable <strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1759\">mitigation plans</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1947\">Maintain detailed <strong data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1810\">project documentation</strong> and submit <strong data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1850\">regular progress reports</strong> covering implementation status, operational metrics, user feedback, and areas for improvement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"2025\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2025\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Perform any other work assigned by <strong data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2001\">CEO, CHiPS</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2011\">ACEO</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2024\">JCEO</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-69012463-b720-8321-a14e-45abf0080357-22\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-186\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"63458ff7-c457-47e0-a327-bde463554fac\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"27\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"25\">11. Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"74\">Payment will be made on a <strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"71\">monthly basis</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"79\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"108\"><strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"106\">12. Penalty Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"192\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"192\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"192\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"131\">Penalty, if any,</strong> shall be governed as per the <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"190\">agreed empanelment terms.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,'<ul data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<li data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"475\">CHiPS will constitute an <strong data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"77\">Evaluation Committee</strong>, whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the <strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"182\">Expression of Interest (EOI)</strong>. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation or discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"475\">A&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"314\">presentation</strong> will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in similar areas of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"592\">The committee shall review the <strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"529\">projects and CVs</strong> submitted along with the presentation and award the marking.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"672\">The marking for the <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"645\">presentation and interview</strong> will be done as follows:<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<th data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"730\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"729\">Area of Evaluation</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"756\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"755\">Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"782\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"781\">Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"799\">Total Marks</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<td data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"917\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"916\">Weightage</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"932\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"931\">50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"947\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"946\">50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"964\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"962\">100 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<td data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"995\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"994\">Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1391\">&bull; Approach and Methodology <br>&bull; Understanding of the Project Framework <br>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project <br>&bull; Prior experience in providing consulting/advisory services for trade promotion/strategy development <br>&bull; Prior experience of drafting State and National level policies <br>&bull; Prior experience in undertaking large transformation projects</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1682\">&bull; Suitability of profile <br>&bull; Educational Qualification <br>&bull; Years of relevant experience <br>&bull; Good understanding of scope of work <br>&bull; Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report <br>&bull; Excellent communication abilities <br>&bull; Experience of Working in Government Projects</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1705\"><strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1705\">Note:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"2407\">i. All experience should be in the <strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1761\">name of the firm</strong> bidding for the project. Experience of <strong data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1827\">sister/associate firms</strong> shall not be eligible.<br data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1853\">ii. Only assignments where <strong data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1949\">work order is issued directly by a Government Entity/Donor Agency</strong> to the bidding firm shall be eligible. Assignments carried out via any <strong data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2059\">third party/private agency/sub-let</strong> shall not be considered for evaluation.<br data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2102\">iii. Only assignments undertaken <strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2161\">directly by the agency</strong> will be considered eligible. Experiences or assignments from sister, associate, or subsidiary firms will not be recognized or considered. To be eligible, the <strong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2405\">contract signing or work order must be exclusively issued by a Government Entity.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2496\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2453\">bidder receiving the highest marking</strong> shall be considered for <strong data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2496\" data-is-last-node=\"\">award of work.</strong></p>','<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-69012463-b720-8321-a14e-45abf0080357-23\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-188\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"184e6a85-1cf8-4fad-810b-062770062369\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"451\">Bidder agencies are advised to thoroughly study this EoI document before submitting their proposals in response to this notice. Submission of a proposal shall be considered as having been done after a careful study and complete understanding of the document, including all its terms, conditions, and implications. The last date for submission of responses is <strong data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"384\">19/06/2025, 17:00 hrs</strong>, and any response received after this deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"830\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">For any queries or clarifications, the preferred mode of communication is through email addressed to the <strong data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"732\">Chief Executive Officer, Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh &ndash; 492001</strong>.<br data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"736\">Contact details: <strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"778\">Tel.: +91-771-4014158</strong> | <strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"791\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"807\">ceochips@nic.in</a>, <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"830\" data-is-last-node=\"\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"373\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><em data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"373\" data-is-last-node=\"\">&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>','<ul data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"373\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"147\">\r\n<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"147\"><strong data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"145\">Signed copy of this EOI</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"201\"><strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"199\">Copy of Approach and Methodology Presentation</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"373\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"373\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"241\">Resumes of the proposed resources</strong>, as per the format defined in <em data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"373\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Empanelment Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, dated 20/02/2025<br><br></em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-10-31 11:17:23',4,1,'2025-10-31 11:16:33',34,'2025-10-31 11:17:23',NULL,'2025-10-31 11:17:48',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-10-31',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EOI) for State Level Project Management Unit (PMU) National e-Vidhan Application (NeVA)','2025-06-04','2025-06-09','2025-06-19 00:00:00','2025-06-25 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-13',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/Y0vs5eSeX29mEIABbdG0i0yNau6LhOXmA8aDtJDV.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,15846600,0,0,2852388,18698988,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (31,0,22,'EOI/PMU/CHiPS/WRD/2024',1,'Project Management Unit For Construction Of Alternate Source Of Water From Bharda Konari Anicut - Shivanath River To Maroda 2 Tank Of Bhilai Steel Plant Water Resource Department, Govt. of Chhattisgarh','12','<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CHiPS is inviting all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of&nbsp;Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</span></p>',2,22,'2024-03-06 10:33:01',0,0,NULL,NULL,39648000,1982400,41630400,0,18,5,'<p><strong>About WRD Project</strong></p>\r\n<p>For the operation of Bhilai Steel Plant water is being supplied from Gangrel Dam through Canal system. On request from Bhilai Steel Plant, Water resource department Govt. of Chhattisgarh is constructing an alternate source of water supply from Bharda Konari Anicut to Marroda-2 Tank. Project entails supplying raw water from Bharda Konari Anicut to Maroda Tank-2. Department is looking to hire Project Management consultants for construction of alternate source of water from Shivnath River to Maroda-2 Tank of Bhilai Steel Plant which includes, ongoing support in design, construction, and installation of E/M (Electrical/Mechanical) Equipment, including intake well, raw water 33/6.6 kV electric substation and raw water pumps and motors. Tasks involve laying and jointing 1800 mm dia, 18 KM (approx.) of MS pipe for supply of 5 Cumecs (at delivery cistern) Raw Water with all allied civil works, commissioning, and testing. Additionally, provide bulk flow meters, surge analysis, preventive devices, and PLC SCADA system installation. The Bhilai steel plant mandates to conduct a 6-month trial run and ensure 10-year operation and maintenance. Also, construct an RCC open channel in Block and District Durg.<br><br><strong>About WRD Chhattisgarh</strong></p>\r\n<p>At the time of formation of the State in November 2000, it inherited from Madhya Pradesh, 20131 completed irrigation projects and 3882 ongoing irrigation projects having a total irrigation potential of 13.28 lakh hectares i.e., 27.5 per cent of Net Sown Area (NSA) of 48.28 lakh hectares.</p>\r\n<p>The Water Resources Department (WRD) of Chhattisgarh is responsible for planning, designing, executing, and operating irrigation projects. The department also offers technical guidance, scrutiny, clearance, and monitoring of irrigation, flood control, and multi-purpose projects</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The WRD\'s work includes:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Improving farming</li>\r\n<li>Considering the effects of environmental changes on water and soil</li>\r\n<li>Creating projects based on requirements</li>\r\n<li>Overall planning, policy formulation, coordination, and guidance in the water resources sector</li>\r\n<li>General infrastructural, technical, and research support for development</li>\r\n<li>Survey, investigation, drawing, design, and estimate</li>\r\n<li>Forest cases and land acquisition</li>\r\n<li>Preparation of detail project reports for irrigation and multipurpose works</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The consultant\'s scope of work would include ,Project Management and Construction Supervision:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Assist in supervision, scheduling, risk management, monitoring, reporting, and ensuring&nbsp;compliances required for the project.</li>\r\n<li>Conducting regular review meetings with the Contractors and other government entities,&nbsp;stakeholders etc., to discuss progress and issues related to implementation, and prepare minutes for&nbsp;recording and circulation.</li>\r\n<li>Establish all necessary records and the procedures of maintaining/updating such records for the entire project.</li>\r\n<li>Develop and implement procedure for timely payments to the Contractors and monitor for&nbsp;compliance by tracking milestones and deliverables submission.</li>\r\n<li>Maintain a risk register and monitor implementation of risk mitigation measures for the project and&nbsp;update the Plan as per requirement.</li>\r\n<li>Consultants will assist the Bhilai Steel Plant in review of quantity of executed works based on&nbsp;payment milestone.</li>\r\n<li>During the construction phase, consultant will actively track and monitor the status of requisite permission and approvals sought by TKC and Bhilai Steel Plant from various other department like Railway, National Highway, Department of Forests and National Parks, and tree-cutting etc. maintain the detailed tracker of the same.</li>\r\n<li>Advise in contract administration as per requirement and overall management during implementation and performance monitoring of the Contractors.</li>\r\n<li>Establish Quality Assurance System including verification of source of material and certification.</li>\r\n<li>Establish all necessary records and the procedures of maintaining/updating such records for each&nbsp;ULB and for the entire project.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in review of P&amp;I Diagram for SCADA/Instrumentation work submitted by Contactor.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in Control Philosophy for SCADA submitted by the Contactor.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in SCADA Architecture drawing, Tag Capacity &amp; I/O (Input/Output) list for the SCADA&nbsp;system, submitted by the Contactor.</li>\r\n<li>Support for the approval of the Quality Assurance Plan (QAP) for SCADA/Instrumentation items&nbsp;submitted by the Contractor.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in review of the Technical Data Sheet and General Arrangement Drawing (GAD) for&nbsp;SCADA/Instrumentation items submitted by the Contractor.</li>\r\n<li>Support in creating guidelines for the installation protocol of SCADA/Instrumentation items.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in third-party inspections/pre-shipment inspections of SCADA/Instrumentation equipment.</li>\r\n<li>Support to ensure that the SCADA/Instrumentation work is carried out, supplied, and installed in accordance with the approved P&amp;I Diagram and as per the specifications outlined in the Tender Technical Specification.</li>\r\n<li>Assist the plant in review and finalization of the \"as-built\" drawings submitted by the Contractor.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in issuing the Work Completion Certificates.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The payment shall be made on a Monthly basis.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed&nbsp;empanelment terms.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">As per Empanelment Agreement</span></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed&nbsp;candidates (Via Video Conference).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 18.1172%;\"><col style=\"width: 37.5212%;\"><col style=\"width: 44.3261%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Key&nbsp;Evaluation&nbsp;Criteria</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Approach and Methodology</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Understanding of the Project Framework</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Quality of proposed methodology for</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">such specific kind of a project</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prior experience in project interaction with senior Government officials</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prior exposure to Auditing Government</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">projects</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Resource deployment at multiple government&nbsp;offices in multiple locations</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Understanding of key SLAs of project</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">management</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Suitability of profile</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Years of relevant experience</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Good understanding of project&nbsp;management best practices framework.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Ability to&nbsp;Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Strong ability to understand and&nbsp;deliberate and report monitor the key&nbsp;SLAs</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Excellent communication abilities.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The last date for submission of response is 12/03/2024. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: - CEO, CHiPS,</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001 ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</span></p>','<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Signed copy of this EOI</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per&nbsp;empanelment tender number 68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020.</span></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2024-03-06 10:43:09',4,1,'2024-03-06 10:42:23',22,'2024-03-06 10:43:09',NULL,'2024-03-06 10:43:46',1,NULL,0,1,'2024-03-06',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of PMU for Water Resource Department','2024-03-06','2024-03-11','2024-03-12 12:00:00','2024-03-12 16:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-24',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/ukoSozzuth1X8ZPlQZfvGUKIX73M2DFVmFso1ePO.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,64419328.71,0,0,11595479.17,76014807.88,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (32,0,35,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/GG&C/SSU/2025',1,'Establishment of Strategic Support Unit for Department of Good Governance and Convergence','24','<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CHiPS invites proposals exclusively from Tier-I empaneled Consultancy firms (as per the Tender No165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/ Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">based on the Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualifications, Terms of Reference (ToR),</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI for providing Strategic Support for Good Governance and</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Convergence Department, Government of Chhattisgarh.</span></p>',2,35,'2025-07-09 12:30:37',0,0,NULL,NULL,34833600,1741680,36575280,0,18,5,'<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Good Governance and Convergence Department, Government of Chhattisgarh, is being strategically repositioned to function as a State-level Infrastructure and Transaction Advisory Think Tank, facilitating convergence, reform-linked investments, and governance modernization. With the state\'s growing focus on urbanization, infrastructure expansion, digital transformation, and inclusive development, the department is envisioned as a driving force for evidence-based, future- ready, and citizen-centric governance.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The scope of work includes but not limited to the following activities:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure Transaction Advisory</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>End-to-End Project Structuring and Review Support:&nbsp;</strong>Assist State departments, Urban and Rural Local Bodies (ULBS/RLBs) in conceptualizing and reviewing the infrastructure projects through rigorous pre-feasibility and feasibility studies, including demand assessment, techno-economic analysis, and environmental due diligence.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Transaction Advisory &amp; Procurement Support:&nbsp;</strong>Review and facilitate State in structuring Public-Private Partnership (PPP) and EPC-based projects, review transaction documents and manage bid processes, evaluate responses, and support in finalizing contracts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Risk Allocation &amp; Financial Modeling:&nbsp;</strong>Develop risk allocation matrices, value-for-money (VIM) assessments, and detailed financial models to optimize project viability and investor interest.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Focus Sectors:&nbsp;</strong>Provide specialized advisory across sectors including urban and rural infrastructure, logistics &amp; warehousing, renewable energy, healthcare infrastructure, affordable housing, tourism, and industrial parks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Reform-Linked Investment Acceleration</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>Support for Reform Implementation and Review:</strong> Act as the State\'s anchor institution to monitor and fast-track compliance with reform milestones under centrally and state sponsored schemes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Investment Bundling &amp; Convergence:&nbsp;</strong>Integrate policy reforms with investment planning, ensuring optimal fund utilization and linking disbursals to performance indicators.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Outcome-Oriented Governance:&nbsp;</strong>Enable time-bound delivery of reform-linked infrastructure outcomes through cross-departmental coordination and convergence with central ministries.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Urban &amp; Regional Infrastructure Planning</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Spatial Planning Support:&nbsp;</strong>Provide technical support in drafting and updating Master Plans, Zonal Development Plans, Comprehensive Mobility Plans (CMPs), and infrastructure investment pipelines.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Integrated Infrastructure Design:&nbsp;</strong>Promote region-specific models that embed solutions across SWM, water reuse, stormwater, e-mobility, green transport, urban forests, and digital infrastructure within a spatial planning framework.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Climate-Responsive and Circular Economy Models:&nbsp;</strong>Integrate green infrastructure, lowcarbon transition pathways, climate budgeting, carbon credits, and sustainable urban planning practices into infrastructure blueprints.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Data-Driven Policy, Monitoring &amp; Dashboards</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>State Data Intelligence &amp; Insights Cell:&nbsp;</strong>Institutionalize a dedicated unit that leverages data analytics, GIS platforms, sectoral MIS, and real-time monitoring tools to inform infrastructure planning and execution.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Performance Tracking &amp; KPI Dashboards:&nbsp;</strong>Assist state agencies to maintain interactive dashboards to track KPIs related to service delivery, infrastructure progress, reform milestones, and public feedback loops.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Transparent &amp; Evidence-Based Governance:&nbsp;</strong>Enable real-time decision-making and citizen engagement through open-data platforms, grievance redressal tracking, and visualization of outcomes for accountability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Resource Mobilization &amp; Investment Promotion</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>Project Shelf &amp; Blended Finance:&nbsp;</strong>Curate a state-level shelf of investment-ready projects, and design financing models including blended finance, output-based aid, municipal bonds, and Viability Gap Funding (VGF).</li>\r\n<li><strong>PPP Ecosystem Development:&nbsp;</strong>Establish pre-approved templates, streamlined approval mechanisms, and risk-sharing frameworks to attract private investment across sectors.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Investor Facilitation Cell:&nbsp;</strong>Support investor interactions, anchor investor meets, and&nbsp;coordinate with national infrastructure pipelines and platforms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Best Practices Repository, Thought Leadership &amp; Partnerships</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>Knowledge Repository:&nbsp;</strong>Build and maintain a digital repository of national and global best&nbsp;practices, case studies, toolkits, and model documents relevant to infrastructure, reforms, and&nbsp;governance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>&nbsp;Strategic Collaborations:&nbsp;</strong>Facilitate institutional MoUs, working groups, and policy research partnerships with national think tanks, global development institutions, and technical bodies like NITI Aayog, NIUA, WRI, etc.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Innovation &amp; Capacity Building Platforms:&nbsp;</strong>Organize policy roundtables, solution&nbsp;challenges, bootcamps, and workshops to crowdsource innovations and scale up home- grown&nbsp;solutions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Regulatory Frameworks:&nbsp;</strong>Support the design of regulatory and operational frameworks for urban services, infrastructure development, and development administration in the State.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<p>The payment shall be made to the consultant monthly based on the submission of the Monthly&nbsp;Progress Report.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Milestone&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Payment</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\">Submission of Monthly Progress Report&nbsp;after completion of each month during&nbsp;contract period.</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\">Monthly payment will be&nbsp;made to consultant.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Important Note:</strong></p>\r\n<p>165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025 shall<br>be applicable to this EOI.</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the&nbsp;evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be&nbsp;entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed (face&nbsp;to face) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>Further, any deviation from proposal and resource CV submitted as bid response to this EOI&nbsp;would not be considered and would be duly ruled as rejection. Therefore, it is instructed to bidders that the actual resource who will be deployed for assignment should&nbsp;be present for interview (in person/Skype/VC).</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 18.3304%;\"><col style=\"width: 37.8405%;\"><col style=\"width: 43.7936%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><strong>50 Marks&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">Key Evaluation&nbsp;Criteria</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the Project</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed&nbsp;methodology for such specific&nbsp;kind of a project</li>\r\n<li>Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suitability of profile</li>\r\n<li>Years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Good understanding of project management best practices framework</li>\r\n<li>Ability to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</li>\r\n<li>Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</li>\r\n<li>Excellent communication abilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Agencies (SSU) are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals&nbsp;in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed&nbsp;to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of&nbsp;its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 18/07/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the&nbsp;above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per&nbsp;annexed format.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-11-11 12:51:29',4,1,'2025-11-11 12:49:38',35,'2025-11-11 12:51:29',NULL,'2025-11-11 12:52:48',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-11-11',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EOI) 2 nd Call for establishment of Strategic Support Unit (SSU) for Department of Good Governance and Convergence.','2025-07-09','2025-07-14','2025-07-18 00:00:00','2025-07-18 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-24',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/g273E0hNcmNDVeP8l9pgaNsgZ3MbkbTuRMx8CsuN.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,30416610.48,0,0,5474989.89,35891600.37,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (33,0,36,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/MARKFED/2025',1,'Project Management Unit (PMU) for Chhattisgarh State Co -operative Marketing Federation Limited Project','12','<p>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), the nodal agency of Department of Electronics &amp; Information Technology, Government of Chhattisgarh) is implementing the \" Project Management Unit (PMU) for Chhattisgarh State Cooperative Marketing Federation Limited\", as detailed in the Scope of Work and hence has envisaged appointing a Project Management Unit (PMU).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This section provides general information about the Issuer, important dates and addresses and the overall&nbsp;eligibility criteria for the parties.</p>\r\n<p>The objective of the assignment is to support/assist department for conceptualizing, designing and implementation of the different strategies initiatives for MARKFED in the state of Chhattisgarh. The successful bidder onboarded through this EOI shall act as a PMU and deliver on scope of work entailed in this document.</p>\r\n<p>CHiPS is inviting all Tier-1 empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/ Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',2,36,'2025-07-17 13:25:50',0,0,NULL,NULL,23080800,1154040,24234840,0,18,5,'<p>The Chhattisgarh State Cooperative Marketing Federation Limited, commonly known as MARKFED, is an apex-level federation of cooperative marketing societies in Chhattisgarh. Established on November 1, 2000, coinciding with the creation of the new state of Chhattisgarh, MARKFED plays a pivotal role in the agricultural sector of the state.</p>\r\n<p>MARKFED\'s primary responsibilities include the procurement of paddy under the Price Support Scheme, ensuring that farmers receive fair prices for their produce. Additionally, MARKFED supplies chemical fertilizers and plant protection materials to farmers, aiding in the enhancement of agricultural productivity. The federation also manages the storage and milling of procured paddy, ensuring that the produce is processed and stored efficiently.</p>\r\n<p>MARKFED aims to transform into a digitally empowered and market-oriented organization. By implementing advanced digital tools and platforms, MARKFED will enhance the efficiency of its procurement, storage, and distribution processes. This requires a series of initiatives to bring efficiencies, transparency, and enhanced monitoring.</p>\r\n<p>In addition, capacity-building initiatives will equip MARKFED employees with advanced skills in modern agricultural practices, financial management, efficient procurement, storage management, and the use of modern technology. These initiatives will also focus on enhancing data-driven decisionmaking and price discovery through digital platforms, ensuring a more effective and responsive organization. Expanding market reach through partnerships with various market players will open new avenues for disposal of agricultural produce.</p>\r\n<p>To achieve the desired objectives, it is important to set up the PMU with skilled resources responsible for conceptualizing, designing, and implementing various strategies. These strategies will range from commodity to cluster level, focusing on developing an ecosystem for implementation across the state. The PMU will ensure real-time monitoring and assist the department in steering the implementation of the project. Additionally, it will provide effective feedback on the implementation of the initiatives, enhance procurement and storage efficiency, utilize modern technology, enable data-driven decisionmaking, and facilitate price discovery through digital interventions.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The PMU is envisaged to support/assist department for conceptualizing, designing and implementation&nbsp;of the different strategies initiatives for MARKFED in the state of Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n<p>Initially, the engagement of PMU shall be for a period of a minimum of 24 months (TWO years), which can be further extended for another 12 months (ONE year) after review of performance. PMU will be work under the guidance of Managing Director, MARKFED.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<p>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The total duration of the Consultancy shall be 12 (twelve) months from the date of deployment of the personnel &amp; it may be extended on the mutually agreed terms &amp; conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Payment will be made monthly on submission of invoice in duplicate to the employer as per the agreed manpower services engaged for the project.</li>\r\n<li>For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligation in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n<li>The payment shall be payable after review of Project Review Committee.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>The committee shall review the projects and CV submitted along with the presentation and award the marking.</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 1px; height: 67.1874px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3958px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; height: 22.3958px;\">Area of&nbsp;Evaluation</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3958px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; height: 22.3958px;\">Total Marks</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3958px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; height: 22.3958px;\">Key Evaluation&nbsp;Criteria</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px; text-align: left; height: 22.3958px; vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the Project<br>Framework</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</li>\r\n<li>Prior experience in providing consulting/ advisory services for trade promotion / Strategy development</li>\r\n<li>Prior experience of drafting State and National level policies</li>\r\n<li>Prior experience in undertaking large transformation projects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; height: 22.3958px; vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suitability of profile</li>\r\n<li>Educational Qualification</li>\r\n<li>Years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Good understanding of scope of work</li>\r\n<li>Strong ability to understand and deliberate&nbsp;and report</li>\r\n<li>Excellent communication abilities</li>\r\n<li>Experience of Working in Government&nbsp;Projects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>The bidder receiving highest marking shall be considered for award of work.&nbsp;</p>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 01/08/2025, 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to<br>Chief Executive Officer<br>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), State Data Centre Building, Near Police</p>\r\n<p>Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001, Tel.: +91-771-4014158<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in&nbsp;</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of the proposed resources. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender&nbsp;number&nbsp; 65081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-11-11 13:35:48',4,1,'2025-11-11 13:33:04',36,'2025-11-11 13:35:48',NULL,'2025-11-11 13:36:18',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-11-11',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Project Management Unit (PMU) for Chhattisgarh State Cooperative Marketing Federation Limited','2025-07-17','2025-07-22','2026-04-08 11:00:00','2025-08-01 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-24',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/33fiaCtuyihcmxy5z5YCMAzBp6wslwwtgNn4St2w.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,19683564.52,0,0,3543041.61,23226606.13,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (34,0,69,'EOI/CHiPS/BharatNet/PMU/2024',1,'Selection of Consulting firm for setting up of Program Management Unit (PMU) for Bharat Net Project','12','<p>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), the nodal agency of Department of Electronics &amp; information Technology, Government of Chhattisgarh) is implementing the \"BharatNet Project\", as detailed in the Scope of Work and hence has envisaged appointing a Program Management Unit (PMU).</p>\r\n<p>This section provides general information about the Issuer, important dates and addresses and the overall eligibility criteria for the parties.</p>\r\n<p>The objective of the assignment is to provide assistance to CHiPS with advisory services, supervise and monitor for Bid management, designing and validation of infrastructure (active and passive), project execution and O&amp;M under BharatNet Project. The successful bidder onboarded through this EOI shall take over PMU responsibilities from existing PMU working on the project and deliver on scope of work entailed in this document.</p>\r\n<p>CHIPS is inviting all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',2,34,'2024-02-23 14:37:56',0,0,NULL,NULL,32780400,1639020,34419420,0,18,5,'<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\r\n<p>State of Chhattisgarh has to be practically re-imagined and reconstructed in a planned manner, if the hopes and aspirations of its people have to be fulfilled. To fulfill the aspirations of the people, following vision statement has been drawn up from the perspective of e-Governance, Electronics and IT:</p>\r\n<p>\"To develop Chhattisgarh as a knowledge society of global repute, with a focus on enhancing the quality of life of its citizens, through high quality education and health care, increased productivity in agricultureand allied activities, creation of requisite employment potential by promoting electronics and IT industries, and above all, by providing good governance.\"</p>\r\n<p>With the ever-increasing number of basic services getting delivered on digital infrastructure, universal access to Broadband is being viewed as a fundamental right of the citizens that needs to be provided by State.</p>\r\n<p>While access to broadband infrastructure within the Urban geographies is pretty much a reality, the rural economy remains largely deprived of this right, thus creating a huge so called \"digital divide\". This divideexists because of the absence of a viable business case for private sector to invest in building the requiredinfrastructure. Therefore, it is imperative on the Government to take lead in building a vibrant eco-systemfor delivery of digital services.</p>\r\n<p>While access to broadband infrastructure within the Urban geographies is pretty much a reality, the rural economy remains largely deprived of this right, thus creating a huge so called \"digital divide\". This divideexists because of the absence of a viable business case for private sector to invest in building the requiredinfrastructure. Therefore, it is imperative on the Government to take lead in building a vibrant eco-systemfor delivery of digital services.</p>\r\n<p>Chhattisgarh is the pioneer in developing a state enterprise architecture which can ensure integrated, coordinated and standards based e-Governance efforts across all government departments. The enterprisearchitecture helps ensure compatibility, timely and efficient service delivery through shared use of core databases and common infrastructure. A robust communications network as an information highway that connects not just the government departments and offices but also the citizens and businesses is a prerequisite for these efforts.</p>\r\n<p>Chhattisgarh has in the last few months made significant investments to deploy Digital India concepts ona war footing with rapid and startling results.</p>\r\n<p>GIS and geo-spatial data technologies can also be used to further the cause of rural population aiding them in benefitting from real-time data delivery pertinent to their livelihoods.</p>\r\n<p>These will be truly accessible to all homes in Chhattisgarh only if each of them has continuous access to video quality, high bandwidth internet available at home and over mobile. For example, Chhattisgarh is driving internet video content creation to implement the Prime Minister\'s vision of a digitally literate person in every home and for large scale skill up gradation.</p>\r\n<p>The Government of Chhattisgarh seeks to provide integrated services to its citizens and businesses. Enhancing the quality of healthcare and education and increasing productivity in the primary sector, secondary and tertiary sectors call for robust connectivity - connectivity of all Government functionaries and connectivity of the citizens to the Internet i.e. connectivity within the Government and connectivity with the Government.</p>\r\n<p>The development of high-tech industries like IT and Electronics, which is part of the vision of CHiPS, also demands the creation of infrastructure for providing high bandwidth on demand. Conversely, the availability of high band-width on demand is expected to attract the hi-tech industries and state-ofthe-art data centers and R&amp;D facilities to Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vision of Chhattisgarh Government</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Chhattisgarh Government is deeply aligned with the National vision of a Digital India and eager to make Chhattisgarh one of the first states to embrace and deliver this vision to the people of Chhattisgarh.Therefore, Chhattisgarh wants to establish Fiber infrastructure under BharatNet project up to the village level so as to spur economic development and to provide Integrated Services to the Citizens.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Approach</strong></p>\r\n<p>The approach is to facilitate building of a government-owned Fiber network infrastructure that can be used by the Central and State Governments for their purposes and/or through the internet service providers on an open, non-discriminatory basis to provide a wide spectrum of services and applicationsto the citizens.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Purpose</strong></p>\r\n<p>This EOI is raised with an intention to hire management experts (SMEs) for a Program Management Unit (PMU) to provide assistance to CHiPS and co-ordinate with MSI, TPA, PMC to supervise and monitor the project execution and O&amp;M under BharatNet Project. The PMU will operate from the location as desired by CHIPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>This phase of the project entails releasing the RFP and bid process management as mentioned below.<br>All the preparatory work such as identification and applying for ROW permissions, setting up the<br>project governance structure etc. shall also be carried out. The envisaged work of the PMU shall include<br>the following &ndash;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Assisting CHiPS in BharatNet Phase-2 program management.</li>\r\n<li>RFP preparation for selection of MSI for GP to Village Connectivity.</li>\r\n<li>RFP preparation for selection of broadband service provider for providing Broadband services&nbsp;at Block, Gram Panchayat and Village Level.</li>\r\n<li>Preparation of RFP for fiber leasing of Bharatnet Phase - 2 and BastarNet Dark Fibers.</li>\r\n<li>Support in preparation of RFPs for effective operation of Bharatnet Phase &ndash; 2 and Utilization&nbsp;requiredtime to time such as procurement of backup/alternate power, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Support for identification of routes for application of ROW permissions on the basis of&nbsp;desktop basedGIS survey for Phase-2 of BharatNet.</li>\r\n<li>Perform verification and certification of the work being done by the MSI and ensure compliance withspecified standards (only 2% onsite rest based on documentation of MSI and TPA).</li>\r\n<li>Strategy for dovetailing CGSWAN and BastarNet projects with BharatNet Phase-2.</li>\r\n<li>Preparation and Finalization of BharatNet Phase-2 NOC implementation strategy</li>\r\n<li>Validation of BharatNet Phase-2 architecture for both technology and fiber route provided by CHiPS wherever required.</li>\r\n<li>Support in setting up and maintaining of Project Monitoring tool and integration with BBNL\'s tool, as required.</li>\r\n<li>Support in Setting up the statewide project governance mechanism including manpower needs, communication, escalation and oversight mechanism, preparation of ToR, hiring process and HR Management.</li>\r\n<li>Coordination with BBNL, GOI for all project related issues.</li>\r\n<li>Strategy for Business modeling/monetization, and co-ordination with TSP for the same.</li>\r\n<li>Preparation of network utilization plan for BharatNet infrastructure in co-ordination with Govt. department, TSP/MSO/LCO etc.</li>\r\n<li>The PMU shall be responsible for Business development activities which would include leasing offiber to TSP/MSO/LCO etc. and bandwidth services to Govt. department &amp; institutions etc.</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<p>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following&nbsp;schedule</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreedempanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li>For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on itsobligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n<li>The payment shall be payable after review of Project Review Committee</li>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed current empanelment 2020 terms.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed (face to face/virtually through video conferencing) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>The evaluation criteria for this EOI will be as follows &ndash;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; height: 44.7916px; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9468%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9468%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3958px;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3958px;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>50 Marks&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 22.3958px; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>50 Marks&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the ProjectFramework</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed methodology for such&nbsp;specific kind of a project</li>\r\n<li>Prior experience in projectinteraction with&nbsp;senior government officials</li>\r\n<li>Prior exposure to implementing government&nbsp;projects in process re- engineering, if applicable</li>\r\n<li>Resource deployment at multiple government&nbsp;officesin multiple locations</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of key SLAsfor the project&nbsp;management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suitability of profile</li>\r\n<li>Years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Good understanding of project&nbsp;management best practices framework,&nbsp;if applicable</li>\r\n<li>Ability to negotiate/Persuade/Influence,if/as&nbsp;applicable</li>\r\n<li>Strong ability to understandand&nbsp;deliberate and report monitor the&nbsp;key SLAs</li>\r\n<li>Excellent communicationabilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this Eol document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this Eol Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to havebeen done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 04 March 2024, 17:00 hrs. Any response received&nbsp;after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to<br>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur 492001.<br>Email: ceochips@.nic.in,&nbsp;empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per&nbsp;empanelmenttender number 68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-11-11 14:45:37',4,1,'2025-11-11 14:44:51',34,'2025-11-11 14:45:37',NULL,'2025-11-11 14:45:58',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-11-11',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Program Management Unit (PMU) for BharatNet Project','2024-02-23','2024-02-27','2024-03-04 00:00:00','2024-03-05 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-24',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/fFM9wfj3dhaus5QGF8EcSkAw2I9wdlW50mmAuWBQ.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,71276871.69,0,0,12829836.9,84106708.6,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (35,0,27,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/CMDC/PMU/2025',1,'Establishment of Project Management Unit (PMU) for Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation Ltd','12','<p>The primary objective of this Project Management Unit is to enhance project implementation capabilities of CMDC. CMDC intends to engage a Consultancy Agency for deploying a dedicated Technical Team under its Project Management Unit (PMU). This team will assist the Corporation in carrying out various strategic and operational initiatives outlined in the Scope of Work. The deployment will be for an initial period of three years, extendable based on satisfactory performance and other terms specified in the Request for Proposal (RFP).</p>\r\n<p>CHIPS is inviting Tier-I all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025 to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>\r\n<p>Issuer / Address for business query and Correspondence<br>The CEO,<br>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur<br>State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur,<br>Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>',2,27,'2025-06-09 15:52:32',0,0,NULL,NULL,41559600,2077980,43637580,0,18,5,'<p>Chhattisgarh is the second most mineral-rich state in India, with a wide variety of valuable mineral resources. As the focus on industrial growth and infrastructure projects continues to increase, the demand for minerals is growing steadily across different sectors. This highlights the need for efficient and well-planned mineral management to support the state&rsquo;s development goals.</p>\r\n<p>The Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation Ltd. (CMDC), a wholly owned undertaking of the Government of Chhattisgarh under the MRD, was established in 2001 with the mandate of promoting commercial exploration and scientific exploitation of mineral resources in the state. CMDC has been granted mining leases for major and minor minerals, including key strategic minerals such as Bauxite, Iron Ore, Tin, and Corundum.</p>\r\n<p>CMDC also operates through joint ventures with public and private sector partners for the development of mineral blocks and downstream industries, supporting the state&rsquo;s broader economic and industrial growth.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The scope of work includes but not limited to the following activities:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Planning and Portfolio Development</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Support CMDC in defining its long-term strategic roadmap that reflects sector trends, policy shifts, and changing market conditions</li>\r\n<li>Provide strategic direction for scaling operations, enhancing revenue streams, and improving long-term resilience.</li>\r\n<li>Preparation of a Business Plan, Strategic Orientation, Business Overview &amp; Restructuring.</li>\r\n<li>SWOT Analysis of the Corporation&rsquo;s policies, practices and operations</li>\r\n<li>Preparation of a Business Plan for the Authority.</li>\r\n<li>Assess CMDC&rsquo;s current asset portfolio, conduct gap analysis, and identify bottlenecks in operationalizing non-functional blocks.</li>\r\n<li>Assist CMDC in streamlining regulatory issues and obtaining necessary clearances (e.g., EC, FC, land, mining plan) for timely operationalization.</li>\r\n<li>Identify adjacent sectors and business models to enhance revenue stability and improve longterm organizational value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Set up of Exploration wing for CMDC</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Support CMDC in setting up a dedicated exploration wing aligned with its growth objectives.</li>\r\n<li>Recommend the optimal operating model&mdash;internal, collaborative, or hybrid&mdash;for efficient and scalable exploration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Bid Process Management</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Preparation of draft Bid document (BID DOCUMENT) covering the following points:-</li>\r\n<li>Objective</li>\r\n<li>Scope of Services of the Bidders</li>\r\n<li>Bidding Process evaluation/award schedule</li>\r\n<li>Suggestion for Qualifying requirements</li>\r\n<li>Instruction to Bidders for submitting the technical, commercial and Financial Proposal;</li>\r\n<li>Description of the Technical, Commercial &amp; Financial Evaluation criteria;</li>\r\n<li>Formats for submission of Bid proposal by the Bidder;</li>\r\n<li>Design Formats of proposed contract to be signed by the selected Bidder and other&nbsp;Documents required for Bid process management (including any revision as per&nbsp;requirement) till signing of contract with the successful Bidder.</li>\r\n<li>Identifying Key Performance Areas (KPAs) for monitoring and evaluating the performance&nbsp;of the Party, including the methodology for monitoring KPAs.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>CMDC Management in finalizing the most efficient approach and also the capability&nbsp;assessment methodology to be adopted for selection of the Bidder and structure of Bid&nbsp;Page 6 of 12&nbsp;process.</li>\r\n<li>Drafting and submission of Draft Bid Document to CMDC for two stages bidding i.e. technical and financial. On approval of the Draft Bid Document, Consultant will assist in issue of the Notice Inviting Bid for selection of Bidder through press notification in newspapers and in company website by CMDC. The actual issue of the Notice Inviting Bid will be undertaken by CMDC. The cost of publishing the Notice Inviting Bid will be borne by CMDC.</li>\r\n<li>Make draft structure of Contract agreement for approval by CMDC. After receipt of the written approval of the CMDC, Consultant will assist CMDC during signing of contract with selected Bidder.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contract Management</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Development of model bid document for Selection of MDO (Mine Developer cum Operator) and Contractor for Mining and Marketing of minerals, Excavation/Ore raising, Exploration, Sampling and analysis etc. For this the following activities may be taken up in the process:</li>\r\n<li>Review of the existing model bid documents and agreements of CMDC, review of the projects of CMDC.</li>\r\n<li>Undertaking comparative study of CMDC tenders with the tenders of other PSU&rsquo;s in the sector like OMC, RSMC etc.</li>\r\n<li>Analyzing the reasons for poor response to the tenders issued by CMDC.</li>\r\n<li>Carrying out consultation meetings with various stake-holders and vendors.</li>\r\n<li>Review of the present methodology and development of an improved methodology for estimation of project cost for different contracts.</li>\r\n<li>Assessment of viability of mining projects currently available with CMDC and future projects as and when required.</li>\r\n<li>Identify &amp; support in implementation of initiatives for revenue augmentation.</li>\r\n<li>Assistance of appointed MDOs to receive statutory clearances for individual mining projects.</li>\r\n<li>It may be the case that data supplied by CMDC may require some editing, modification etc. that shall be managed by the agency. However, final write-up shall be approved and final decision shall be taken by the CMDC authorities.</li>\r\n<li>Prepare write-up for Brochures, Booklets, CD as promotional material.</li>\r\n<li>Consultant should assist CMDC in various events such as exhibition, seminars, preparation for foreign visit of CMDCGOC officers with reference relevant events.</li>\r\n<li>Joint Venture (JV) profitability and report on them and regular arrangement of working.</li>\r\n<li>Any other work/assignment related to contract management.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sales and Marketing</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Review the present marketing &amp; sales policy of CMDC and develop a revised policy as per the current market requirement. The following activities may be taken up in the process:</li>\r\n<li>Strength, Weakness, Opportunity and Threat (SWOT) analysis.</li>\r\n<li>Consultation meetings with customers.</li>\r\n<li>Carrying out Market Intelligence/ Outreach activities.</li>\r\n<li>Marketing and sale of extracted minerals including preparation of Mineral Sale Policy and periodic mineral price discovery to realize maximum value from resources:</li>\r\n<li>Study of Present pricing mechanism and identify challenges and opportunities  Benchmark with domestic and international pricing trends</li>\r\n<li>Assess existing marketing &amp; selling arrangements for CMDC</li>\r\n<li>Benchmark with other leading State Mineral Development Corporations</li>\r\n<li>Revise the marketing &amp; selling arrangements in line with market needs</li>\r\n<li>Preparation of Mineral Sale Policy</li>\r\n<li>Assist in development of marketing network for Iron/coal and other minerals for small/domestic consumption within Chhattisgarh.</li>\r\n<li>Developing a price discovery mechanism with reference to the practice followed at minimum three no. of Central and State PSUs, for various minerals produced by CMDC, for fixing an effective floor price for e-auction purpose.</li>\r\n<li>Analysis of outcome of e-auction based on the recommended floor price.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Resource and Asset Development</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Assist in the identification of mineral-bearing areas for future allocation and reservation under applicable laws.</li>\r\n<li>Support in planning and operationalizing non-functional leases by analyzing problems and implementing suitable solutions.</li>\r\n<li>Advise on prioritization and development strategies for assets across the value chain- from exploration to production.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Organization and Capability Enhancement</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Review and streamline the organization structure to ensure alignment with future growth areas and operational needs.</li>\r\n<li>Define roles, responsibilities, and accountability for all departments and field teams.</li>\r\n<li>Suggest plans to add required staff and build skills in key technical and strategic areas.</li>\r\n<li>Establish clear communication channels between departments and field teams with regular departmental review and performance assessment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Digital Transformation and Process Improvement</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Develop a roadmap for digital transformation and automation across business functions and operational sites.</li>\r\n<li>Implement centralized platforms for managing exploration, lease operations, approvals, and compliance tracking.</li>\r\n<li>Build dashboards and analytics tools to support real-time insights and informed decisionmaking.</li>\r\n<li>Digitize workflows to reduce delays, improve accountability, and provide visibility across Page 8 of 12 departments.</li>\r\n<li>Train staff on the use of digital tools, MIS platforms, and data analytics for smoother adoption.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Execution and Governance Support</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Provide program management support for ongoing and upcoming projects, ensuring alignment with timelines, budgets, and statutory requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in developing frameworks for monitoring and evaluation of third-party contracts, joint ventures, and operational partnerships.</li>\r\n<li>Support in designing procurement and contracting mechanisms that drive efficiency, transparency, and risk mitigation.</li>\r\n<li>Set up monitoring systems, review mechanisms, and escalation protocols to ensure accountability.</li>\r\n<li>Identify key performance indicators (KPIs) across business functions and establish mechanisms for their regular monitoring and review.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Commercial and Financial Support</strong>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Develop mechanisms to track revenue, cost, and profitability across projects and business units to enable data-driven decision-making.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in value estimation of resources and assets for internal decision-making, partnerships, or competitive bidding processes.</li>\r\n<li>Support transaction structuring, partnership evaluation, and tender management across business lines.</li>\r\n<li>Provide advisory on pricing, cost optimization, and financial viability of key business initiatives.</li>\r\n<li>Consultant shall act as Business Development Cell. In addition to this the Consultant shall also conceptualize and assist in establishment of Business Development.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<p>Payment to selected agency (PMU) for the scope of work done will be released as per the terms &amp;&nbsp;conditions of CHiPS empanelment agreement.</p>\r\n<p>Payment Terms and Conditions as mentioned below.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Payment Terms: As per Empanelment Agreement</li>\r\n<li>Milestones fixation &amp; Verification will be done by CHiPS.</li>\r\n<li>Payment (invoice) verification &amp; pass for payment recommendation to consulting firm will be done by CHiPS based on MPR (Monthly Progress Report) &amp; Attendance.</li>\r\n<li>Man-Month Rate will be as per the new empanelment rate effective from issued of work order</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; border-width: 1px; height: 22.3958px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3958px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; height: 22.3958px;\"><strong>Reason</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; height: 22.3958px;\"><strong>Description</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; height: 22.3958px;\"><strong>Penalty</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">Change of selected&nbsp;resources as part of this&nbsp;EOI&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">Any change of resource within 2 months from the deployment date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">2.0% of the work order value per event shall be deducted from the payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">Delay in deployment of resource</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">Any delay in deployment of the resource against the resource deployment plan as mentioned section 4 of this document</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">2.0% of the work order value per week shall be deducted from the payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed (face to face) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>Further, any deviation from proposal and resource CV submitted as bid response to this EOI would not be considered and would be duly ruled as rejection. Therefore, it is instructed to bidders that the actual resource who will be deployed for assignment should be present for interview (in person/Skype/VC).</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<p>Agencies (PMU) are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 24/06/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:<br>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-11-12 09:44:55',4,1,'2025-11-11 15:59:13',27,'2025-11-12 09:44:55',NULL,'2025-11-12 09:46:06',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-11-12',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EOI) for establishment of Project Management Unit (PMU) for Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation Ltd.','2025-11-11','2025-11-17','2025-12-03 00:00:00','2025-12-10 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-24',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/SXlyzaEVGUoJDJKR9kfDxsWKV8HslgWJxn1IVUSB.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,36002666.67,0,0,6480480,42483146.67,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (36,0,27,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/CMDC/2025',1,'Selection of Consultant for Conducting Internal / PreAudit and Management Reporting at Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation','12','<p>The primary objective of this consultancy engagement is to strengthen the financial and legal governance framework of Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation Ltd. (CMDC) by deploying a specialized team of financial and legal experts. The consultants will support CMDC in conducting internal/pre-audit reviews, ensuring compliance with applicable financial regulations and tax laws, improving financial reporting mechanisms, and providing legal advisory services related to mining operations. This initiative aims to enhance transparency, accountability, and efficiency in the Corporation&rsquo;s financial and operational processes, thereby facilitating sound decision-making and supporting sustainable mineral development in the state of Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n<p>CHIPS is inviting Tier-II all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Objectives to be Achieved Through the Consultancy Engagement</strong></p>\r\n<p>The consultant team will be established to achieve the following objectives:</p>\r\n<p>1. Ensure Financial Integrity</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Conduct internal and pre-audit checks to identify financial irregularities and strengthen internal<br>controls.</p>\r\n<p>2. Support Compliance</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Ensure adherence to applicable financial regulations, tax laws, procurement norms, and accounting&nbsp;standards.</p>\r\n<p>3. Enhance Financial Reporting</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Assist in the preparation, analysis, and review of financial statements and management reports for&nbsp;informed decision-making.</p>\r\n<p>4. Facilitate Legal Compliance</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Provide expert legal advice to ensure compliance with mining, environmental, and other regulatory&nbsp;frameworks.</p>\r\n<p>5. Improve Transparency and Accountability</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Review contractor payments, recoveries, and financial transactions to ensure adherence to contracts&nbsp;and policies.</p>\r\n<p>6. Assist in Strategic Projects</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Support financial due diligence, bid evaluation, and documentation during mineral block auctions&nbsp;and strategic initiatives.</p>\r\n<p>7. Strengthen Joint Venture Oversight</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Review financial performance and compliance of joint ventures and subsidiary companies.</p>\r\n<p>8. Promote Digitization and Record Management</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Maintain and update financial databases and ensure systematic documentation of financial and legal&nbsp;records.</p>\r\n<p>9. Mitigate Legal Risks</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Draft and vet legal documents, handle litigation support, and manage statutory submissions to&nbsp;minimize legal exposure.</p>\r\n<p>10. Enable Coordination with Stakeholders</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Act as a liaison between CMDC, consultants, government departments, and regulatory bodies on&nbsp;financial and legal matters.</p>\r\n<p>Issuer / Address for business query and Correspondence<br>The CEO,<br>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur State Data Centre Building,<br>Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001,<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 71-4014158<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>',2,27,'2025-06-09 10:29:11',0,0,NULL,NULL,14589600.24,729480.01,15319080.25,0,18,5,'<p>Chhattisgarh is the second most mineral-rich state in India, with a wide variety of valuable mineral resources. As the focus on industrial growth and infrastructure projects continues to increase, the demand for minerals is growing steadily across different sectors. This highlights the need for efficient and wellplanned mineral management to support the state&rsquo;s development goals.</p>\r\n<p>The Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation Ltd. (CMDC), a wholly owned undertaking of the Government of Chhattisgarh under the MRD, was established in 2001 with the mandate of promoting commercial exploration and scientific exploitation of mineral resources in the state. CMDC has been granted mining leases for major and minor minerals, including key strategic minerals such as Bauxite, Iron Ore, Tin, and Corundum.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The scope of work includes but not limited to the following activities:</p>\r\n<p>Key Responsibilities of Internal / Pre-Audit:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Develop and manage financial strategies and budgets for mining and mineral.</li>\r\n<li>Conduct Internal / Pre-Audit, internal controls, and compliance checks.</li>\r\n<li>Provide support for financial modelling, project cost estimations, and investment appraisals.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in the preparation and review of financial reports and annual financial statements.</li>\r\n<li>Support the department during mineral block auctions, especially in financial due diligence and bid evaluation.</li>\r\n<li>Consultant review the recovery of dues payable by contractor as per agreement.</li>\r\n<li>Consultant review of the payment to contractors as well as major purchases &amp; payments of CMDC according to the applicable rules and regulations notified from time to time.</li>\r\n<li>Consultant ensure in each payment that terms &amp; conditions of tenders and rate offers should be according to internal polices and applicable procurement law.</li>\r\n<li>Maintain and update financial databases, ensure transparency, and support digitized accounting processes.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure all necessary records, including stock registers, attendance registers, cheque ledgers, and other relevant books, are properly maintained.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure all kind of tax compliances.</li>\r\n<li>Review of Financial reports of Joint Ventures and Subsidiary Companies.</li>\r\n<li>Coordinate with stakeholders, consultants, and government authorities on financial matters.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any other areas/reporting/certification as may be required and directed by the Managing Director, CMDC.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Key Responsibilities of Legal Service Exper</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Provide expert legal advice on matters related to mining laws, environmental clearances, land acquisition, and regulatory frameworks.</li>\r\n<li>Draft and review contracts, MOUs, tender documents, mining lease agreements, and policy documents.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure compliance with MMDR Act, MCR, MCDR, Forest (Conservation) Act, Environmental Protection Act, and other applicable legislation.</li>\r\n<li>Represent the department in legal proceedings, hearings, and dispute resolutions related to mining projects.</li>\r\n<li>Liaise with government agencies, legal consultants, and regulatory authorities on statutory and legal matters.</li>\r\n<li>Provide legal input during policy development, implementation, and inter-departmental coordination.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Conduct legal risk assessments and recommend mitigation strategies.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Maintain records of ongoing legal cases, contracts, and regulatory submissions.</li>\r\n<li>Monitor updates in mining and environmental law and inform concerned authorities.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li>For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n<p>Important Note: All other terms and conditions of tender 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025 shall be applicable to this EOI.</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 20.2487%;\"><col style=\"width: 41.46%;\"><col style=\"width: 38.2558%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align: center; padding: 5px;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align: center; padding: 5px;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align: center; padding: 5px;\"><strong>50 Marks&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align: center; padding: 5px;\"><strong>50 Marks&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5px;\"><strong>Key&nbsp;Evaluation&nbsp;Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the Project</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed methodology for such&nbsp;specific kind of a project&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Prior exposure to implementing government&nbsp;projects in Bid Management and Exit&nbsp;Management</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of key SLAs for the project&nbsp;management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suitability of profile</li>\r\n<li>Years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Good understanding of project<br>management best practices<br>framework</li>\r\n<li>Ability to&nbsp;Negotiate / Persuade / Influence</li>\r\n<li>Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor<br>the key SLAs</li>\r\n<li>Excellent communication abilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 24/06/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-11-12 10:36:29',4,1,'2025-11-12 10:35:33',27,'2025-11-12 10:36:29',NULL,'2025-11-12 10:41:17',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-11-12',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Consultant for Conducting Internal / Pre-Audit and Management Reporting at Chhattisgarh Mineral Development Corporation','2025-06-09','2025-06-13','2025-06-24 00:00:00','2025-06-24 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-25',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/eFQ7t41aHCzJlxeKTgcBgMGp58h1e6DZy65mFiiN.pdf',NULL,0,2,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,12377805.85,0,0,2228005.05,14605810.91,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (37,0,37,'EOI/TPA/T&CP/2025',1,'Web Based Automated Layout Plan Screening and Approval System, Govt. of Chhattisgarh','3','<p>The objective of the assignment is to set up a Third Party Auditor (TPA) for the comprehensive evaluation and validate the compliance of the project deliverables concerning the Town &amp; Country Planning project (T&amp;CP). CHIPS is inviting all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No.68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020 dated 31/10/2020) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.<br>Issuer / Address for business query and Correspondence<br>Issuer<br>The CEO<br>Chhattisgarh infotech Promotional Society, Raipur State<br>Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil<br>Lines, Raipur,<br>Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001 Tel: +<br>91 &ndash; 771 &ndash; 4014158<br>Fax: + 91 &ndash; 771 &ndash; 4014158<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in<br>empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Website: www.chips.gov.in &amp; www.cgstate.gov.in<br>Address for EoI Submission and Correspondence<br>The CEO,<br>Chhattisgarh infotech Promotional Society, Raipur State<br>Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil<br>Lines, Raipur,<br>Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001 Tel: +<br>91 &ndash; 771 &ndash; 4014158</p>',2,37,'2025-04-03 11:27:44',0,0,NULL,NULL,3079800,153990,3233790,0,18,5,'<p>The main objective of the Directorate is to prepare regional plan and development plan in urban areas in different areas of Chhattisgarh in view of planned and coordinated development. To ensure the proper implementation of these schemes and to control the use of land and land development, technical guidance and issuance of development permit is also done by various offices of Directorate Town &amp; Country Planning.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>To understand the project TPA would be required to</p>\r\n<p>The Third-Party Auditor (TPA) will be responsible for the comprehensive evaluation and verification of the System Integrator\'s (SI) deliverables with respect tp ALBPMS project. The scope of work includes but is not limited to the following tasks:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Confirm the deployment of resources by the SI as per the approved project plan.</li>\r\n<li>Audit the SRS documentation and ensure that application is developed in accordance to SRS.</li>\r\n<li>Audit of all the Phases and its respective deliverables and its compliance.</li>\r\n<li>Submit a compliance report on the deliverables and payment of each phase.</li>\r\n<li>Validate the installation, configuration, and commissioning of Infrastructure requirement.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure that all deliverables meet the required standards following successful completion of the UAT.</li>\r\n<li>Audit the Go-Live process.</li>\r\n<li>Monitor and verify the implementation of the AMC and O&amp;M services, ensuring compliance with the&nbsp;Quarterly Guarantee Review (QGR) cycles.</li>\r\n<li>Perform a final audit at the contract\'s end, ensuring all obligations have been met before the System&nbsp;Integrator\'s exit from the project.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The TPA shall provide detailed reports and recommendations at each stage, ensuring transparency, compliance,&nbsp;and quality throughout the project lifecycle.</p>',NULL,'<p>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 6.82303%;\"><col style=\"width: 15.565%;\"><col style=\"width: 17.2708%;\"><col style=\"width: 12.9168%;\"><col style=\"width: 31.8593%;\"><col style=\"width: 15.4584%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px;\"><strong>S. No.</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Milestone</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Payment percentage</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>(of Contract Value)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Timeline</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Deliverable</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Penalty</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>1</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Phase 1 :- PreImplementation phase</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">20%&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">T+2 weeks&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Submission of Phase-1 Audit Report covering: Compliance report on all the deliverables as mentioned in section 3.3 and RFP.</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">2% of the Contract Value</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>2</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Phase 2 :- UAT Phase</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">20%</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">T+4 weeks</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Submission of Phase-2 Audit Report covering: - Compliance report on all the deliverables as mentioned in section 3.3 and RFP</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">2% of the Contract Value</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>3</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Phase- 3 Implementation Phase</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">20%</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">T+6weeks&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Submission of Phase-3 Audit Report covering: - Compliance report on all the deliverables as mentioned in section 3.3 and RFP.</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">2% of the Contract Value</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>4</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Phase-4 Operations &amp; Maintenance Phase &ndash; Exit Management</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">40%</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">As per QGR mentioned in RFP</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">Verification of QGR reports and its compliance against SLA mentioned in RFP.</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\">4 % of the<br>Contract<br>Value</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment for each phase is released only after the successful completion, submission, and approval of deliverables for that phase</li>\r\n<li>The TPA must provide detailed audit reports for each phase, which will be reviewed and approved.</li>\r\n<li>T = issue of Work Order Date</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Reason</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Description</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Penalty</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">Change of selected resources as part of this EOI</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">Any change of resource within2 months from the deployment date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">2.0% of the work order value per event shall be deducted from the payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">Delay in deployment of resource</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">Any delay in deployment of the resource against the resource deployment plan as mentioned section 4 of this document</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">2.0% of the work order value per week shall be deducted from the payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed (face to face) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>Further, any deviation from proposal and resource CV submitted as bid response to this EOI would not be considered and would be duly ruled as rejection. Therefore it is instructed to bidders that the actual resource who will be deployed for assignment should be present for interview (in person/Skype/VC)</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.036%; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 18.6605%;\"><col style=\"width: 48.0535%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.357%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top;\">Key Evaluation Criteria</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the Project</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</li>\r\n<li>Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of key SLAsfor the project management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suitability of profile</li>\r\n<li>Years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Good understanding of project management best practices framework</li>\r\n<li>Ability to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</li>\r\n<li>Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</li>\r\n<li>Excellent communication abilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 09/04/2025; 17:00 Hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:<br>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in,<br>empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number 68733/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/2020 dated 31/10/2020.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-11-12 11:43:06',4,1,'2025-11-12 11:41:16',37,'2025-11-12 11:43:06',NULL,'2025-11-12 11:44:21',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-11-12',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Third-Party Auditor (TPA) for “Web Based Automated Layout Building Permission Management System (ALBPMS) of Department of Town & Country ','2025-04-03','2025-04-07','2025-04-09 00:00:00','2025-04-09 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-06-25',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/cTYioErvTHxycDjxgSzjLF7OFoO1pPA3RYi43VHZ.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,954193.55,0,0,171754.84,1125948.39,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (76,0,62,'EOI/EMPL/CHIPS/MPSPF/SEC/2024',1,'Selection of Manpower in view of general elections 2024-25 under State Election Commission, Chhattisgarh','6','<p class=\"p1\">The Objective of assignment is to provide team of 05 Resources (02 Programmers &amp; 03 Assistant&nbsp;Programmers) with programming experience for technical support in the Election Commission&nbsp;as the upcoming general elections of municipalities and three-tier panchayats is to be held in the&nbsp;year 2024-25 (Month-December 2024 / January 2025).</p>',1,62,'2024-07-24 16:21:37',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"f0897b10-b9d0-48ef-b9ac-4ed729ecfc8b\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-2\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"fe4c830a-047a-4569-8912-9a79e3cdc716\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"363\">The Chhattisgarh State Election Commission is an autonomous and statutory body constituted in Indian state of Chhattisgarh for ensuring that elections in are conducted in free, fair and unbiased way. Constitution of India with provisions as per Article 243K and 243 ZA and Article 324 ensures creation and safeguarding of the powers of State Election Commissions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"653\">Chhattisgarh State Election Commission is responsible for conducting elections for Urban Local Bodies like Municipalities, Municipal Corporations, Panchayats and any other specified by Election Commission of India. Releasing election schedule. It is responsible for the following points:-</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"1235\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&bull; Issue notification containing guidelines for conducting elections for Municipal Corporations in State.<br data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\">&bull; Conducting elections for Municipal Corporations in State.<br data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"824\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&bull; Issue notification containing guidelines for conducting elections for conducting elections for Municipal panchayats in State.<br data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"954\">&bull; Conducting elections for Municipal panchayats in State.<br data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\">&bull; Laying guidelines for persons eligible to contest in elections for Municipal Corporations in State.<br data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1118\">&bull; Model code of conduct are following in elections for local bodies.<br data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1189\">&bull; Updating Electoral rolls with new additions.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>',NULL,NULL,'<p class=\"p1\">Scope of work for 05 posts are mentioned in Annexure-1.</p>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"249\">&bull; CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"427\">&bull; A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"574\">&bull; During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (WebEx Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"647\">&bull; The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-</p>\r\n<h1 data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"652\">&nbsp;</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"685\">Candidate Interview&emsp;&emsp;Max Marks</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"717\">1&emsp;Suitability of profile&emsp;&emsp;15</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"751\">2&emsp;Your relevant experience&emsp;&emsp;15</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"826\">3&emsp;Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework&emsp;&emsp;25</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"869\">4&emsp;Excellent communication abilities&emsp;&emsp;20</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"928\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">5&emsp;Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report&emsp;&emsp;25</p>','<p class=\"p1\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EOI document carefully before submitting their&nbsp;proposals in response to this EOI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall&nbsp;be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full&nbsp;understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response&nbsp;is 31/07/2024, 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected. The&nbsp;preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Raipur 492001 ceochips@nic.in , empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"27\">&bull; Signed copy of this EOI</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"78\">&bull; Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"278\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&bull; Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number 75436/CEO/CHiPS/EMPL/Manpower Service Provider Firms/2021 Raipur dated 01/04/2021.</p>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-16 16:57:28',4,1,'2025-12-16 16:46:38',62,'2025-12-16 16:57:28',NULL,'2025-12-16 17:00:40',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-16',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest for Selection of Manpower in view of general elections 2024 25 for State Election Commission Chhattisgarh','2024-07-24','2025-12-15','2024-07-31 17:00:00','2024-08-02 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-29',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/DgfhegR4xMs6BlPcreB2pkUZTYlqKJBWMnSU3hzI.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (77,0,63,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/SPMU/AMP/2025',1,'Selection of SPMU for Atal Monitoring Portal (AMP)','12','<p>CHIPS is inviting only Tier-I empaneled agencies (as per tender no 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',1,63,'2025-03-18 11:21:08',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<p>Atal Monitoring Portal (AMP) for Analytical Review of Projects across State to transform complex government data into compelling visuals. It gives the state administration a tool, which is needed to deliver real-time, dynamic project monitoring. It enhances the analytical capabilities through data collection by consolidating multiple data sources into one centralized, easy-to-access platform. It immediately identifies trends and quickly drilldowns into data to gain enhanced perspectives of the State level projects. AMP (CM Dashboard Project) displays information in an objective and quantifiable way that helps the district administration to see and understand not only its success, but also its pain points and areas in need of improvement.<br>AMP (CM Dashboard) is meant to provide State administration, at a glance, the status of different departmental activities with an architecture for presenting dashboard in respect to the monitoring of schemes at State level.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>a) Identification of services/ modules as listed in section 2.1 of this document<br>b) Identification of schemes/source data/KPI&rsquo;s for CM dashboard and Departmental Dashboard<br>c) Project Monitoring and coordination with districts, departments, CMO<br>d) Coordination with departments in defining KPI&rsquo;s, mapping source data for KPI&rsquo;s<br>e) Coordinate with districts collector and their team for dashboard and data entry portal<br>Page 6 of 9<br>f) Conclude discussion with nodal agencies (state/central) for API integration<br>g) Creating presentation and presenting presentation to various stakeholders of the AMP project<br>h) Review of work done by system integrator, validating data received from department and published in dashboard and portal<br>i) Unit, System and UAT testing of all the developed components<br>j) Validating work milestone completion and recommending payment as defined in TOR and work order for AMP project which is awarded to System Integrator.<br>k) Assist users in using dashboard and portal, coordinate and provide training to the users<br>l) Managing user licenses with the help of the SI</p>','<p>All other terms and conditions as per tender no 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Important Note: All other terms and conditions as per tender no 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.<br><br></li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).<br><br></li>\r\n<li>The marking of candidates Interview will be done as follows-\r\n<table>\r\n<thead data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"289\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"289\">\r\n<th data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S. No.</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"272\" data-col-size=\"md\">Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"476\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"493\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"595\">\r\n<td data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"502\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"578\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"595\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<td data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"604\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"683\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"700\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<td data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"709\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"785\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"802\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<td data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"888\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"905\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<td data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"990\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"925\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1007\"><strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"999\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.<br>The last date for submission of response with resume is 28/03/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:<br>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Resumes of resources that will face the interview</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-17 11:36:42',4,1,'2025-12-17 11:35:12',63,'2025-12-17 11:36:42',NULL,'2025-12-17 11:37:27',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-17',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of SPMU for Atal Monitoring Portal AMP','2025-03-18','2025-03-24','2025-03-28 17:00:00','2025-03-28 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-30',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/RMp2CNDzYJr8bO2VGraOWayTnON1XQc1H57glbPi.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (79,0,69,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/AWD/VC- NW/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower for Video Conferencing and Network Support under CGSWAN Project','24','<p>The objective of the assignment is to provide technical support for infrastructure and cloud resources under the CGSWAN Project, specifically for managing video conferencing and IT/network operations at CM House and CHiPS Office</p>',1,66,'2025-07-02 15:57:56',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>Video conferencing has become integral to government administration. A hybrid setup using MCUbased and cloud-based platforms has been implemented under CGSWAN. The selected agency will be responsible for managing video conferencing and network support at CM House, Vidhan Sabha, and CHiPS Office.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>Setup, operation, and technical support for video conferencing sessions (both MCU-based and<br>cloud-based).<br>&bull; Monitoring and first-level troubleshooting of network equipment.<br>&bull; Daily health checks and maintenance of VC and network infrastructure at assigned locations.<br>&bull; Coordination with service providers and stakeholders for link and equipment issue resolution.<br>&bull; Maintaining inventory records and documentation of VC/Network equipment.<br>&bull; Preparing routine IT/VC performance reports and logs for submission to CHiPS.<br>&bull; Supporting IT/network configurations under the guidance of the CHiPS technical team.<br>&bull; Any other task assigned by CHiPS.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<table>\r\n<thead data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"102\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"102\">\r\n<th data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"69\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"68\">Reason</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"87\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"86\">Description</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"102\" data-col-size=\"lg\"><strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"100\">Penalty</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"403\">\r\n<td data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"183\" data-col-size=\"md\">Delay in deployment of resource</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"327\">Delay in deployment of the team after the work order. Deduction applies if one or both resources are not deployed as per the agreed timeline.</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"403\">5% of the work order value per event shall be deducted from the payment.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"637\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.5131%;\" data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"427\" data-col-size=\"md\">Change in deployment</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.4135%;\" data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"561\">Any change in the deployment team after the work order. Deduction applies if more than one resource is changed as per the timeline.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.0734%;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"637\">20% of the work order value per week shall be deducted from the payment.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.2745%;\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"698\" data-col-size=\"md\">Unavailability of deployed resources without prior notice</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.5692%;\" data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"883\">If a deployed resource is absent from duty at CM House or CHiPS Office without prior written intimation of at least 2 working days, or without a justified reason acceptable to CHiPS.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.0768%;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"1025\">10% of the work order value per instance of unavailability shall be deducted. CHiPS also reserves the right to seek immediate replacement.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of<br>the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the<br>process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the Empanelled companies about their understanding of the<br>proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through<br>Online (WebEx Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>The marking of candidates Interview will be done as follows-<br><br>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"161\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"161\">\r\n<th data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"62\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S. No.</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"148\" data-col-size=\"md\">Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"379\">\r\n<td data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"279\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"366\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"379\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"488\">\r\n<td data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"475\" data-col-size=\"md\">Relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"488\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"598\">\r\n<td data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"497\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"585\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"598\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"707\">\r\n<td data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"607\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"694\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"707\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<td data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"804\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"817\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<td data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"826\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"913\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"837\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"926\"><strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"922\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in&nbsp;response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have&nbsp;been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms,&nbsp;conditions and implications.&nbsp;The last date for submission of response is Dated 10/07/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received&nbsp;after the above deadline will be rejected.&nbsp;The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State&nbsp;Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per<br>empanelment tender no. 160137 /CEO/ CHiPS/ EMPL/ Application and Website development/<br>2024 dated 18/10/2024.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-17 16:09:40',4,1,'2025-12-17 16:08:31',66,'2025-12-17 16:09:40',NULL,'2025-12-17 16:10:22',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-17',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower for Video Conferencing Network Support under CGSWAN Project','2025-07-02','2025-07-04','2025-07-10 17:00:00','2025-07-10 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-30',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/Ar0rZM0SSuEX3TjLjNbQtAQlm18ao7IxNAJ6tjON.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (80,0,70,'EoI/CHiPS/BharatNet/AWD/2025',1,'Engagement of Manpower under BharatNet phase II','24','<p>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS), the nodal agency of the Department of Electronics &amp; Information Technology, Government of Chhattisgarh, is implementing the BharatNet Project, as detailed in the Scope of Work. To ensure timely completion of the physical assessment and monitoring activities under the project, CHiPS has envisaged the engagement of additional manpower. This section provides general information about the Issuer, important dates and addresses, and the overall eligibility criteria for participating agencies. The objective of the assignment is to provide specialized manpower to assist CHiPS with advisory services, supervision, and monitoring of bid management; designing and validation of active and passive infrastructure; project execution; and operations &amp; maintenance (O&amp;M) under the BharatNet Project. The successful bidder, onboarded through this EOI, will deploy the required manpower to take over these responsibilities from the existing team and deliver the services specified in the Scope of Work.</p>',1,69,'2025-09-29 17:04:37',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<p>The approach is to facilitate building of a government-owned Fiber network infrastructure that can be used by the Central and State Governments for their purposes and/or through the internet service providers on an open, non-discriminatory basis to provide a wide spectrum of services and applications to the citizens.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>I. Validation: The activities carried out by the Third-Party Auditor (TPA) to validate technical standards as per contractual obligations for infrastructure related project of CHiPS such as BharatNet phase II, Bastarnet etc. <br><br>II. Coordination with Stakeholders: Collaborate closely with CHiPS and other stakeholders, to support and facilitate CHiPS in order to monitor and identify the need of Active &amp; Passive Infrastructure under Bharatnet phase II project for restoration of inactive network.</p>',NULL,'<p class=\"p1\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, selected <span class=\"s1\">bidder&nbsp;</span>shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.\r\n<p class=\"p1\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">The proposed candidates will be interviewed (face to face/virtually through video conferencing) by the CHiPS.</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The evaluation criteria for this EOI will be as follows &ndash;<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"146\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"146\">\r\n<th data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"75\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"74\">S. No.</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"102\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"101\">Evaluation Criterion</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"129\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"128\">Key Aspects Assessed</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"146\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"144\">Max Marks</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"336\">\r\n<td data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"259\">Communication Skills</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"330\">Clarity of thought<br>Articulation &amp; confidence<br>Listening ability</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"336\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"473\">\r\n<td data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"360\">Domain Knowledge</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"467\">Subject expertise<br>Practical application of knowledge<br>Awareness of latest developments in the field</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"473\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<td data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"478\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Problem-Solving &amp; Analytical Ability</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"597\">Logical reasoning<br>Creativity in approach<br>Decision-making under pressure</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"603\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<td data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"608\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Personality &amp; Demeanor</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"726\">Attitude &amp; adaptability<br>Professional appearance &amp; body language<br>Teamwork orientation</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"732\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<td data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"737\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"757\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ethical Awareness</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"821\">Integrity &amp; honesty<br>Values alignment with the organization</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"827\">10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<td data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"840\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"839\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"843\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"846\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"855\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p class=\"p1\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this Eol document carefully before submitting their proposals in&nbsp;response to this Eol Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have&nbsp;been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms,&nbsp;conditions and implications.&nbsp;The last date for submission of response is 13/10/2025, 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the&nbsp;above deadline will be rejected.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,Raipur 492001.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">Email: </span>ceochips@.nic.in</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-17 17:15:27',4,1,'2025-12-17 17:14:00',69,'2025-12-17 17:15:27',NULL,'2025-12-17 17:15:39',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-17',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','For Engagement of Manpower under BharatNet Phase 2','2025-09-29','2025-10-03','2025-10-13 17:00:00','2025-10-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-30',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/9m7SBwCqXuZqiZh3JlBkAksLRlijRKWb1HzNI5zh.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (81,0,68,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/MPSPF/BuilNXT.RERA & CSIDC\nProject/2022',1,'Manpower services for BuilNXT RERA and CSIDC Project of CHiPS','12','<p>CHIPS is inviting all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No.75436/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Manpower Service Provider Firms/2021 Raipur dated 01/04/2021)to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',1,68,'2022-02-21 17:40:26',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>CHIPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon\'ble Chief Minister heads the High Powered Governing Council of CHIPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br>CHIPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGP MMP\'s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOICE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM, GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia.<br>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHIPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to implement IT Services/ E- Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHIPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The scope of work to be undertaken by Software Developer domain level 4 &amp; level 5 is given herein after and the same is merely illustrative and not exhaustive. The Software developer domain level 4 &amp; level 5 position shall thus have to consider the required output and include all further incidental activities that may be necessary for efficient and successful implementation and for achieving the ultimate purpose of the assignment. The Scope of Work for the proposed engagement will primarily<br>consist of the following:<br>i. Software Developer is to ensure that the strategic and organisational objectives as well as the values of CHIPS are put into practice<br>ii. Software developer should be responsible for design, development and maintenance of the software applications requested by Department/CHIPS</p>\r\n<p>iii. Software Developer should provide reports as when required by CHiPS/Department</p>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHIPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of<br>the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the<br>process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through&nbsp;Online (WebEx Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"178\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"178\">\r\n<th data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"79\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S. No.</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"165\" data-col-size=\"md\">Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"396\">\r\n<td data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"296\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"383\">Suitability of Profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"396\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"505\">\r\n<td data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"492\">Relevant Experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"505\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"514\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"601\">Good Understanding of Design Development Best Practices &amp; Framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"614\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<td data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"710\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent Communication Abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"723\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"832\">\r\n<td data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"819\">Strong Ability to Understand, Deliberate, and Report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"832\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<td data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"928\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"852\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"941\"><strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"937\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this Eol document carefully before submitting their proposals in&nbsp;response to this Eol notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have&nbsp;been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms,&nbsp;conditions and implications.<br>The last date for submission of response is 24/12/2021. Any response received after the above deadline&nbsp;will be rejected.<br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to<br>CEO, CHIPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per<br>empanelment tender number 75436/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Manpower Service Provider<br>Firms/2021 Raipur dated 01/04/2021.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-17 17:58:46',4,1,'2025-12-17 17:57:56',68,'2025-12-17 17:58:46',NULL,'2025-12-17 17:59:02',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-17',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower services for BuildNXT RERA CSIDC Projects of CHiPS','2022-02-21','2022-02-23','2022-02-25 17:00:00','2022-02-28 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-30',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/EVFEwspymsjNbB1wmTWUY3EjI6BtCWpATn3fTnn9.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (82,0,65,'EOI/CHiPS/AWD/EPROC/2025',1,'Engagement of Resources for the e-Procurement Project','12','<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is inviting all empanelled agencies under Tier 2 (as per the Tender No. <strong>160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024</strong> <strong>dated 18/10/2024) </strong>to&nbsp;submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification,&nbsp;TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Issuer/</strong></span><strong> Address for business query and Correspondence</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The CEO,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh&mdash;492001</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: *91-771-401 41 58; Fax: *91 771 -40141581</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\">Email:</span>ceochips@nic.in<span class=\"s2\">,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>',1,65,'2025-08-05 12:36:29',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>This project covers various fields of e-procurement.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"132\"><strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"132\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"748\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) is the nodal agency and the key driver for advancing IT growth and implementing e-Governance initiatives across the State of Chhattisgarh. With a vision to transform governance through the power of Information and Communication Technology (ICT), CHiPS has been instrumental in successfully rolling out major projects such as SDC, AMP, SWAN, GIS, Aadhaar, NeVA, and e-Procurement. A professional and structured approach is adopted for project implementation, drawing on the expertise of e-Governance professionals, consultants from the corporate sector, and academia.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"1054\">To maximize awareness, ensure user adoption, and achieve the intended outcomes of CHiPS-led initiatives, the deployment of a dedicated Communications and Outreach Team is essential. This team will function as the central unit for strategic communication, user engagement, and implementation coordination.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1106\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1106\">Key Responsibilities of the Team Include:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1172\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1172\">Creating widespread awareness about the benefits of the project</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1225\">Driving adoption through targeted outreach efforts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1293\">Ensuring timely and effective communication with all stakeholders</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1298\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1648\">To support the smooth implementation and widespread adoption of various e-Governance Services portals such as e-Procurement, Citizen Services, GIS, AMP, and NeVA, a dedicated team will be responsible for creating user-friendly content, online help, and multimedia resources. This team will help users understand and use these platforms effectively.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1690\"><strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1688\">1. User Manuals &amp; Online Help</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1757\">Create step-by-step guides based on user roles for each portal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1816\">Include visuals like screenshots, flowcharts, and FAQs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1900\">Provide documents in both PDF and HTML formats, suitable for desktop and mobile</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1936\"><strong data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1934\">2. Knowledge Articles &amp; FAQs</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2023\">Develop web-based help sections or microsites that cover common questions such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2055\">How to register or log in</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2083\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2083\">How to bid in tenders</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2110\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2110\">How to use GIS tools</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2175\">How to raise service requests or solve connectivity issues</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2248\">Keep content updated regularly using helpdesk feedback and analytics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2281\"><strong data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2279\">3. Micro-learning Modules</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2325\">Create short tutorials in easy formats:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2432\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2382\">Text guides of 300&ndash;600 words or as per requirement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2432\">Videos of 2&ndash;3 minutes or as per requirement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2564\">Topics will include tasks like Bid Submission, Tracking applications, understanding GIS layers, or resolving technical problems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2602\"><strong data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2600\">4. Press Releases &amp; Media Kits</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2640\">Share official Announcements for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2662\">Portal launches</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2732\">New feature updates (e.g., GIS dashboards, Aadhaar integration)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2771\">Provide supporting materials like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2789\">Fact sheets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2815\">Executive summaries</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2857\">High-resolution images and graphics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2914\"><strong data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2912\">5. Video Content Production and Promotional Media</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3150\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"3060\">Turn technical steps into simple and engaging videos&mdash;such as how to register on the vendor portal, submit a tender, or use broadband services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3150\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3150\">Make sure all videos follow the same look and feel&mdash;logos, colors, fonts, and captions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3189\"><strong data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3187\">6. Training &amp; Onboarding Videos</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3403\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3323\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3248\">Create role-specific video series for different users:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3323\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3323\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3323\">Procurement officers, call-center staff, field teams, administrators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3403\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3403\">Include interactive features like chaptered playlists or as per requirement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3446\"><strong data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3444\">7. Promotional Clips &amp; Testimonials</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3592\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3592\">Short videos showing real success stories as per requirement&mdash;like improved internet access, faster tender results, or better citizen services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3667\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3667\">Include interviews with officials, departments, and actual users, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"3672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3788\">The scope of work mentioned above is not limited; additional tasks may be added as required under scope of work.</p>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"332\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"512\">\r\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"512\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"659\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"731\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows:<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"131\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"131\">\r\n<th data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"62\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"61\">#</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"114\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"87\">Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"131\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"129\">Max Marks</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"286\">\r\n<td data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"269\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"286\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"363\">\r\n<td data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"346\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"363\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"457\">\r\n<td data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"372\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"440\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"457\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"535\">\r\n<td data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"466\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"518\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"535\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<td data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"599\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"616\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p class=\"p1\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their&nbsp;proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice&nbsp;shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with&nbsp;full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of&nbsp;response is 20/08/2025. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS,&nbsp;State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in&nbsp;Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"4f06e796-fb77-4269-b6e0-af4a0d5d4f11\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-22\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"018cd385-2469-4a70-acb5-1617aa5632f2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-mini\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"300\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"107\">\r\n<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"107\">Signed copy of this EOI</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"300\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"300\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 12:42:26',4,1,'2025-12-18 12:41:15',65,'2025-12-18 12:42:26',NULL,'2025-12-18 12:43:01',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest for Engagement Resources for the EProcurement Project','2025-08-05','2025-08-12','2025-08-20 17:00:00','2025-08-25 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/UeMGuD6wBtl5H2Zq2brlYsDF1AzeJYgKAXPq3Aah.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (83,0,60,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/DPR/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower Services for DPR Project of CHiPS','12','<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is inviting Tier-II empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No-<strong>160137/CEO/ CHiPS/</strong><strong>EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024</strong> dated 18/10/2024 to submit a proposal based on</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment&nbsp;Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><strong>Issuer</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The CEO,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Civil Lines, Raipur,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Chhattisgarh&mdash;492001</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: *91-771-401 41 58; Fax: *91 771 -40141581</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Email: ceochips@nic.in,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>',1,60,'2025-05-06 13:33:05',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and&nbsp;prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e&nbsp;Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for&nbsp;Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and&nbsp;Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of&nbsp;Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT&nbsp;industry.&nbsp;<br><br>CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some&nbsp;mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM,&nbsp;GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using&nbsp;the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh&nbsp;Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year&nbsp;to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ E-Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"200\">Assistant Programmer &ndash; Level 4</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"804\">The Assistant Programmer will play a key role in the design, development, testing, and maintenance of software applications using modern technologies and frameworks. This position is ideal for candidates who have gained foundational experience in software development and are looking to advance their technical skills while contributing actively to critical projects. The Assistant Programmer will work both independently and under the guidance of senior developers and project managers to implement coding tasks, resolve complex issues, and ensure timely delivery of high-quality software solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"833\"><strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"831\">Key Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"1598\">\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"936\">Coding and Testing: Write and test programs, following coding standards and design specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1035\">Debugging: Identify and resolve errors in existing code, using debugging tools and techniques.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1155\">Documentation: Create and maintain documentation for programs, including user manuals and technical specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1248\">Data Management: Gather, organize, and process data to support programming and analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1351\">User Support: Assist users with software-related issues, providing technical support and training.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1453\">Maintenance: Maintain existing software systems, updating them as needed and addressing any bugs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1511\">Data Entry: Train and supervise data entry operators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1598\">Training: Provide training and refresher courses on data entry and software usage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1632\"><strong data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1630\">Skills and Qualifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1860\">Programming Skills and knowledge of Database: Proficiency in one or more programming languages (e.g., PHP, Laravel, CI, C#, ASP.Net, React.js, Node.js, JavaScript, CSS, Bootstrap, SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1935\">Analytical Skills: Ability to analyze problems and identify solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2019\">Attention to Detail: Ability to focus on the small details and ensure accuracy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2131\">Communication Skills: Good written and verbal communication skills to interact with users and team members.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2209\">Problem-Solving Skills: Ability to identify and resolve technical issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2286\">Collaboration Skills: Ability to work effectively in a team environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2365\">Knowledge of Computer Systems: Understanding of how computer systems work.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2451\">Project Management: Familiarity with project management principles and practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2528\">Data Entry Skills: Ability to perform data entry tasks and train others.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2549\"><strong data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2547\">Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2645\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2706\">3+ years of relevant experience in software development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2802\">Preference will be given to candidates with experience working in Government Organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2828\">Strong foundation in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2939\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2939\">Programming languages like PHP, Laravel, CI, C#, ASP.Net, React.js, Node.js, JavaScript, CSS, Bootstrap.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3024\">Database management systems such as SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3084\">Good analytical, debugging, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3102\"><strong data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3100\">Desirable:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3292\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3158\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3158\">Knowledge of version control tools like Git or SVN.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3212\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3212\">Familiarity with Agile development methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3292\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3292\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi (both written and verbal).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3297\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3332\">Assistant Manager &ndash; Level 4</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"4056\">The Assistant Manager will be responsible for supporting project management activities, team coordination, and administrative functions to ensure smooth execution of organizational goals. This role also includes key involvement in the design, development, testing, and maintenance of software applications using modern technologies and frameworks. The position requires individuals with strong organizational, leadership, and communication skills who can manage multiple tasks, assist senior management, and drive project timelines effectively. The Assistant Manager will work closely with various teams and departments, ensuring alignment of work, tracking progress, and supporting operational and technical objectives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4085\"><strong data-start=\"4058\" data-end=\"4083\">Key Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4850\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4086\" data-end=\"4188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4188\">Coding and Testing: Write and test programs, following coding standards and design specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4287\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4287\">Debugging: Identify and resolve errors in existing code, using debugging tools and techniques.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4407\">Documentation: Create and maintain documentation for programs, including user manuals and technical specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4500\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4410\" data-end=\"4500\">Data Management: Gather, organize, and process data to support programming and analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4603\">User Support: Assist users with software-related issues, providing technical support and training.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4705\">Maintenance: Maintain existing software systems, updating them as needed and addressing any bugs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4708\" data-end=\"4763\">Data Entry: Train and supervise data entry operators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4764\" data-end=\"4850\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4766\" data-end=\"4850\">Training: Provide training and refresher courses on data entry and software usage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4884\"><strong data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4882\">Skills and Qualifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"5780\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"5112\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4887\" data-end=\"5112\">Programming Skills and knowledge of Database: Proficiency in one or more programming languages (e.g., PHP, Laravel, CI, C#, ASP.Net, React.js, Node.js, JavaScript, CSS, Bootstrap, SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5113\" data-end=\"5187\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5187\">Analytical Skills: Ability to analyze problems and identify solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5188\" data-end=\"5271\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5190\" data-end=\"5271\">Attention to Detail: Ability to focus on the small details and ensure accuracy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5272\" data-end=\"5383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5383\">Communication Skills: Good written and verbal communication skills to interact with users and team members.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5384\" data-end=\"5461\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5461\">Problem-Solving Skills: Ability to identify and resolve technical issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5538\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5464\" data-end=\"5538\">Collaboration Skills: Ability to work effectively in a team environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5539\" data-end=\"5617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5541\" data-end=\"5617\">Knowledge of Computer Systems: Understanding of how computer systems work.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5618\" data-end=\"5703\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5620\" data-end=\"5703\">Project Management: Familiarity with project management principles and practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5704\" data-end=\"5780\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5780\">Data Entry Skills: Ability to perform data entry tasks and train others.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5782\" data-end=\"5801\"><strong data-start=\"5782\" data-end=\"5799\">Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"6114\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5804\" data-end=\"5897\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5898\" data-end=\"5958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"5958\">3+ years of relevant experience in software development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5959\" data-end=\"6054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5961\" data-end=\"6054\">Preference will be given to candidates with experience working in Government Organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6057\" data-end=\"6114\">Good analytical, debugging, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6116\" data-end=\"6132\"><strong data-start=\"6116\" data-end=\"6130\">Desirable:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6322\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6135\" data-end=\"6188\">Knowledge of version control tools like Git or SVN.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6242\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6191\" data-end=\"6242\">Familiarity with Agile development methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6243\" data-end=\"6322\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6322\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi (both written and verbal).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation&nbsp;of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.<br><br>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (Webex Link)/offline by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The marking of candidates Interview will be done as follows-<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"797\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"143\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"143\">\r\n<th data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"60\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"59\">#</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"126\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"85\">Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"143\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"141\">Max Marks</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"797\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"326\">\r\n<td data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"309\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"326\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"417\">\r\n<td data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"335\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"400\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"417\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<td data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"505\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework Management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"522\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<td data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"531\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"597\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"614\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<td data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"688\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"705\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"797\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"714\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"780\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"725\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"797\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"789\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p class=\"p1\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals&nbsp;in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed&nbsp;to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of&nbsp;its terms, conditions and implications.&nbsp;The last date for submission of response is 13/05/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the&nbsp;above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State&nbsp;Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">Proposed candidate&rsquo;s CVs</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 13:38:20',4,1,'2025-12-18 13:37:38',60,'2025-12-18 13:38:20',NULL,'2025-12-18 13:38:42',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for DPR Project of CHiPS','2025-05-06','2025-05-08','2025-05-13 17:00:00','2025-05-14 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/IrKkwMcD8tqXUell8xHBevX0bsEAb5vP09ICKv9n.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (84,0,90,'EOI/AADHAAR/AWD/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower for Aadhaar Enrolment and Update Services','36','<p>The objective of this assignment is engaging a professional and experienced manpower agency to recruit, deploy, and manage staff for the successful rollout and supervision of Aadhaar enrolment and update operations, including Aadhaar Centers as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,57,'2025-05-28 14:14:01',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"619\">The Unique Identification Authority of India (UIDAI) has appointed the Department of Electronics and Information Technology, Government of Chhattisgarh, as the Registrar for Aadhaar enrolment and update services in the state. The primary responsibility of the Registrar is to ensure that Aadhaar-related services&mdash;such as enrolment, demographic and biometric updates, and other associated functions&mdash;are carried out accurately, effectively, and in a timely manner, in compliance with the guidelines issued by UIDAI.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"886\">The Department of Electronics and Information Technology has designated the Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) as the Enrolment Agency. CHiPS plays a key role in the successful on-ground execution of Aadhaar services. Its main responsibilities include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<li data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"960\">\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"960\">Implementing Aadhaar enrolment and update services across the state.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1058\">Ensuring efficiency, transparency, and adherence to UIDAI standards in the enrolment process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1123\">Training and certifying enrolment operators and supervisors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1193\">Monitoring and inspecting enrolment centres to ensure compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1261\">Addressing grievances related to Aadhaar enrolment and updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"124\">1. State Coordinator</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<li data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"216\">Liaise with UIDAI Regional Office and CHiPS for guidelines, reporting, and compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"314\">\r\n<p data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"314\">Coordinate with Enrolment Agency-CHiPS and Registrars in the state for smooth implementation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"408\">\r\n<p data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"408\">Ensure continuous operation of Aadhaar Enrolment and Update Centres across all districts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"488\">Monitor performance of Aadhaar Centres and ensure adherence to UIDAI norms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"595\">\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"595\">Organize training programs for enrolment operators, supervisors, and verifiers as per UIDAI standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"691\">Use UIDAI dashboards and MIS tools to monitor saturation report, enrolment/update progress.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"754\">Generate and submit daily/weekly/monthly reports to CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"900\">Plan and execute special enrolment/update drives for vulnerable groups such as children, elderly, disabled, homeless, and tribal populations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"974\">Support Aadhaar enrolment in schools, anganwadis, old age homes, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1101\">Address complaints and grievances related to Aadhaar enrolment/update through proper escalation and resolution mechanisms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1166\">Ensure strict compliance with UIDAI data security protocols.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1297\">Coordinate with district administration, municipal bodies, panchayats, and schools for operational and administrative support.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1362\">Conduct periodic reviews and inspections of Aadhaar centres.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1430\">Take corrective action against EAs or operators for violations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1553\">Support Aadhaar seeding and authentication for delivery of state welfare benefits (e.g., PDS, scholarships, pensions).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1674\">Ensure all activities are conducted in accordance with the latest UIDAI circulars, advisories, and policy documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1715\"><strong data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1713\">Team Management Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1788\">Manage a decentralized team at state, division, and district levels.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1846\">Ensure clear reporting hierarchy and task delegation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1911\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1911\">Conduct regular review meetings and performance assessments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1988\">Maintain a roster of trained, UIDAI-certified operators and supervisors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2048\">Ensure accountability and discipline among field staff.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2112\">Handle re-deployment and quick resolution of staffing gaps.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2155\">2. Assistant State Coordinator</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"3228\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2258\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2258\">Assist the State Coordinator in executing Aadhaar enrolment and update services across the state.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2401\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2401\">Coordinate and support the planning of enrolment/update drives, camps, and special initiatives (e.g., schools, anganwadis, old age homes).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2502\">Maintain and monitor certification status of operators/supervisors and track their redeployment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2595\">Act as a communication bridge between the State Coordinator and Division/District teams.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2698\">Coordinate with CHiPS HQ, and local stakeholders to enable operational support and resolve issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2792\">Supervise and maintain up-to-date documentation, correspondence, and state-level reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2871\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2871\">Compile and verify field-level MIS reports and ensure accurate data entry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2962\">Coordinate grievance tracking and follow-up until resolution in line with UIDAI norms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3049\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3049\">Ensure proper documentation of trainings, attendance, and performance assessments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3130\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3130\">Support audit readiness through maintenance of physical and digital records.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3228\">Prepare official letters, internal circulars, memos, and summaries in both Hindi and English.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3233\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3274\">3. Assistant Division Coordinator</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"4929\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3383\">Oversee and supervise Aadhaar enrolment and update operations across all districts within the division.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3384\" data-end=\"3528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3528\">Act as a primary liaison between district coordinators and the State Coordinator, ensuring seamless communication and operational alignment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3689\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3689\">Plan, coordinate, and monitor division-wide Aadhaar enrolment drives, including those in schools, anganwadis, remote tribal areas, and welfare institutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3830\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3830\">Ensure uniform implementation of UIDAI SOPs and adherence to data security, enrolment quality, and reporting standards across districts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3943\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3943\">Provide timely and accurate performance updates, MIS reports, and escalation notes to the State Coordinator.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"4081\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4081\">Conduct field visits to district centres, monitor service delivery quality, address operational bottlenecks, and support local teams.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4082\" data-end=\"4191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4191\">Facilitate training and handholding of new operators and MTOs in coordination with district coordinators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4192\" data-end=\"4309\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4309\">Monitor district-wise operator availability, certification, and device allocation to avoid service interruptions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4425\">Support re-deployment of resources across districts as per requirement, ensuring coverage and minimal downtime.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4580\">Coordinate with divisional government authorities, UIDAI officials, CHiPS HQ, and local stakeholders to enable operational support and resolve issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4706\">Maintain a division-level inventory of biometric devices, laptops, and logistics used in mobile/static enrolment centres.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4707\" data-end=\"4836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4836\">Ensure grievance redressal mechanisms are followed at the district level and provide additional support for unresolved cases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4837\" data-end=\"4929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4929\">Participate in periodic review meetings and performance audits conducted by CHiPS/UIDAI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>Payment to selected agency for the scope of work done will be released as per the terms &amp; conditions of CHiPS empanelment agreement.</p>\r\n<p>Payment Terms and Conditions as mentioned below.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Payment Terms: As per Empanelment Agreement</li>\r\n<li>Milestones fixation &amp; Verification will be done by CHiPS.</li>\r\n<li>Payment (invoice) verification &amp; pass for payment recommendation to consulting firm will be done by CHiPS based on MPR (Monthly Progress Report) &amp; Attendance.</li>\r\n<li>Man Month Rate will be as per the new empanelment rate effective from issued of work order</li>\r\n</ol>',NULL,'<ul data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<li data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"329\">\r\n<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"329\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"510\">\r\n<p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"510\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"657\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"729\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows.<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"141\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"141\">\r\n<th data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"58\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"57\">#</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"124\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"83\">Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"124\" data-end=\"141\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"139\">Max Marks</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"324\">\r\n<td data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"242\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"307\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"333\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"398\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"509\">\r\n<td data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"492\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<td data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"518\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"584\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<td data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"676\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"693\" data-col-size=\"sm\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"775\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 13/06/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p>ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/application &amp; website/2024Raipur, dated 18-Oct-2024.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 14:22:32',4,1,'2025-12-18 14:19:54',57,'2025-12-18 14:22:32',NULL,'2025-12-18 14:22:49',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower for Aadhaar Enrolment and Update Services','2025-05-28','2025-06-03','2025-06-13 17:00:00','2025-06-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/e2BC49RISfcRVGOIJQZFohSilnx5cFsT26w1uSXs.pdf',NULL,0,2,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (85,0,64,'EOI/CHiPS/GIS/AWD/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower for State GIS Portal','6','<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">CHiPS is inviting all empanelled agencies under Tier 2 (as per the Tender No. </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated&nbsp;18/10/2024) </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed&nbsp;Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI for selection of&nbsp;Manpower for State GIS Portal.</span>&nbsp;</p>',1,59,'2025-12-18 15:29:38',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The objective of &ldquo;State GIS Portal&rdquo; is implementation of GIS/Geospatial technology in&nbsp;Chhattisgarh State for effective planning, monitoring, management of natural resources,&nbsp;efforts optimization, GIS capacity building among Departments and Development of GeoEcosystem.<br>This project aims to develop an integrated Geo-Portal and Mobile Application to provide&nbsp;streamlined access and management for various government services like e-District,Aadhaar, Atal Monitoring Portal (AMP), Town and Country Planning to provide Automated&nbsp;Layout and Building Plan Approval System (ALBPMS Portal), Chhattisgarh State&nbsp;Industrial Development Corporation (CSIDC) Portal and Mobile Tower management<br>system etc.&nbsp;Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for State&nbsp;GIS Portal a period initially for 06 (Six) months which is extendable.</span>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Below is the major scope of work highlighted but not limited to:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Development of Centralized Geo-Spatial database for all concern departments.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">To design, develop, and deploy a web-based Geo-Portal that integrates geospatial<br>data, enables visualization and Geo-Spatial analysis, and supports decision-making<br>for planning, monitoring, and public service delivery.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Fully functional GIS based mobile application (Android and iOS) for all concern<br>departments.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Admin dashboard and API design for data exchange between Geo-Portal and Mobile<br>App.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Ensure interoperability between portals and mobile app via secure APIs.</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">User Management (Admin, Field User and Viewer)</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Layer Management (Upload, Update and Publish)</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Query based functionality Development in Geo-Portal and Mobile application.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Geo Spatial Analysis</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">MIS Dashboard which can showcase department wise data</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of<br>the proposed area of work and their past experience if any, in a similar area of expertise.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed<br>through Online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows</span> -</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.9184%;\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"177\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"177\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 14.245%;\" data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"82\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S. No.</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 44.7293%;\" data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"160\" data-col-size=\"md\">Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 41.0256%;\" data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"177\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.7143%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"387\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.1748%;\" data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.3508%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"370\">Suitability of Profile</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.4744%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"387\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.8163%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.0465%;\" data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"396\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.7093%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"475\">Relevant Experience</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.2442%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"492\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 36.3265%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"597\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.04225%;\" data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.9538%;\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"580\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good Understanding of Design, Development Best Practices &amp; Frameworks</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 40.004%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"597\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 36.1225%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"702\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.64873%;\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"606\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.5691%;\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"685\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent Communication Abilities</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.0655%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"702\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.8163%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 6.28571%;\" data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.8246%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"791\">Strong Ability to Understand, Deliberate, and Report</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.8897%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"808\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.8163%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 6.30444%;\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.6956%;\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"896\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"828\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 40%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"913\"><strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"905\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 09/07/2025. Any response received after the<br>above deadline will be rejected. </span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001 ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</span>&nbsp;</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Signed copy of this EOI</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 16:08:24',4,1,'2025-12-18 16:06:34',59,'2025-12-18 16:08:24',NULL,'2025-12-18 16:08:54',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest EOI for selection of Manpower for State GIS Portal','2025-12-18','2025-12-17','2025-12-22 12:00:00','2025-12-23 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/1x7uSAXjhxNntTdbR69j2YuyEqFkFJjnIw1mUXHG.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (86,0,90,'EOI/CHiPS/ADR&EMPL/2025',1,'Selection of Skilled Technical Resources for Aadhaar & Empanelment Project','12','<p>CHiPS is inviting all empanelled agencies under Tier 2 (as per the Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,57,'2025-08-05 16:04:54',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>CHIPS is planning to have its own online Adhaar &amp; Empanelment Portal, which includes full details in scope of work.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"167\">Aadhaar Portal:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"283\">CHiPS is planning to develop its own online portal which should include the following modules and functionalities:</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"357\"><strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"357\">Development of Aadhaar Operator and Machine On-boarding Module:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"795\">This module has been developed as an end-to-end solution for the online processing of applications received by CHiPS for the appointment and onboarding of Aadhaar Operators under the Aadhaar Enrollment Agency (EA) &ndash; CHiPS. These operators will carry out Aadhaar enrollment activities across the entire state. The module also facilitates the online processing of machine activation requests received from various district administrations.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"838\"><strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"838\">Aadhaar Operator Payment Module:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1266\">This module serves the purpose of generating the commission for Aadhaar operators who are executing Aadhaar Enrolment activities under Aadhaar Enrollment Agency-CHiPS. The module will use Payment Gateway/Wallet systems to ensure online disbursement of operators\' incentives post reconciliation of the Aadhaar Generation report as per UIDAI\'s report. It will also help in reconciling payments made and penalties to be recovered.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1341\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1341\">Aadhaar ECMP/UCL Client Registration and Machine Mapping Module:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1585\">This module is used to store and manage the registration and operator-station ID mapping data of Aadhaar ECMP/UCL machines under Aadhaar Registrar-CHiPS across the state. Machine registration is done after the completion of the required steps.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1619\"><strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1619\">User Management Module:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1851\">The user management module provides the facility for mapping and un-mapping users, assigning specific rights/roles for users in the CHiPS Aadhaar portal for performing different activities related to the Aadhaar Enrolment division.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1896\"><strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1896\">Dashboards and MIS Reports Module:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"2048\">This module ensures the generation of Daily/Periodic MIS reports like Active Operators, Sync reports, Aadhaar enrollment done, Payments collected, etc.</p>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2083\"><strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2083\">Dashboard Requirements:</strong></h5>\r\n<p data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2131\">The dashboard will be in the following formats:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<th data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2159\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2143\">Type</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2200\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2172\">Purpose</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2296\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2295\">Strategic Dashboards</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2340\">For executives to make future strategies</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2408\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2368\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2366\">Tactical Dashboards</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2408\">Project monitoring/performance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<td data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2438\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2437\">Operational Dashboards</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2493\">Real-time or daily updates for ongoing transactions</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2518\"><strong data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2516\">MIS Reports</strong></h5>\r\n<p data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2610\">Tabular, periodic reports showing detailed data, and the view of the dashboard can include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2650\"><strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2624\">Charts</strong> (bar, pie, line, gauge)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2665\"><strong data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2663\">Tables</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2694\"><strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2694\">Trends and Comparisons</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2733\"><strong data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2733\">Grievance Management Module:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2911\">This module processes grievances received via the Chhattisgarh Aadhaar portal from different stakeholders like District Administration/Operators/CHiPS officials/UIDAI personnel.</p>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2945\"><strong data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2945\">Channel Access Method:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2977\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2977\">Online CHiPS Aadhaar Portal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3009\">Email: <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3007\">uidaichips@gmail.com</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3056\">Toll-Free Number: 1947 (24x7 UIDAI helpline)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3096\"><strong data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3096\">Types of Grievances Handled:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3143\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3143\">Delayed Aadhaar generation after enrolment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3199\">Incorrect data in Aadhaar (name, DOB, gender, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3246\">Authentication failures (eKYC, OTP issues)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3315\">Aadhaar not linked with services (e.g., bank accounts, LPG, PAN)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3318\" data-end=\"3345\">Biometric update problems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3384\">Denial of service by Aadhaar centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3432\"><strong data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3432\">Steps to Register Online Grievances:</strong></h5>\r\n<ol data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3978\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3518\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3518\">CHiPS Grievance portal may be accessed by Operator/EDM/State office/UIDAI staff.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3584\">Online Registration of Grievance with the following details:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3752\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3659\">Name, Aadhaar enrolment ID or Aadhaar number (optional for privacy)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3679\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3679\">Mobile/email</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3683\" data-end=\"3708\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3708\">Category of grievance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3752\">Description and attachments (if any)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3813\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3813\">Submit &ndash; system generates a Grievance ID/Ticket Number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3883\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3883\">Ticket Number will be shared with all stakeholders via Mail/SMS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3978\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3978\">Portal should accept SR number generated from UIDAI against the Grievance ID/Ticket Number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4014\"><strong data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4014\">Tracking and Escalation:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4124\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4036\">Track status via:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4124\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4056\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4056\">CHiPS portal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4081\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4081\">Email/SMS updates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4087\" data-end=\"4124\">Grievance portal with ticket number</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"4126\" data-end=\"4177\"><strong data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4177\">Timelines (SLA) for Grievance Resolution:</strong></h5>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4565\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<th data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4206\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4194\">Issue Type</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4240\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4231\">Resolution Timeline</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4565\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4366\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4333\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4324\">General Issues</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4366\">7&ndash;15 working days</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4463\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4406\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4405\">Biometric/Demographic Correction</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4463\">As per verification and update center processing time</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4565\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4464\" data-end=\"4501\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4500\">Escalations or Sensitive Cases</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4565\">May take longer, routed through Grievance Redressal Officers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4570\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4599\">2.2 Empanelment Portal:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4950\">The Empanelment Portal will be designed and developed as a comprehensive, secure, scalable, and user-friendly digital platform to automate and streamline the end-to-end empanelment process for various categories of vendors, agencies, consultants, contractors, and service providers engaged by different departments of the Government of Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4952\" data-end=\"4975\"><strong data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"4975\">Scope of Work:</strong></h4>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"4977\" data-end=\"5025\"><strong data-start=\"4983\" data-end=\"5025\">Requirement Analysis and Finalization:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5272\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5143\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5143\">Conduct detailed discussions with key stakeholders to gather functional, technical, and operational requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5272\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5146\" data-end=\"5272\">Prepare and finalize a Functional Requirement Document (FRD) and Software Requirement Specification (SRS) based on user needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5321\"><strong data-start=\"5280\" data-end=\"5321\">Design and Development of the Portal:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5674\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5463\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5463\">Develop a responsive, secure web-based portal conforming to GIGW (Guidelines for Indian Government Websites) and accessibility standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5464\" data-end=\"5522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5466\" data-end=\"5522\">Ensure cross-platform and cross-browser compatibility.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5674\">Design intuitive user interfaces (UI) and workflows for different user groups including applicants, department users, evaluators, and administrators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5710\"><strong data-start=\"5682\" data-end=\"5710\">Core Functional Modules:</strong></h5>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5712\" data-end=\"7165\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5712\" data-end=\"5818\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5712\" data-end=\"5818\">\r\n<th data-start=\"5712\" data-end=\"5753\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5714\" data-end=\"5724\">Module</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"5753\" data-end=\"5818\" data-col-size=\"lg\"><strong data-start=\"5755\" data-end=\"5772\">Functionality</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"7165\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"6061\">\r\n<td data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"5967\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"5928\" data-end=\"5962\">Online Empanelment Application</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"5967\" data-end=\"6061\">Submission of applications along with required documents by prospective service providers.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6062\" data-end=\"6219\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6062\" data-end=\"6114\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6064\" data-end=\"6113\">Document Verification and Evaluation Workflow</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6114\" data-end=\"6219\">Role-based workflows for scrutiny, verification, and scoring of applications by designated officials.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6355\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6261\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6222\" data-end=\"6253\">Approval / Rejection Module</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6261\" data-end=\"6355\">Online approval mechanism with automated notifications to applicants about status updates.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6356\" data-end=\"6498\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6356\" data-end=\"6397\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6388\">Empaneled Vendor Directory</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6498\">A searchable, categorized directory of empaneled entities available for reference by departments.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6499\" data-end=\"6640\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6499\" data-end=\"6540\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6536\">Renewal and Revalidation Module</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6540\" data-end=\"6640\">Provision for renewal requests, periodic revalidation, and updating of empaneled entity records.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6641\" data-end=\"6763\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6641\" data-end=\"6682\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6643\" data-end=\"6676\">Performance Monitoring Module</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6682\" data-end=\"6763\">Tracking and recording of empaneled vendor performance for future evaluation.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6764\" data-end=\"6895\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6764\" data-end=\"6805\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6766\" data-end=\"6793\">Dashboard and Analytics</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6805\" data-end=\"6895\">Department-wise and category-wise analytics with visualization and reporting features.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"7024\">\r\n<td data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6937\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"6920\">Audit Trail &amp; Logs</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"6937\" data-end=\"7024\">Complete audit trail of actions and transactions for accountability and compliance.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7025\" data-end=\"7165\">\r\n<td data-start=\"7025\" data-end=\"7066\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7027\" data-end=\"7050\">Grievance Redressal</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"7066\" data-end=\"7165\">Integrated grievance module for applicants and empaneled vendors to raise and track complaints.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"7167\" data-end=\"7201\"><strong data-start=\"7173\" data-end=\"7201\">Security and Compliance:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7202\" data-end=\"7454\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7202\" data-end=\"7300\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7204\" data-end=\"7300\">Aadhaar-based authentication and verification (optional, if needed for identity verification).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7301\" data-end=\"7331\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7303\" data-end=\"7331\">Role-based access control.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7332\" data-end=\"7454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7334\" data-end=\"7454\">Compliance with IT security best practices and Government of India guidelines, including provisions for audit readiness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"7456\" data-end=\"7499\"><strong data-start=\"7462\" data-end=\"7499\">Hosting and Infrastructure Setup:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7676\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7502\" data-end=\"7604\">Setup of secure hosting environment on cloud or on-premises infrastructure as per government policy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7605\" data-end=\"7676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7607\" data-end=\"7676\">Implementation of backup, failover, and disaster recovery mechanisms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"7678\" data-end=\"7719\"><strong data-start=\"7684\" data-end=\"7719\">Training and Capacity Building:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7720\" data-end=\"7873\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7720\" data-end=\"7793\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7722\" data-end=\"7793\">Preparation of User Manuals and Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7794\" data-end=\"7873\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7796\" data-end=\"7873\">Conduct hands-on training sessions for departmental users and administrators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"7875\" data-end=\"7905\"><strong data-start=\"7881\" data-end=\"7905\">Go-Live and Support:</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7906\" data-end=\"8061\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7906\" data-end=\"7993\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7908\" data-end=\"7993\">Migration to production environment after successful UAT (User Acceptance Testing).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7994\" data-end=\"8061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7996\" data-end=\"8061\">Post Go-Live technical support, troubleshooting, and maintenance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 data-start=\"8063\" data-end=\"8116\"><strong data-start=\"8069\" data-end=\"8116\">Maintenance &amp; Upgradation (Optional Scope):</strong></h5>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8117\" data-end=\"8338\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8117\" data-end=\"8246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8119\" data-end=\"8246\">Provide Annual Maintenance Support (AMC) covering bug fixes, minor enhancements, performance monitoring, and ensuring uptime.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8247\" data-end=\"8338\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8249\" data-end=\"8338\">Periodic security patches and updates in compliance with evolving standards and policies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"8340\" data-end=\"8362\"><strong data-start=\"8345\" data-end=\"8362\">Deliverables:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8363\" data-end=\"8665\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8363\" data-end=\"8447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8365\" data-end=\"8447\">Functional Requirement Document (FRD) / Software Requirement Specification (SRS)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8448\" data-end=\"8475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8450\" data-end=\"8475\">Wireframes / UI Designs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8476\" data-end=\"8515\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8478\" data-end=\"8515\">Fully functional Empanelment Portal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8516\" data-end=\"8546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8518\" data-end=\"8546\">User Manual / Admin Manual</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8547\" data-end=\"8580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8549\" data-end=\"8580\">Training for department users</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8581\" data-end=\"8618\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8583\" data-end=\"8618\">Go-Live support and stabilization</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8619\" data-end=\"8665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8621\" data-end=\"8665\">Maintenance and support services (as agreed)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8667\" data-end=\"8670\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8672\" data-end=\"8793\">This scope of work mentioned above is not limited, and additional tasks may be added as required under the scope of work.</p>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"246\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"426\">A presentation will be made by the Empanelled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"571\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"641\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"641\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows.<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"115\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"115\">\r\n<th data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"45\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"102\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"267\">\r\n<td data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"197\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"254\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"267\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"343\">\r\n<td data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"273\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"330\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"343\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<td data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"417\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"430\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"506\">\r\n<td data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"493\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"506\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<td data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"512\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"569\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"582\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 20/08/2025. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to &ndash;</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 16:12:58',4,1,'2025-12-18 16:10:20',57,'2025-12-18 16:12:58',NULL,'2025-12-18 16:13:29',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest for selection of Skilled Technical Resources for Aadhaar and Empanelment Project','2025-08-05','2025-08-12','2025-08-20 12:00:00','2025-08-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/ZjhscKYK6IkdMVPZX7bb9zXWX3bqXZw0BLWoSU7Q.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (87,0,90,'EOI/CHIPS/EMPL/Aadhaar Project/2025',1,'Aadhaar allied services Project of CHiPS','36','<p>CHiPS is inviting all empanelled agencies (as per the Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,57,'2025-05-09 16:49:44',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<p>CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. TheHon&rsquo;b1e Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br><br>CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGP MMP&rsquo;s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM, GIS and CSCs, Aadhaar (EA) &amp; (AUA/KUA). A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ E- Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"163\">As Android App Developer - 3 (Tier-I)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"490\">The Android Developer is responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining Android applications and systems using the Java programming language. This role includes working on both backend and frontend technologies, ensuring software solutions are efficient, scalable, and meet performance and functionality requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"517\"><strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"517\">Key Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<li data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"560\"><strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"558\">Android Application Development:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"638\">Design and develop Android applications using Java and Android Studio.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"692\">Write clean, efficient, and maintainable code.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"792\">Implement intuitive and responsive user interfaces using Android frontend design principles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"875\">Integrate applications with SQLite databases, APIs, and third-party services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"910\"><strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"908\">Backend/API Development:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<li data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"989\">Develop and maintain REST APIs and Microservices using Java frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1071\">Design efficient algorithms and data structures for optimized performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1156\">Ensure seamless integration between front-end applications and backend systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1189\"><strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1187\">Testing and Debugging:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1261\">Conduct unit testing and debugging to ensure robust performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1338\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1338\">Collaborate with QA teams to resolve issues and improve code quality.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1412\">Address bugs and implement fixes based on testing and user feedback.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1452\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1450\">Maintenance and Optimization:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1639\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1519\">Monitor application performance, security, and reliability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1564\">Update and maintain legacy codebases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1639\">Enhance existing applications to meet evolving business requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1682\"><strong data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1680\">Collaboration and Communication:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1800\">Work closely with cross-functional teams, including UI/UX designers, product managers, and backend developers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1877\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1877\">Participate in code reviews and contribute to team knowledge sharing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1969\">Understand and interpret project requirements through collaboration with stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1994\"><strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1992\">Documentation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2060\">Create and maintain comprehensive technical documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2152\">Prepare user manuals and system specifications for internal and external stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2195\"><strong data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2193\">Required Skills and Qualifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2839\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2288\">Programming: Strong proficiency in Core Java and object-oriented programming principles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2391\">Frameworks &amp; Tools: Experience with Android Studio, Java REST APIs, and Microservices development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2488\">Databases: Proficient in SQLite and familiar with NoSQL databases such as MySQL and MongoDB.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2586\">UI/UX Design: Knowledge of Android frontend design patterns and latest development practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2714\">Development Tools: Experience with tools such as Maven or Gradle, and IDEs like IntelliJ IDEA, Eclipse, and Android Studio.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2839\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2839\">Soft Skills: Strong problem-solving skills, attention to detail, and the ability to work in a team-oriented environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2875\">Java Developer-4 (Tier I)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2902\"><strong data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2902\">Key Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2937\"><strong data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2935\">Application Development:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3003\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"3003\">Develop J2EE-based applications as per CHiPS requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3117\">Build and maintain web applications, APIs, or Android-based solutions using Java Microservices architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3152\"><strong data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3150\">Application Maintenance:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3242\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3242\">Ensure timely maintenance of existing and newly developed Java-based applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3336\">Address bugs, implement enhancements, and ensure optimal performance on a regular basis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3368\"><strong data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3366\">Additional Expectations:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3648\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3474\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3474\">Stay updated on the latest technologies and best practices in Java Web/API/Micro Service development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3575\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3575\">Collaborate with cross-functional teams for seamless integration and deployment of applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3648\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3648\">Maintain documentation for all development and maintenance activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3669\"><strong data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3667\">Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"4253\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3790\">Conduct requirements gathering sessions with stakeholders to understand business objectives and elicit requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3849\">Analyze and document business processes and workflows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3917\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3917\">Translate business requirements into functional specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"4007\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"4007\">Perform gap analysis to identify opportunities for process improvement or automation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4092\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4092\">Experience of Java based software development for e-Governance delivery project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4164\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4095\" data-end=\"4164\">Knowledge and experience of service delivery and project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4193\">Proficient in MS Office.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4253\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4253\">Experience in handling proper Office File work desirable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4271\"><strong data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4269\">Desirable:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4367\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4367\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4367\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4372\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4418\">Full Stack Developer Level - 4 (Tier -1)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4671\">A Full Stack Developer is responsible for both front-end and back-end development, handling the entire flow of a web application. They work on all layers of an application, from designing the user interface to managing server-side logic and databases.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4698\"><strong data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4698\">Key Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"6819\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"5085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4731\"><strong data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4729\">Front-End Development:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"5085\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4799\">Develop and maintain the user interface of web applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4902\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4805\" data-end=\"4902\">Work with HTML, CSS3, JavaScript, and modern front-end frameworks (e.g., React, Angular, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"5007\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"5007\">Ensure that the web application is responsive, accessible, and provides seamless user experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5011\" data-end=\"5085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5013\" data-end=\"5085\">Integrate designs (from UI/UX designers) into functional front-end code.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5087\" data-end=\"5470\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5117\"><strong data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5115\">Back-End Development:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5121\" data-end=\"5470\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5121\" data-end=\"5199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5199\">Design and implement server-side logic using Laravel, Databases, and APIs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5314\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5314\">Work with programming languages like AngularJS, ReactJS, Node.js, to build the server-side of applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5318\" data-end=\"5388\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5320\" data-end=\"5388\">Develop APIs for communication between the front-end and back-end.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5392\" data-end=\"5470\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5394\" data-end=\"5470\">Ensure the scalability, security, and efficiency of the server-side systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5472\" data-end=\"5792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5501\"><strong data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5499\">Database Management:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5505\" data-end=\"5792\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5505\" data-end=\"5599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5599\">Work with databases like Oracle, MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, or other SQL/NoSQL databases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5603\" data-end=\"5704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5704\">Design and maintain the database schema, optimize queries, and handle data storage and retrieval.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5710\" data-end=\"5792\">Ensure that data is stored securely and follows best practices for data integrity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5794\" data-end=\"6149\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5833\"><strong data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5831\">Collaboration &amp; Communication:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5837\" data-end=\"6149\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5837\" data-end=\"5956\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5839\" data-end=\"5956\">Collaborate with designers, product managers, and other developers to define application requirements and features.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5960\" data-end=\"6052\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5962\" data-end=\"6052\">Participate in code reviews to ensure high code quality and best practices are followed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6056\" data-end=\"6149\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6058\" data-end=\"6149\">Work with version control systems, typically Git, to manage code changes and collaboration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6151\" data-end=\"6491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6154\" data-end=\"6185\"><strong data-start=\"6154\" data-end=\"6183\">Deployment &amp; Maintenance:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6491\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6189\" data-end=\"6275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6191\" data-end=\"6275\">Deploy applications on web servers and cloud platforms like AWS, Azure, or Heroku.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6279\" data-end=\"6388\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6281\" data-end=\"6388\">Manage the deployment pipeline, including continuous integration/continuous deployment (CI/CD) practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6392\" data-end=\"6491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6394\" data-end=\"6491\">Troubleshoot and maintain the application post-deployment, fixing bugs and improving performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6496\" data-end=\"6510\"><strong data-start=\"6496\" data-end=\"6508\">Testing:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6514\" data-end=\"6819\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6514\" data-end=\"6598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6516\" data-end=\"6598\">Write unit tests and integration tests to ensure code reliability and stability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6602\" data-end=\"6725\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6604\" data-end=\"6725\">Work with testing frameworks for both front-end (e.g., Jest, Mocha) and back-end (e.g., JUnit, Mocha, or Jasmine etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6729\" data-end=\"6819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6731\" data-end=\"6819\">Automate testing and ensure the application works across different browsers and devices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"6821\" data-end=\"6843\"><strong data-start=\"6821\" data-end=\"6841\">Required Skills:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6844\" data-end=\"7474\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6844\" data-end=\"6921\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6846\" data-end=\"6921\">Front-End Technologies: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Angular, or Vue.js.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6922\" data-end=\"6974\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6974\">Back-End Technologies: Laravel, Node.js, Python.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6975\" data-end=\"7051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6977\" data-end=\"7051\">Databases: SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MSSQL) and NoSQL (MongoDB, Firebase).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7052\" data-end=\"7119\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7054\" data-end=\"7119\">Version Control: Proficiency in Git for source code management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7120\" data-end=\"7198\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7122\" data-end=\"7198\">API Design: Experience in designing and consuming RESTful or GraphQL APIs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7199\" data-end=\"7301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7201\" data-end=\"7301\">Frameworks: Familiarity with frameworks like Express (Node.js), Django (Python), or Spring (Java).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7302\" data-end=\"7370\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7304\" data-end=\"7370\">Web Servers: Experience with web servers like Apache, Nginx etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7371\" data-end=\"7474\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7373\" data-end=\"7474\">Cloud Platforms: Understanding of cloud platforms like AWS, Azure, or GCP for hosting and deployment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7476\" data-end=\"7499\"><strong data-start=\"7476\" data-end=\"7497\">Preferred Skills:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7829\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7502\" data-end=\"7547\">Experience with microservices architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7548\" data-end=\"7627\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7627\">Familiarity with modern development practices like Software life cycle etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7628\" data-end=\"7713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7630\" data-end=\"7713\">Strong problem-solving abilities and knowledge of data structures and algorithms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7714\" data-end=\"7781\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7716\" data-end=\"7781\">Familiarity with mobile-first design and development practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7782\" data-end=\"7829\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7784\" data-end=\"7829\">Experience with testing frameworks and tools.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7831\" data-end=\"7853\"><strong data-start=\"7831\" data-end=\"7851\">Job Description:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"7854\" data-end=\"10501\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7854\" data-end=\"8168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7857\" data-end=\"7894\"><strong data-start=\"7857\" data-end=\"7892\">System Design and Architecture:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7898\" data-end=\"8168\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7898\" data-end=\"8092\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7900\" data-end=\"8092\">Design and develop scalable, secure, and high-performance solutions for Authentication User Agency (AUA) and Electronic Know Your Customer User Agency (KUA) &amp; Enrolment Agency (EA) services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8096\" data-end=\"8168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8098\" data-end=\"8168\">Create detailed architectural blueprints and technical specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8170\" data-end=\"8405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8173\" data-end=\"8202\"><strong data-start=\"8173\" data-end=\"8200\">Integration Management:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8405\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8327\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8208\" data-end=\"8327\">Ensure seamless integration of AUA/KUA systems with the Authentication Service Agency (ASA) and UIDAI infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8331\" data-end=\"8405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8333\" data-end=\"8405\">Develop APIs and middleware to facilitate communication between systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8407\" data-end=\"8643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8410\" data-end=\"8440\"><strong data-start=\"8410\" data-end=\"8438\">Compliance and Security:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8444\" data-end=\"8643\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8444\" data-end=\"8544\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8446\" data-end=\"8544\">Ensure solutions comply with UIDAI guidelines, data privacy regulations, and security standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8548\" data-end=\"8643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8550\" data-end=\"8643\">Implement robust security measures to protect sensitive data and prevent unauthorized access.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8645\" data-end=\"8859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8648\" data-end=\"8677\"><strong data-start=\"8648\" data-end=\"8675\">Technical Coordination:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8681\" data-end=\"8859\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8681\" data-end=\"8767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8683\" data-end=\"8767\">Act as the primary point of contact for technical coordination with ASA and UIDAI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8771\" data-end=\"8859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8773\" data-end=\"8859\">Facilitate regular meetings and communication to address technical issues and updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8861\" data-end=\"9105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8864\" data-end=\"8898\"><strong data-start=\"8864\" data-end=\"8896\">Documentation and Reporting:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8902\" data-end=\"9105\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8902\" data-end=\"9011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8904\" data-end=\"9011\">Maintain comprehensive documentation of system architecture, design decisions, and integration processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9015\" data-end=\"9105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9017\" data-end=\"9105\">Prepare and present regular reports on project status, risks, and mitigation strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9107\" data-end=\"9315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9141\"><strong data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9139\">Performance Optimization:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9145\" data-end=\"9315\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9145\" data-end=\"9248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9147\" data-end=\"9248\">Monitor and optimize the performance of AUA/KUA systems to ensure high availability and efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9252\" data-end=\"9315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9254\" data-end=\"9315\">Implement best practices for system maintenance and upgrades.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9317\" data-end=\"9624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9320\" data-end=\"9352\"><strong data-start=\"9320\" data-end=\"9350\">Stakeholder Collaboration:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9356\" data-end=\"9624\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9356\" data-end=\"9494\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9358\" data-end=\"9494\">Collaborate with internal teams, including developers, analysts, and IT support, to ensure alignment and successful project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9498\" data-end=\"9624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9500\" data-end=\"9624\">Work with external stakeholders (Sub-AUA / Sub-KUA), such as ASA and UIDAI, to ensure compliance and successful integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9626\" data-end=\"9819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9629\" data-end=\"9651\"><strong data-start=\"9629\" data-end=\"9649\">Risk Management:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9655\" data-end=\"9819\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9655\" data-end=\"9734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9657\" data-end=\"9734\">Identify potential risks and develop mitigation strategies to address them.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9738\" data-end=\"9819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9740\" data-end=\"9819\">Ensure contingency plans are in place for critical system failures or breaches.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9821\" data-end=\"10051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9824\" data-end=\"9853\"><strong data-start=\"9824\" data-end=\"9851\">Continuous Improvement:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9857\" data-end=\"10051\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9857\" data-end=\"9950\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9859\" data-end=\"9950\">Stay updated with the latest technologies, UIDAI guidelines, and industry best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9954\" data-end=\"10051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9956\" data-end=\"10051\">Implement continuous improvement processes to enhance system functionality and user experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10053\" data-end=\"10273\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10057\" data-end=\"10084\"><strong data-start=\"10057\" data-end=\"10082\">Training and Support:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10089\" data-end=\"10273\">\r\n<li data-start=\"10089\" data-end=\"10186\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10091\" data-end=\"10186\">Provide training and support to internal teams and stakeholders on new systems and processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10191\" data-end=\"10273\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10193\" data-end=\"10273\">Ensure users are well-equipped to handle new functionalities and system changes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10275\" data-end=\"10501\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10279\" data-end=\"10304\"><strong data-start=\"10279\" data-end=\"10302\">Problem Resolution:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10309\" data-end=\"10501\">\r\n<li data-start=\"10309\" data-end=\"10408\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10311\" data-end=\"10408\">Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues promptly to minimize downtime and service disruption.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10413\" data-end=\"10501\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10415\" data-end=\"10501\">Coordinate with ASA and UIDAI technical teams for issue resolution and system updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"10503\" data-end=\"10520\"><strong data-start=\"10503\" data-end=\"10518\">Experience:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10521\" data-end=\"10916\">\r\n<li data-start=\"10521\" data-end=\"10654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10523\" data-end=\"10654\">Work closely with IT and technical teams to ensure alignment between technology implementations and change management activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10655\" data-end=\"10753\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10657\" data-end=\"10753\">Support the integration of new systems and technologies with existing workflows and processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10754\" data-end=\"10861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10756\" data-end=\"10861\">Understanding of data privacy regulations and compliance requirements related to Authentication System.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10862\" data-end=\"10916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10864\" data-end=\"10916\">Familiarity with government policies and procedures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"10918\" data-end=\"10941\"><strong data-start=\"10918\" data-end=\"10939\">Technical Skills:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10942\" data-end=\"11189\">\r\n<li data-start=\"10942\" data-end=\"11041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10944\" data-end=\"11041\">Proficiency in system architecture design, software development, and integration methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11042\" data-end=\"11125\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11044\" data-end=\"11125\">Strong knowledge of API development, web services, and middleware technologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11126\" data-end=\"11189\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11128\" data-end=\"11189\">Expertise in security protocols and data protection measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"11191\" data-end=\"11209\"><strong data-start=\"11191\" data-end=\"11207\">Soft Skills:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11210\" data-end=\"11430\">\r\n<li data-start=\"11210\" data-end=\"11288\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11212\" data-end=\"11288\">Excellent communication, interpersonal, and stakeholder management skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11289\" data-end=\"11341\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11291\" data-end=\"11341\">Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11342\" data-end=\"11430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11344\" data-end=\"11430\">Ability to work collaboratively in a team environment and lead cross-functional teams.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"11432\" data-end=\"11451\"><strong data-start=\"11432\" data-end=\"11449\">Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"11452\" data-end=\"12326\">\r\n<li data-start=\"11452\" data-end=\"11583\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11454\" data-end=\"11583\">At least Minimum of 5 years of experience in solution architecture, system integration, and Software development &amp; maintenance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11584\" data-end=\"11659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11586\" data-end=\"11659\">Experience with Aadhaar authentication and KYC processes are desirable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11660\" data-end=\"11733\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11662\" data-end=\"11733\">Experience of software development for e-Governance delivery project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11734\" data-end=\"11820\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11736\" data-end=\"11820\">Should have knowledge and experience of IT service delivery and project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11821\" data-end=\"11872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11823\" data-end=\"11872\">Knowledge of executing IT Projects Min 5 Years.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11873\" data-end=\"11968\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11875\" data-end=\"11968\">Strong programming skills in languages such as Laravel/Other Required Framework or similar.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"11969\" data-end=\"12039\">\r\n<p data-start=\"11971\" data-end=\"12039\">Experience with integration platforms and middleware technologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12040\" data-end=\"12120\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12042\" data-end=\"12120\">Ability to integrate diverse systems, applications, and services seamlessly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12121\" data-end=\"12191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12123\" data-end=\"12191\">Deep understanding of cybersecurity principles and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12192\" data-end=\"12263\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12194\" data-end=\"12263\">Experience implementing security protocols and compliance measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12264\" data-end=\"12326\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12266\" data-end=\"12326\">Knowledge of database management systems (e.g., SQL, NoSQL).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"12328\" data-end=\"12344\"><strong data-start=\"12328\" data-end=\"12342\">Desirable:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"12345\" data-end=\"12440\">\r\n<li data-start=\"12345\" data-end=\"12440\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12347\" data-end=\"12440\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"12442\" data-end=\"12445\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"12447\" data-end=\"12488\">Assistant Manager Level - 2 (Tier -I)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"12490\" data-end=\"12512\"><strong data-start=\"12490\" data-end=\"12510\">Job Description:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"12513\" data-end=\"13440\">\r\n<li data-start=\"12513\" data-end=\"12598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12515\" data-end=\"12598\">Assist in the development and maintenance changes of project plans and schedules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12599\" data-end=\"12693\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12601\" data-end=\"12693\">Coordinate project tasks and ensure they are completed on time and meet quality standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12694\" data-end=\"12805\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12696\" data-end=\"12805\">Coordination with different stakeholders like state government departments, UIDAI, District administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12806\" data-end=\"12887\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12808\" data-end=\"12887\">Prepare and distribute regular project change status reports to stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12888\" data-end=\"12963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12890\" data-end=\"12963\">Ensure all project documents are properly stored and easily accessible.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"12964\" data-end=\"13057\">\r\n<p data-start=\"12966\" data-end=\"13057\">Facilitate effective communication among project team members, stakeholders, and clients.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13058\" data-end=\"13182\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13060\" data-end=\"13182\">Identify key stakeholders and develop a comprehensive communication plan to ensure all parties are informed and engaged.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13183\" data-end=\"13316\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13185\" data-end=\"13316\">Act as a liaison between different departments as UIDAI, CHiPs and PECs and teams to facilitate smooth implementation of changes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13317\" data-end=\"13440\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13319\" data-end=\"13440\">Work with various government officials to understand their requirements and prepare change requirement specs as directed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"13442\" data-end=\"13461\"><strong data-start=\"13442\" data-end=\"13459\">Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"13462\" data-end=\"13933\">\r\n<li data-start=\"13462\" data-end=\"13550\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13464\" data-end=\"13550\">At least 5 years of experience in a project coordination or management support role.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13551\" data-end=\"13656\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13553\" data-end=\"13656\">Analyze project data and provide insights to improve project change management &amp; project performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13657\" data-end=\"13743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13659\" data-end=\"13743\">Should have knowledge and experience of IT service delivery and project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13744\" data-end=\"13776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13746\" data-end=\"13776\">Proficient in MS Office etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13777\" data-end=\"13844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13779\" data-end=\"13844\">Knowledge of specific industry-related practices and standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"13845\" data-end=\"13933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13847\" data-end=\"13933\">Should have knowledge and experience of service delivery and project change execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"13935\" data-end=\"13951\"><strong data-start=\"13935\" data-end=\"13949\">Desirable:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"13952\" data-end=\"14047\">\r\n<li data-start=\"13952\" data-end=\"14047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"13954\" data-end=\"14047\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"14049\" data-end=\"14052\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"14054\" data-end=\"14095\">Project Associate Level - 1 (Tier -I)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"14097\" data-end=\"14119\"><strong data-start=\"14097\" data-end=\"14117\">Job Description:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"14120\" data-end=\"14481\">\r\n<li data-start=\"14120\" data-end=\"14231\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14122\" data-end=\"14231\">Coordination with different stakeholders like state government departments, UIDAI, District administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14232\" data-end=\"14313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14234\" data-end=\"14313\">Prepare and distribute regular project change status reports to stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14314\" data-end=\"14389\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14316\" data-end=\"14389\">Ensure all project documents are properly stored and easily accessible.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14390\" data-end=\"14481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14392\" data-end=\"14481\">Facilitate effective communication among project team members, stakeholders, and clients.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"14483\" data-end=\"14502\"><strong data-start=\"14483\" data-end=\"14500\">Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"14503\" data-end=\"14868\">\r\n<li data-start=\"14503\" data-end=\"14591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14505\" data-end=\"14591\">At least 3 years of experience in a project coordination or management support role.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14592\" data-end=\"14678\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14594\" data-end=\"14678\">Should have knowledge and experience of IT service delivery and project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14679\" data-end=\"14711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14681\" data-end=\"14711\">Proficient in MS Office etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14712\" data-end=\"14779\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14714\" data-end=\"14779\">Knowledge of specific industry-related practices and standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"14780\" data-end=\"14868\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14782\" data-end=\"14868\">Should have knowledge and experience of service delivery and project change execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"14870\" data-end=\"14886\"><strong data-start=\"14870\" data-end=\"14884\">Desirable:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"14887\" data-end=\"14982\">\r\n<li data-start=\"14887\" data-end=\"14982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"14889\" data-end=\"14982\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"429\">\r\n<p data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"429\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"576\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"646\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"646\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follow -<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"553\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"77\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"77\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"64\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"77\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"553\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"234\">\r\n<td data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"221\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"234\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"313\">\r\n<td data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"300\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"313\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"396\">\r\n<td data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"383\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding Design Development best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"396\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<td data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"462\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"475\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"553\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"540\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"553\" data-is-last-node=\"\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 26/05/2025. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"27\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"27\">Signed copy of this EOI</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"77\">\r\n<p data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"77\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"269\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"269\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 17:03:52',4,1,'2025-12-18 17:02:55',57,'2025-12-18 17:03:52',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:04:10',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for Aadhaar Project of CHiPS','2025-05-09','2025-05-13','2025-05-26 17:00:00','2025-05-26 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/gU79tvWWmIOpMPT3KcoKO41bS0UF64JZR4omdSF7.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (88,0,64,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/AWD/CGCOG/2025',1,'Selection of resources from Manpower Service Provider Firm for Chhattisgarh Center of Geo-Informatics Project of CHIPS','12','<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">CHIPS is inviting Tier-I &amp; Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per tender no&nbsp;160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024) to submit a&nbsp;proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and&nbsp;Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI</span></p>',1,59,'2025-04-28 17:31:30',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">CHiPS</span><span class=\"fontstyle1\">, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and&nbsp;prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;ble Chief&nbsp;Minister heads the High Powered Governing Council of </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">CHiPS</span><span class=\"fontstyle1\">. It includes Minister for Finance &amp;&nbsp;Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for&nbsp;Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp;&nbsp;Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br>The objective of Chhattisgarh Center of Geoinformatics (CGCOG) is insertion of GIS/Geospatial&nbsp;technology in Chhattisgarh State for effective planning, monitoring, management of natural resources,&nbsp;efforts optimization, GIS capacity building among Departments and Development of Geo-Ecosystem. It&nbsp;will help to optimize collection, collation, compilation and centralization of spatial data. This project will<br>facilitate Spatial Data Infrastructure (SDI) of Chhattisgarh State.<br>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for CGCOG a period&nbsp;initially for One (1) year which is extendable.</span>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Development of Chhattisgarh Center of Geoinformatics (CGCOG) at State&nbsp;Development of an open and interoperable architecture approach for implementing a &ldquo;Spatial&nbsp;Data Infrastructure (SDI)&rdquo; accessible to all authorized users.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Establishment of &ldquo;Geo Portals&rdquo; for State Government Departments.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Develop of data management, data visualization, and data dissemination strategies and<br>techniques, with a particular focus on the needs of state.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Centralization of geospatial data of various departments with standard schema designing and<br>cataloging.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Define Distributed SDI requirements by undertaking a technology workshop in Chhattisgarh; the focus of workshop will be at exchanging ideas and approaches on specific requirements, specifications, technology and products required.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Development of an Architecture document describing key architectural elements of Geo Portal<br>prototype.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">&nbsp;PM Gati-Shakti Project.&nbsp;<br></span></li>\r\n</ul>','<p>N/A</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Important Note: </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">All other terms and conditions </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">as per tender no 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application&nbsp;&amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process&nbsp;of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed&nbsp;area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise</span>.</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through&nbsp;Online (WebEx Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The marking of candidates Interview will be done as follows-</span>&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<thead data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"180\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"180\">\r\n<th data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"77\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S. No.</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"163\" data-col-size=\"md\">Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"180\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Maximum Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.6122%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"406\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.2745%;\" data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"302\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 72.549%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"389\">Suitability of Profile</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1765%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"406\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 35.8163%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.1111%;\" data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"415\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 72.9469%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"502\">Relevant Experience</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.942%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"519\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 36.1225%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 6.23229%;\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"528\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.7909%;\" data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"615\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good Understanding of Design, Development Best Practices, Framework &amp; Management</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.9769%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"632\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 36.6327%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"745\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.5419%;\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.5519%;\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"728\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent Communication Abilities</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.9062%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"745\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 36.9388%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"859\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 6.09418%;\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"754\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 75.5904%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"842\">Strong Ability to Understand, Deliberate, and Report</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 18.0384%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"859\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 37.1429%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.2534%;\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 66.0869%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"879\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 17.6596%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"964\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.<br>The last date for submission of response with resume is 07/05/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in<br>empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</span>&nbsp;</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Signed copy of this EOI.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 17:44:21',4,1,'2025-12-18 17:42:13',59,'2025-12-18 17:44:21',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:44:48',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','2nd call for Selection of resources from Manpower Services firm for State Chhattisgarh Center of Geoinformatics CGCOG Project of CHiPS','2025-04-28','2025-12-17','2025-12-22 12:00:00','2025-12-23 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/pKnhlGIj0EpTargOSW3WFgDUT9wahzuS7wGfTLg0.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (89,0,60,'EOI/CHIPS/EMPL/WCD/2025',1,'Manpower Services to engage skilled Technical Resource – Programmer to support Women and Child Development (WCD), Government of Chhattisgarh','12','<p>CHiPS is inviting all empanelled agencies under Tier 2 (as per the Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,60,'2025-05-15 17:33:04',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>The Department of Women and Child Development (WCD), Government of Chhattisgarh, is committed to the welfare and empowerment of women and children in the state. To enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of its programs, the department is integrating advanced technological solutions. In this context, the department seeks to engage a skilled Technical Resource &ndash; Programmer to support the development and maintenance of its digital initiatives.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"27c55d44-3bbb-4174-ae1b-ac2d8e8fec65\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-82\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ed5dde30-1ee3-461a-8148-2f9320a9dd28\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"940\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"122\"><strong data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"30\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Application Development:</strong> Design, develop, and implement web applications using modern frameworks and technologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"248\"><strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"149\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Database Management:</strong> Design and manage relational and NoSQL databases to ensure efficient data storage and retrieval.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"373\">\r\n<p data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"373\"><strong data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"271\" data-is-only-node=\"\">API Integration:</strong> Develop and integrate RESTful APIs to facilitate communication between different system components.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"501\">\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"501\"><strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"402\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Testing and Debugging:</strong> Conduct thorough testing of applications to identify and fix bugs, ensuring optimal performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"625\">\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"625\"><strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"524\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Version Control:</strong> Utilize version control systems like Git to manage codebase and collaborate with other developers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"778\"><strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"646\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain comprehensive documentation for all developed applications, including code comments, user manuals, and technical guides.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"940\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"940\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"799\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with other team members, including designers, project managers, and stakeholders, to gather requirements and deliver solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"429\">\r\n<p data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"429\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"576\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"646\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"646\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows -<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"794\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"112\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"112\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"99\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"112\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"794\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"340\">\r\n<td data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"231\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"327\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"340\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"453\">\r\n<td data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"345\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"440\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"453\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"567\">\r\n<td data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"458\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"554\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding Design Development best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"567\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"680\">\r\n<td data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"667\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"680\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"794\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"685\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"781\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"794\" data-is-last-node=\"\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 26/05/2025. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment Tender No. 160137/CEO/CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 17:38:40',4,1,'2025-12-18 17:37:21',60,'2025-12-18 17:38:40',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:38:53',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest for Manpower Services to engage skilled Technical Resource Programmer to support Women and Child Development WCD Government of ','2025-05-15','2025-05-20','2025-05-26 17:00:00','2025-05-26 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/u6CTYldcnYPHQHqw5DqXSo8rPJY1jyvXdpcpSs2T.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (90,0,64,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/TCP/AWD/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower Services for Town & Country Planning Project (ALBPMS) of CHiPS','12','<p>CHiPS is inviting Tier-I &amp; Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per the Tender No-160137/CEO/ CHiPS/<br>EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024 to submit a proposal based on<br>Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment<br>Duration as mentioned in this EoI</p>',1,64,'2025-04-03 17:41:55',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and<br>prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e<br>Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for<br>Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and<br>Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of<br>Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT<br>industry.</p>\r\n<p>CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some<br>mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM,<br>GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using<br>the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh<br>Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year<br>to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ E-<br>Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The Project Manager &ndash;is responsible for leading and managing projects related to Town and<br>Country Planning ensuring successful execution from initiation to completion. This role involves<br>coordinating with various stakeholders, including government bodies, clients, vendors, and internal<br>teams, to ensure compliance with ALBPMS application and project specifications. The manager<br>will develop project plans, allocate resources, monitor progress, mitigate risks, and ensure timely<br>delivery within budget and quality parameters.<br>Additionally, the role requires overseeing SLAs, CRs and reporting to ensure that all empanelment<br>projects align with regulatory standards and organizational goals. The ideal candidate will have a<br>strong understanding of project management principles, excellent problem-solving skills, and the<br>ability to handle multiple projects simultaneously&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation<br>of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the<br>process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the<br>proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through<br>Online (Webex Link)/offline by the Evaluation Committee.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The marking of candidates Interview will be done as follows-</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th align=\"right\">S. No.</th>\r\n<th>Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th align=\"right\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n<td>Suitability of Profile</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n<td>Relevant Experience</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n<td>Good Understanding of Design Development Best Practices &amp; Framework Management</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"right\">4</td>\r\n<td>Excellent Communication Abilities</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"right\">5</td>\r\n<td>Strong Ability to Understand, Deliberate, and Report</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"right\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td align=\"right\"><strong>100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals<br>in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed<br>to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of<br>its terms, conditions and implications.&nbsp;<br>The last date for submission of response is 11/04/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the<br>above deadline will be rejected.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State<br>Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001<br>ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<p>Signed copy of this EOI&nbsp;<br>Proposed candidates CVs&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 17:57:39',4,1,'2025-12-18 17:54:29',64,'2025-12-18 17:57:39',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:59:38',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for Town and Country Planning Project  ALBPMS of CHiPS','2025-04-03','2025-04-07','2025-04-11 17:00:00','2025-04-11 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/RMEXou9WkOlMS0gPdfBQDo9u2fJP3Lg87JSD47Dc.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'3,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (91,0,59,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/AWD/FRA-P-Atlas/2025',1,'Selection of resources for FRA Potential Atlas and Geo-Portal  development Project of CHIPS','12','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">CHIPS is inviting Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per no 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI</p>',1,59,'2025-05-29 17:56:30',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>The Forest Rights Act (FRA), enacted by the Government of India in 2006, is a landmark legislation aimed at recognizing and vesting forest rights and occupation rights in forest-dwelling communities. The Act seeks to correct historical injustices, empower marginalized communities, and promote sustainable forest management. Forest Rights Act, 2006, represents a significant milestone in India\'s efforts towards inclusive and sustainable forest governance. By recognizing and empowering forest-dwelling communities, the Act not only upholds the rights and dignity of marginalized groups but also contributes to the conservation of biodiversity and the promotion of sustainable development. Its successful&nbsp;<br>implementation is crucial for achieving social justice, environmental conservation, and inclusive growth in forested regions across the country.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>Centralization of geospatial data of various Projects with standard scheme designing and cataloging. &nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Develop data management, data visualization, and data dissemination strategies and techniques, with a particular focus on the needs of the department.</li>\r\n<li>Development of &ldquo;Geo Portal&rdquo; for Department. &nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Training sessions for department officials and users to use Geo-portal.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the Empanelled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed through Online (WebEx Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li>The marking of candidates Interview will be done as follows-&nbsp;<br>\r\n<div class=\"prose dark:prose-invert inline leading-relaxed break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word] prose-strong:font-medium [&amp;_&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\">Candidate Interview 1 - Suitability Criteria</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group relative\">\r\n<div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto md:max-w-[90vw] border-subtlest ring-subtlest divide-subtlest bg-transparent\">\r\n<table class=\"border-subtler my-[1em] w-full table-auto border-separate border-spacing-0 border-l border-t\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead class=\"bg-subtler\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"border-subtler p-sm break-normal border-b border-r text-left align-top\">S.No.</th>\r\n<th class=\"border-subtler p-sm break-normal border-b border-r text-left align-top\">Criteria</th>\r\n<th class=\"border-subtler p-sm break-normal border-b border-r text-left align-top\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">1</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">2</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">3</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">Good understanding of Design Development best practices &amp; framework</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">4</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">5</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"px-sm border-subtler min-w-[48px] break-normal border-b border-r\"><strong>77</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-base border-subtler shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex rounded-lg border opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100 [&amp;&gt;*:not(:first-child)]:border-subtle [&amp;&gt;*:not(:first-child)]:border-l\">\r\n<div class=\"flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center min-w-0 gap-two justify-center\">\r\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center size-4\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center min-w-0 gap-two justify-center\">\r\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center size-4\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in&nbsp;<br>response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have&nbsp;<br>been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms,&nbsp;<br>conditions and implications.&nbsp;<br><br>The last date for submission of response is Dated:13/06/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received&nbsp;<br>after the above deadline will be rejected.&nbsp;<br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to&nbsp;<br>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001&nbsp;<br>ceochips@nic.in&nbsp;<br>empl.chips@cgchips.in&nbsp;<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-18 18:17:11',4,1,'2025-12-18 18:14:21',59,'2025-12-18 18:17:11',NULL,'2025-12-18 18:18:22',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-18',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of resources for FRA Potential Atlas and Geo Portal development Project of CHIPS','2025-05-29','2025-06-04','2025-06-13 17:00:00','2025-06-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-07-31',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/6hqfXIG4B5Uz1vsnZCYDfgTRdUkRhoaipziVV7B6.pdf',NULL,0,2,1,0,'14,15,16',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (92,0,62,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/AWD/2025',1,'Empanelment Project of CHiPS','12','<p>CHiPS is inviting only Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per the Tender No-160137/CEO/ CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024 to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,62,'2025-03-19 23:21:07',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br><br>CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM, GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ EGovernance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>Project Manager, Level -15 The Project Manager &ndash; Project Management (Empanelment Projects) is responsible for leading and managing projects related to empanelment, ensuring successful execution from initiation to completion. This role involves coordinating with various stakeholders, including government bodies, clients, vendors, and internal teams, to ensure compliance with empanelment requirements and project specifications. The manager will develop project plans, allocate resources, monitor progress, mitigate risks, and ensure timely delivery within budget and quality parameters. Additionally, the role requires overseeing documentation, contracts, and reporting to ensure that all empanelment projects align with regulatory standards and organizational goals. The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of project management principles, excellent problemsolving skills, and the ability to handle multiple projects simultaneously<br><br></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"999\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"179\">\r\n<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"179\"><strong data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"56\">Project Planning &amp; Execution:</strong><br data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"59\">Develop project plans, timelines, and budgets for empanelment-based projects, ensuring adherence to scope and quality.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"311\">\r\n<p data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"311\"><strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"212\">Stakeholder Coordination:</strong><br data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"215\">Collaborate with clients, vendors, and internal teams to align project goals and deliverables.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"464\">\r\n<p data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"464\"><strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"346\">Compliance &amp; Documentation:</strong><br data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"349\">Ensure all projects meet regulatory and organizational compliance requirements, maintaining proper documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"591\"><strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"488\">Risk Management:</strong><br data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"491\">Identify potential risks and implement mitigation strategies to ensure seamless project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"739\"><strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"622\">Monitoring &amp; Reporting:</strong><br data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\">Track project progress, prepare reports, and provide updates to leadership on key performance indicators (KPIs).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"863\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"769\">Resource Optimization:</strong><br data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\">Allocate and manage resources efficiently to meet project deadlines and cost constraints.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"999\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"999\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"891\">Process Improvement:</strong><br data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"894\">Implement best practices and continuous improvement initiatives to enhance project delivery efficiency.<br><br></p>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"9d986429-fdce-46a0-bdb9-b4c279c47b3a\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-4\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d470587c-b8c5-4ced-8cef-f8d558e6bc44\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"351\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"129\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in project management, Business Administration, Engineering, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"222\">\r\n<p data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"222\">10+ years of experience in project management, preferably in empanelment-based projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"284\">\r\n<p data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"284\">Strong understanding of project management methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"351\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"351\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Excellent leadership, communication, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><strong>Desirable:</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi<br><br>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"51\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"51\">Assistant Manager (Technical Expert), Level &ndash; 7</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"488\">The Assistant Manager &ndash; Assistant Manager will be responsible for overseeing and coordinating empanelment projects from initiation to completion. This role involves managing project timelines, liaising with stakeholders, ensuring compliance with regulations, and driving efficiency in the empanelment process. The ideal candidate will have strong project management skills, excellent communication abilities, and a keen eye for detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"493\">\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"514\"><strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"514\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<li data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"624\">Oversee the execution of empanelment projects, ensuring timely completion and adherence to requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"724\">Coordinate with internal teams and external stakeholders to streamline the empanelment process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"795\">Develop and maintain project plans, timelines, and status reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"887\">\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"887\">Ensure compliance with company policies, industry standards, and regulatory guidelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"969\">Identify risks, bottlenecks, and mitigation strategies for project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1058\">Facilitate documentation, approvals, and contract management related to empanelment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1148\">Collaborate with vendors, partners, and agencies to ensure seamless project delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1201\">Monitor project budgets and resource allocation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1301\">Generate reports and insights for senior management regarding project progress and performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1373\">Continuously improve project management processes and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1396\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1396\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1469\">Experience of project management for e-Governance delivery project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1568\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in business administration, Project Management, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1596\">5+ years of experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1649\">Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1700\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1785\">Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and work under tight deadlines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1805\"><strong data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1805\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1902\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1962\"><strong data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1962\">Assistant Manager (Procurement Expert), Level &ndash; 7</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2337\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Procurement Expert is responsible for managing and executing procurement activities, ensuring compliance with organizational policies, and optimizing sourcing strategies. This role requires expertise in preparing Expression of Interest (EOI), Request for Proposal (RFP), bid management, and contract negotiations. The expert will collaborate with internal stakeholders.<br><br></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"59\"><strong data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"59\">A. Procurement Planning &amp; Strategy</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"444\">\r\n<li data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"141\">\r\n<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"141\">Develop and implement procurement strategies to support business objectives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"250\">\r\n<p data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"250\">Analyze market trends, supplier capabilities, and industry benchmarks to ensure competitive procurement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"352\">\r\n<p data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"352\">Establish procurement frameworks, policies, and best practices in line with organizational goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"444\">\r\n<p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"444\">Ensure that procurement activities comply with legal, regulatory, and industry standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"474\"><strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"474\">B. EOI &amp; RFP Preparation</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"569\">Develop and manage Expression of Interest (EOI) and Request for Proposal (RFP) documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"676\">Define procurement requirements, evaluation criteria, and contractual obligations in tender documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"775\">Work with stakeholders to gather technical and financial specifications for procurement needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"897\">Ensure transparent and competitive bidding processes by evaluating proposals, negotiating terms, and selecting vendors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"939\"><strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"939\">C. Bid Management &amp; Vendor Selection</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\n<li data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1060\">Manage end-to-end bid processes, including tender publishing, bidder queries, bid evaluation, and vendor selection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1150\">Conduct pre-bid meetings, vendor shortlisting, and comparative analysis of proposals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1260\">Ensure alignment of procurement activities with business goals, quality standards, and cost efficiencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1334\">Monitor supplier performance and ensure compliance with contract terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1377\">D. Contract Management &amp; Negotiations</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1479\">Lead contract negotiations to secure cost-effective agreements while ensuring quality standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1595\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1595\">Draft, review, and manage procurement contracts, ensuring adherence to compliance and risk mitigation measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1687\">Maintain contract documentation, monitor expiration dates, and oversee contract renewals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1724\">E. Compliance &amp; Risk Management</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1814\">Ensure procurement operations align with legal, ethical, and environmental policies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1922\">Conduct risk assessments related to vendor reliability, supply chain disruptions, and compliance risks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2007\">Maintain procurement records and audit trails for transparency and accountability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2050\"><strong data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2050\">F. Cost Optimization &amp; Budget Control</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2186\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2115\">Track procurement expenditures and cost-saving initiatives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2186\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2186\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Identify areas for cost reduction while maintaining service quality.<br><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"484\">\r\n<li data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"89\">\r\n<p data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"89\">Experience of project management for e-Governance delivery project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"188\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in business administration, Project Management, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"295\">\r\n<p data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"295\">5+ years of experience in procurement, contract management, bid management, and supplier negotiations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"348\">\r\n<p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"348\">Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"399\">\r\n<p data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"399\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"484\">Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and work under tight deadlines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"504\"><strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"504\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<li data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"601\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\">\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"640\"><strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"640\">Project Executive, Level &ndash; 3</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"1077\">The Project Executive &ndash; Project Executive will be responsible for overseeing and coordinating empanelment projects from initiation to completion. This role involves managing project timelines, liaising with stakeholders, ensuring compliance with regulations, and driving efficiency in the empanelment process. The ideal candidate will have strong project management skills, excellent communication abilities, and a keen eye for detail.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1103\"><strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1103\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1213\">Oversee the execution of empanelment projects, ensuring timely completion and adherence to requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1313\">Coordinate with internal teams and external stakeholders to streamline the empanelment process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1384\">Develop and maintain project plans, timelines, and status reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1476\">Ensure compliance with company policies, industry standards, and regulatory guidelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1558\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1558\">Identify risks, bottlenecks, and mitigation strategies for project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1647\">Facilitate documentation, approvals, and contract management related to empanelment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1737\">Collaborate with vendors, partners, and agencies to ensure seamless project delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1790\">Monitor project budgets and resource allocation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1890\">Generate reports and insights for senior management regarding project progress and performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1962\">Continuously improve project management processes and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1967\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1985\"><strong data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1985\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2155\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2058\">Experience of project management for e-Governance delivery project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2155\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2155\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in business administration, Project Management, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"49\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"49\">1+ years of experience in project management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"102\">Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"153\">\r\n<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"153\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"238\">\r\n<p data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"238\">Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and work under tight deadlines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17fa721a-9111-4372-929c-b9929d737958-5\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-12\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"665ed4ba-6a62-4dff-a789-3a1404eae01e\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"258\"><strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"258\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"355\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"355\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"355\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"99938f9b-3ae6-4395-baca-47dac1854875\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-5\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"user\"></article>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"594\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) or offline mode by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking of candidates&rsquo; interview will be done as follows -&nbsp;<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"602\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"85\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"85\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"72\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"85\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"602\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"256\">\r\n<td data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"243\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"256\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"342\">\r\n<td data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"329\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"342\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<td data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"347\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"417\">Good understanding of design, development, best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"430\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"516\">\r\n<td data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"503\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"516\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"602\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"589\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"602\" data-is-last-node=\"\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 01/04/2025. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Proposed candidates CVs</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-03-19 10:23:28',4,1,'2025-03-19 23:24:27',62,'2025-03-19 10:23:28',NULL,'2025-03-19 10:25:52',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-03-19',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for Empanelment Project of CHiPS','2025-03-19','2025-03-25','2025-04-01 17:00:00','2025-04-02 12:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-04',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/5rgXDHR9TXmwFZBWemd70BrtN6KbnI31SvastAfv.pdf',NULL,0,2,1,0,'14,15,16',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,1,1,0,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (93,0,89,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/SPMU/eDistrict2.0/2025',1,'State Project Management Unit (SPMU) for e-District 2.0 Project','24','<p>The objective of appointing a State Project Management Unit (SPMU) for the e-District Project 2.0 is to ensure the successful and efficient implementation of the project, which aims to improve the delivery of government services to citizens through the use of Information and Communication Technology (ICT). A SPMU plays a crucial role in overseeing, coordinating, and managing including SLA monitoring during the O&amp;M phase of e-District 2.0 project.</p>',1,64,'2025-04-25 11:30:05',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>The Government of Chhattisgarh (GoC) has been implementing e-Governance in the State of Chhattisgarh with a view to enhance transparency, efficiency and provide quality &amp; prompt services to its citizens. Chhattisgarh eDistrict 1.0 project had gone live on 27th Feb 2015. Presently e-District portal is delivering 117+ G2C services online, clocking more than 3 lakh transactions per month with a total of 2.82 crore transactions till date. 4176 Lok Sewa Kendra/Common Service Centers/Choice Centers are providing services across the state. Citizens can also apply directly online in e-District portal. Citizens can access the services from Citizen Kiosks (CSC/Lok Sewa Kendra), Web Portal and Mobile App. New service will be onboarding in e-District 2.0 along with smooth execution of existing services on day to day basis.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>Project Manager/Assistant Manager/Project Associate working on projects like e-District, the scope of work is crucial in ensuring the successful implementation of the technology solutions required for e-Government service delivery. The e-District Project aims to streamline government services to citizens through a digital platform.<br><br>Detailed breakdown of the scope of work in e-District project:<br><br></p>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"b9c48d70-8342-4ac6-9814-b951cc3a3e3e\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-26\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"db3480cb-213b-4f10-8a09-267e8985b1fa\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"30\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"30\">i. Onboarding New Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"467\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"83\">\r\n<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"83\">Identify department need to online the service.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"152\">Coordinate with Department, System Integrator, and Project Head.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"204\">\r\n<p data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"204\">Evaluate security, compliance, and scalability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"252\">Conduct a proof of concept (if applicable).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"318\">Integrate with existing systems (e.g., APIs, Single Sign-On).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"387\">Roll out in phases or all at once, depending on risk assessment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"426\">Monitor performance and stability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"467\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"467\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Ensure support channels are available.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"38\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"38\">ii. Data Migration (if applicable)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"193\">\r\n<li data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"78\">\r\n<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"78\">Assess data transfer requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"149\">\r\n<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"149\">Plan data migration strategy (manual, automated, phased approach).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"193\">Conduct testing to ensure data integrity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"198\">\r\n<p data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"235\"><strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"235\">iii. User Onboarding &amp; Training</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"418\">\r\n<li data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"279\">\r\n<p data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"279\">Identify key users and administrators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"334\">Develop training materials (guides, videos, FAQs).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"373\">\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"373\">Conduct live training or webinars.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"418\">\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"418\">Provide sandbox environments for practice.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"460\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"460\">iv. Testing &amp; Quality Assurance</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<li data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"507\">\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"507\">Perform system and functionality testing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"544\">\r\n<p data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"544\">Run user acceptance tests (UAT).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"602\">Identify and resolve any issues before full deployment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>v. Onboarding offline/online services under LSG (Lok Seva Guarantee):</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"198\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"198\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"198\">The LSG (Lok Seva Guarantee) includes 498 online and offline services. SPMU must coordinate with the department to enable online/offline services in the e-District 2.0 portal and produce a report.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"203\">\r\n<p data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"224\"><strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"224\">vi. Integration</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<li data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"521\">Integration with all existing Central and State e-Governance initiatives, e.g. Open Data, e-Pramaan, UMANG, e-authentication including Aadhaar, etc. As per the RFP, the e-District application is integrated with various DeitY, State-level, and Central-level e-Governance initiatives as below:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<li data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"535\">e-Taal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"552\">e-Pramaan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<p data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"566\">e-Sign</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"603\">Rapid Assessment System (RAS)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"642\">Mobile Service Delivery Gateway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"672\">DigiLocker Integration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"686\">Mitaan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"706\">Aadhar Vault</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"735\">Aadhar Authentication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"1054\">SPMU will review, coordinate, and prepare a report for the above-mentioned platforms with related API/KPI. Coordinate directly with concerned departments to enable integration of departmental applications and services, ensure necessary technical configurations, and adhere to state-level interoperability standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1084\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1084\">vii. NeSDA Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1277\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1277\">The selected SPMU will monitor the services provided on the NESDA portal, update the services, and generate reports, coordinating with the department, and work with the department to do so.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1310\"><strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1310\">viii. Grievance System</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1608\">Selected SPMU is responsible for overseeing and managing the grievance redressal process within an organization, government body, or company. Their primary role is to ensure that complaints, concerns, or issues raised by employees, customers, or the public are addressed efficiently and fairly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1656\"><strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1656\">ix. Continuous Support &amp; Optimization</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1683\">Gather user feedback.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1731\">Address issues and provide ongoing support.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1770\">Optimize usage based on analytics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1814\">Stay updated on new features and updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1841\"><strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1841\">x. MIS Dashboard</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"2029\">SPMU is required to work with SI to review the reports in the existing dashboard and suggest and implement changes to retrieve the reports required by senior management or departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2071\"><strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2071\">xi. Additional Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2399\">The SPMU shall also be responsible for undertaking any other tasks, assignments, or support activities related to the e-District 2.0 project as and when directed by CHiPS during the course of the engagement. This includes any unforeseen or ancillary work necessary for the successful execution and continuity of the project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2440\"><strong data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2440\">xii. Departmental Coordination</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2652\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2652\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2652\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Coordinate directly with concerned departments to enable integration of departmental applications and services, ensure necessary technical configurations, and adhere to state-level interoperability standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>','<p>N/A</p>','<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\">Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"167\">Payment to the selected agency (PMU) for the scope of work done will be released as per the terms and conditions of the CHiPS empanelment agreement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"201\"><strong data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"201\">Payment Terms and Conditions</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<li data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"252\">Payment Terms: As per Empanelment Agreement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"317\">\r\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"317\">Milestones fixation and verification will be done by CHiPS.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"492\">Payment (invoice) verification and passing for payment recommendation to the consulting firm will be done by CHiPS based on MPR (Monthly Progress Report) and attendance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"594\">Man-month rate will be as per the new empanelment rate effective from the issue of the work order.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"618\"><strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"618\">Penalty Terms</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"1115\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<th data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"629\" data-col-size=\"md\">Reason</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"643\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Description</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"654\" data-col-size=\"md\">Penalty</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"1115\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<td data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"739\" data-col-size=\"md\">Change of selected resources as part of this EOI</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"805\">Any change of resource within 2 months from the deployment date</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"882\">2.0% of the work order value per event shall be deducted from the payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"1115\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"917\" data-col-size=\"md\">Delay in deployment of resource</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1039\">Any delay in deployment of the resource against the resource deployment plan as mentioned in section 4 of this document</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1115\" data-is-last-node=\"\">2.0% of the work order value per week shall be deducted from the payment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17fa721a-9111-4372-929c-b9929d737958-20\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-42\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"94286af6-a24e-4660-ae3f-80c06ec0da1b\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"649\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"578\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"578\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"649\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"649\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows -&nbsp;<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"662\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"80\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"93\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"662\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"282\">\r\n<td data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"269\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"282\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"377\">\r\n<td data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"364\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"377\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"472\">\r\n<td data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"459\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of design, development, best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"472\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"567\">\r\n<td data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"554\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"567\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"662\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"649\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"662\" data-is-last-node=\"\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>','<p>Agencies (PMU) are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 13/05/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001 ceochips@nic.in Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"28\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"28\">Signed copy of this EOI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"79\">\r\n<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"79\">Copy of approach and methodology presentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"272\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"272\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/application &amp; website/2024, Raipur, dated 18-Oct-2024.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-23 11:40:13',4,1,'2025-12-23 11:39:32',64,'2025-12-23 11:40:13',NULL,'2025-12-23 11:40:50',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-23',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Setting up of  State Project Management Unit (SPMU) for e-District 2.0 Project','2025-04-25','2025-04-30','2025-05-13 17:00:00','2025-05-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-05',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/6wxv62bWBBsgpgZi3kF0FMLH136Boc7g4mqBMgyP.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (94,0,84,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/CMITF/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower Services for CM IT Fellowship Program Project of CHiPS','12','<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is inviting only Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per the Tender <span class=\"s1\">No-<strong>160137/CEO/ CHiPS/</strong></span><strong>EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024</strong> dated 18/10/2024) <span class=\"s2\">to submit a proposal based on </span>Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment&nbsp;Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,64,'2025-07-10 12:50:34',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and&nbsp;prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;ble&nbsp;Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for&nbsp;Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and&nbsp;Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of&nbsp;Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT&nbsp;industry.<br><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some&nbsp;mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM,&nbsp;GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using&nbsp;the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh&nbsp;Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year&nbsp;to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ E-Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"f0415d7d-8a42-41c5-abfe-0afe6b4e44cd\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-50\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"cf34365e-ba26-463c-ad9c-ef7f9c0c7cf7\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\">Program Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"600\">The Program Manager &ndash; Project Management (CMITF Projects) is responsible for leading and managing work related to the CMITF project. The role of the Program Manager is to ensure that the strategic and organizational objectives, as well as the values of CHiPS, are put into practice. The Program Manager will be responsible for strategizing, design, and execution of programs; collaborating with technical institutes of national/international repute and various government departments; removing roadblocks in a timely manner; and implementing best practices in project management.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"1087\">The Program Manager should be able to independently manage stakeholders, lead large teams, execute MOUs, and facilitate coordination between fellows and departments. Preferably, the candidate should have worked on large-scale IT projects for government or government bodies. The candidate should be an outcome-oriented executive, capable of leading and energizing the institutional, human, and technical capacities necessary to realize the unique and ambitious ICT agenda of the State.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1349\">The Program Manager will plan, maintain, and develop organizational growth in accordance with the overall strategy. The candidate should fulfill the mandatory requirements listed below and should embody a rich combination of the requirements listed as desired.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1382\">Mandatory Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1889\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1522\">Educational qualification: Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s degree in Engineering, Project Management, Business Administration, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1715\">Experience required: Minimum experience of 10 years. Preference will be given to candidates who have successfully managed large programs for more than 5 years in a government organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1777\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1777\">Strong understanding of project management methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1846\">Excellent leadership, communication, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1889\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1889\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Excellent stakeholder management skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1889\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Should be able to work with Cross-functional teams</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<li data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"171\">\r\n<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"171\"><strong data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"56\">Project Planning &amp; Execution:</strong><br data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"59\">Develop project plans, timelines, and budget estimation for projects, ensuring adherence to scope and quality.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"350\">\r\n<p data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"350\"><strong data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"204\">Stakeholder Coordination:</strong><br data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"207\">Collaborate with different government departments, technical institutes, fellows, and internal teams to align project goals and deliverables.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"503\">\r\n<p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"503\"><strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"385\">Compliance &amp; Documentation:</strong><br data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"388\">Ensure all projects meet regulatory and organizational compliance requirements, maintaining proper documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"630\">\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"630\"><strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"527\">Risk Management:</strong><br data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"530\">Identify potential risks and implement mitigation strategies to ensure seamless project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"767\"><strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"657\">HRMS Process Setup:</strong><br data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"660\">Set up HRMS processes for smooth disbursement of monthly stipends of fellows and fellowship certificates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"798\">Monitoring &amp; Reporting:</strong><br data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"801\">Track project progress, prepare reports, and provide updates to leadership on key performance indicators (KPIs).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1039\">\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1039\"><strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"945\">Resource Optimization:</strong><br data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"948\">Allocate and manage resources efficiently to meet project deadlines and cost constraints.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1175\"><strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1067\">Process Improvement:</strong><br data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1070\">Implement best practices and continuous improvement initiatives to enhance project delivery efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1195\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1750\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1294\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1434\">Should have capability to independently manage assigned work as a Program Manager and should be able to handle a team of large members.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1560\">Should be able to coordinate with higher officials and have working knowledge of a government organization&rsquo;s environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1680\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates who are involved in management work in government organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1750\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1750\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Experienced candidates to lead projects and drive team performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"36\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"36\">IT Fellow Coordinator, Level &ndash; 7</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"455\">The IT Fellow Coordinator is responsible for managing and supporting the operations of an IT fellowship program. This includes coordinating training and project assignments, monitoring performance, and acting as a liaison between fellows and other IT staff or departments. The ideal candidate will have strong project management skills, excellent communication abilities, and a solid understanding of IT fundamentals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"460\">\r\n<p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"481\"><strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"481\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<li data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"553\">Coordinate the day-to-day operations of the IT Fellowship Program.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"630\">\r\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"630\">Assist in recruiting, interviewing, and selecting fellowship candidates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"723\">Develop and maintain onboarding materials, orientation sessions, and training schedules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"822\">Assign fellows to appropriate IT projects or departments based on skillsets and program goals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"905\">Monitor fellow performance, provide feedback, and conduct regular evaluations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1009\">Act as the main point of contact for IT fellows, addressing questions, concerns, and support needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1113\">Collaborate with IT managers and staff to ensure meaningful learning and development opportunities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1199\">Organize workshops, mentorship sessions, and professional development activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1292\">Maintain records and reports related to fellow progress, attendance, and program impact.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1386\">Continuously evaluate and improve the fellowship experience based on feedback and outcomes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1409\"><strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1409\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1549\">Educational qualification: Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in project management, Business Administration, Engineering, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1752\">Experience required: At least 5+ years of experience in department coordination or management in IT projects, with a preference for candidates who have worked on government or e-Governance projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1805\">Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1854\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1874\"><strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1874\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"2238\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1932\">Combines technical knowledge with people management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1998\">Opportunity to develop and lead structured training programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2060\">Enhances leadership, mentoring, and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2108\">Diverse and dynamic daily responsibilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2180\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2180\">Strong stepping stone to program management or IT leadership roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2238\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2238\">Opportunity to promote diversity and inclusion in tech.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2277\"><strong data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2277\">Assistant Manager, Level &ndash; 4</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2575\">The Assistant Manager supports the Manager in overseeing daily operations, managing staff, ensuring customer satisfaction, and driving team performance. This role requires strong leadership, organizational, and communication skills, along with the ability to handle operational tasks efficiently.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2601\"><strong data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2601\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"3169\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2686\">Assist the Manager in planning, coordinating, and supervising daily operations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2764\">Attendance, MPR, and monthly fellowship stipend&ndash;related file maintenance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2885\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2885\">Procurement of IT hardware and software as required by fellows (e.g., laptops, paid version of ChatGPT, Office 365).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2947\">Coordination with IIIT Naya Raipur for file-related work.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2995\">Make reporting and performance evaluations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3069\">Encourages ethical leadership and adherence to regulatory frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3169\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3169\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Facilitates smoother coordination with internal divisions and different stakeholders and fellows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"427\">\r\n<li data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"156\">Educational qualification: Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in project management, Business Administration, Engineering, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"325\">\r\n<p data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"325\">Experience required: At least 3 years of experience in a relevant job role, with a preference for candidates who have worked on government or e-Governance projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"378\">\r\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"378\">Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"427\">\r\n<p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"427\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"447\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"447\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<li data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"546\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"599\">Managed different projects/modules of a product.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"645\">Ability to understand one-liner requests.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"710\">Quick learner and ability to understand requests on the fly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"765\">Solve complex performance problems and challenges.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"830\">Enhances leadership, delegation, and team management skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"892\">Builds strong communication and conflict-resolution skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"936\"><strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"936\">Department Coordinator, Level &ndash; 2</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1499\">The Department Co-ordinator plays a crucial role in supporting the implementation and management of IT and e-Governance projects under CHiPS. The coordinator will assist in project activities across different departments, ensuring that projects are delivered on time, within scope, and in compliance with quality standards. The coordinator will work closely with multiple teams and departments to ensure alignment with project goals and objectives. The role will involve working with various stakeholders, tracking project progress, and reporting on milestones.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1525\"><strong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1525\">Job Description</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1639\">Coordinate with project stakeholders and departments to ensure all requirements are gathered and understood.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1723\">Organize and schedule project activities and ensure timely completion of tasks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1801\">Maintain tracking sheets, timelines, and project status and requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1882\">Support program managers in overseeing day-to-day operations of the project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1962\">Make coordination between different departments, stakeholders, and fellows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2058\">Continuously improve project coordination methodologies to enhance project working processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2081\"><strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2081\">Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2221\">Educational qualification: Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in project management, Business Administration, Engineering, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2442\">Experience required: Minimum 1 year of experience in a relevant job role, Department Coordinator, or management in IT projects, with a preference for candidates who have worked on government or e-Governance projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2495\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2495\">Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2546\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2643\">Ability to manage multiple projects/departments simultaneously and work under tight deadlines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2648\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2663\"><strong data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2663\">Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"3035\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2762\">Communication skills: Proficient in both written and oral communication in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2815\">Managed different projects/modules of a product.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2861\">Ability to understand one-liner requests.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2926\">Quick learner and ability to understand requests on the fly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2981\">Solve complex performance problems and challenges.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3035\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3035\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Providing updates on progress and challenges faced.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"594\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) or offline mode by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking of candidates&rsquo; interview will be done as follows -<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"727\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"103\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"103\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"90\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"727\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"311\">\r\n<td data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"212\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"298\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"311\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"415\">\r\n<td data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"316\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"402\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"415\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<td data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"420\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"506\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of executing IT based projects &amp; best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"519\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<td data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"610\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"623\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"727\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"628\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"714\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"727\" data-is-last-node=\"\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p class=\"p1\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals&nbsp;in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed&nbsp;to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of&nbsp;its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is <strong>25/07/2025.</strong> Any&nbsp;response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Proposed candidates CVs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-23 12:56:16',4,1,'2025-12-23 12:55:36',64,'2025-12-23 12:56:16',NULL,'2025-12-23 12:56:52',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-23',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for CM IT Fellowship Program Project of CHiPS Name of the Engagement','2025-07-10','2025-07-15','2025-07-25 17:00:00','2025-07-25 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-05',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/2PcQxaniVaV6fxcnRQqru49uiRr7BRGSOsaAOI70.pdf',NULL,0,2,1,0,'14,15,16',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (95,0,60,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/PMAYCG/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower Services for Mukhya Mantri Awas Yojana Portal Project of CHiPS','12','<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is inviting Tier-II empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No-<strong>160137/CEO/ CHiPS/</strong><strong>EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024</strong> dated 18/10/2024 to submit a proposal based on</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment&nbsp;Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,60,'2025-07-08 13:22:48',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and&nbsp;prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;ble&nbsp;Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for&nbsp;Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and&nbsp;Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of&nbsp;Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT&nbsp;industry.<br><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some&nbsp;mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM,&nbsp;GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using&nbsp;the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh&nbsp;Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year&nbsp;to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ E-Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"31\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"31\">Programmer (Web) &ndash; Level 10</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"747\">The Programmer (Web) will take a lead role in designing, developing, testing, and maintaining web-based applications and portals. Using modern technologies&mdash;such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript (front-end), and server-side languages (e.g., PHP, Python, Node.js)&mdash;candidates will have hands-on experience in full-stack web development, including building intuitive interfaces and integrating back-end data logic. Working both independently and in teams, the Programmer (Web) will write clean, maintainable code, conduct thorough testing and debugging, optimize performance, and document software processes. Their contributions will support both new development and continuous enhancements of critical government web portals.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"782\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"782\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<li data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"906\"><strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"814\">Application Development:</strong> Design, develop, and implement web applications using modern frameworks and technologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1032\">\r\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1032\"><strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"933\">Database Management:</strong> Design and manage relational and NoSQL databases to ensure efficient data storage and retrieval.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1157\"><strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1055\">API Integration:</strong> Develop and integrate RESTful APIs to facilitate communication between different system components.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1285\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1285\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1186\">Testing and Debugging:</strong> Conduct thorough testing of applications to identify and fix bugs, ensuring optimal performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1409\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1409\"><strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1308\">Version Control:</strong> Utilize version control systems like Git to manage codebase and collaborate with other developers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1430\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain comprehensive documentation for all developed applications, including code comments, user manuals, and technical guides.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1583\">Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with other team members, including designers, project managers, and stakeholders, to gather requirements and deliver solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1764\"><strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1764\">Skills and Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1997\"><strong data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1817\">Programming Skills and Knowledge of Database:</strong> Proficiency in one or more programming languages (e.g., PHP, Laravel, CI, C#, ASP.Net, React.js, Node.js, JavaScript, CSS, Bootstrap, SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2076\"><strong data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2022\">Analytical Skills:</strong> Ability to analyse problems and identify solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2160\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2160\"><strong data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2103\">Attention to Detail:</strong> Ability to focus on small details and ensure accuracy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2242\"><strong data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2190\">Problem-Solving Skills:</strong> Ability to identify and resolve technical issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2321\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2321\"><strong data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2270\">Collaboration Skills:</strong> Ability to work effectively in a team environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2341\"><strong data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2341\">Qualifications</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2436\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2436\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2436\">Master&rsquo;s/Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2441\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2463\"><strong data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2463\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2560\">Master&rsquo;s/Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2628\">Minimum of 5 years of experience in full-stack web development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2659\"><strong data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2657\">Technical Proficiency:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2763\"><strong data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2678\">Front-end:</strong> HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and frameworks like AngularJS (1.x), React.js, or Vue.js.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2814\"><strong data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2781\">Back-end:</strong> Node.js, PHP, Python, or Java.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2849\"><strong data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2833\">Framework:</strong> Laravel, MVC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2907\"><strong data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2868\">Databases:</strong> MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB, Json.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2968\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2968\">Experience with RESTful API development and integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3018\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3018\">Proficiency in using Git for version control.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3077\">Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3132\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3132\">Excellent communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3137\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3156\"><strong data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3156\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3530\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3213\">Knowledge of version control tools like Git or SVN.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3277\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3277\">Experience with cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3278\" data-end=\"3314\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3314\">Knowledge of project deployment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3398\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3398\">Experience in developing applications for government or public sector projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3452\">Familiarity with Agile development methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3530\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3530\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi (both written and verbal).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"594\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) or offline mode by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking of candidates&rsquo; interview will be done as follows -</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"755\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"80\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"93\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"755\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"282\">\r\n<td data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"269\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"282\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"377\">\r\n<td data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"287\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"364\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"377\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"472\">\r\n<td data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"382\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"459\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of design, development, best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"472\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<td data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"553\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"566\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<td data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"571\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"648\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"661\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"755\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"742\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"677\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"755\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"751\" data-is-only-node=\"\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p class=\"p1\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals&nbsp;in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed&nbsp;to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of&nbsp;its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The last date for submission of response is 15 /07/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State&nbsp;Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">&nbsp;</p>','<ul>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li class=\"p1\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Proposed candidate&rsquo;s CVs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-23 13:28:00',4,1,'2025-12-23 13:27:21',60,'2025-12-23 13:28:00',NULL,'2025-12-23 13:28:28',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-23',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for Mukhyamantri Awas Yojana Portal Project of CHiPS Name of the Engagement','2025-07-08','2025-07-11','2025-07-15 17:00:00','2025-07-15 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-05',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/0TVm8OMgLZCcFexRlRb4YO3pGZSfy4Zb3mv9tgsA.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (96,0,62,'EOI/CHIPS/EMPL/AWD/HR/2025',1,'Recruitment of Three Dedicated HR Resources to Manage Consultant Deployment and Vendor Coordination under CHiPS Empanelment Framework','12','<p>CHiPS is inviting only Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per the Tender No-160137/CEO/ CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024 to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,62,'2025-12-23 15:10:17',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,10,18,0,'<p>CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br><br>CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM, GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ EGovernance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"41\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"41\">Sr. Manager EMPL (HR), Level &ndash; (8&ndash;13)</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"385\">The Sr. Manager EMPL (HR) will be responsible for leading and overseeing the human resource management activities related to consultants deployed through CHiPS&rsquo; empanelled firms across various state government projects. This role will ensure effective manpower coordination, compliance management, and strategic HR support across departments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"390\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"420\"><strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"420\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"451\"><strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"451\">1. Strategic HR Oversight</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n<li data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"545\">Lead the HR function for all deployed consultants under the CHiPS empanelment framework.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"647\">Develop and implement policies and processes for deployment, monitoring, and exit of consultants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"744\">Coordinate with empanelled agencies to ensure timely availability and replacement of manpower.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"785\"><strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"785\">2. Vendor &amp; Consultant Coordination</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<li data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"883\">Act as the primary point of contact between CHiPS and empanelled manpower service providers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"958\">Facilitate onboarding, induction, and orientation for new consultants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1058\">Monitor attendance, deliverables, and performance in consultation with departmental stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1093\"><strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1093\">3. Compliance &amp; Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1210\">Ensure that all contractual, statutory, and administrative documentation is up to date and properly maintained.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1318\">Oversee service agreements, deployment letters, and compliance with service-level obligations by vendors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1345\">4. Grievance Handling</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1438\">Manage consultant grievances and coordinate resolution with internal teams and vendors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1511\">Ensure timely redressal of HR-related issues affecting deployed staff.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1562\">5. Process Improvement &amp; Digitization Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1633\">Recommend improvements in existing manpower management processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1734\">Support the implementation of internal HR tools or systems as required for tracking and reporting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1784\"><strong data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1784\">Minimum Qualifications &amp; Experience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1880\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1880\">Postgraduate degree in HR/Personnel Management/Business Administration or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1927\">Minimum 7 years of experience in HR roles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1990\">Strong communication, negotiation, and documentation skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"1995\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2036\"><strong data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2036\">Manager EMPL (HR), Level &ndash; (5&ndash;7)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2424\">The Manager EMPL (HR) will support the Manager &ndash; HR in the execution of all human resource&ndash;related activities associated with the deployment and management of consultants engaged through CHiPS&rsquo; empanelled firms. This role focuses on day-to-day operational HR functions, documentation, and coordination to ensure smooth and compliant functioning of manpower processes across departments.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2459\"><strong data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2459\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2497\"><strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2497\">1. HR Operations &amp; Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2586\">Assist in maintaining comprehensive personnel records for all deployed consultants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2710\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2710\">Coordinate onboarding formalities, including collection of documents, verification, and issuance of deployment letters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2814\">Track attendance, leaves, and joining/exiting dates of consultants, and maintain up-to-date trackers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2853\"><strong data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2853\">2. Vendor &amp; Resource Coordination</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"3086\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2995\">Communicate with empanelled manpower service providers for document submission, updates on deployment status, and manpower requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3086\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3086\">Follow up with vendors for replacements, extensions, and compliance-related submissions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3113\"><strong data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3113\">3. Compliance Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3342\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3245\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3245\">Ensure all service records, contract terms, and compliance checklists are regularly updated and aligned with CHiPS&rsquo; standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3342\">Monitor submission of statutory compliance documents by vendors (e.g., PF, ESI, salary slips).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3377\"><strong data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3377\">4. Grievance Handling Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3587\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3511\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3511\">Log and track consultant grievances and assist in resolution through coordination with the concerned vendor or internal officer.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3587\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3587\">Maintain records of escalations, actions taken, and resolution timelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3611\"><strong data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3611\">5. MIS &amp; Reporting</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3768\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3703\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3703\">Generate weekly and monthly HR reports, dashboards, and summaries for internal review.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3768\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3768\">Prepare documentation and data for audits or internal reviews.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3799\"><strong data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3799\">6. Administrative Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3907\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3907\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3907\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Coordinate logistics related to consultant interactions, performance evaluations, and meeting schedules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3907\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Assist in organizing periodic reviews, documentation audits, or internal HR training sessions, if any.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"39\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"39\">Minimum Qualifications &amp; Experience</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"286\">\r\n<li data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"148\">\r\n<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"148\">Graduate/Postgraduate degree in Human Resource Management, Business Administration, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"195\">Minimum 5 years of relevant HR experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"286\">Proficient in MS Office tools, documentation handling, and verbal/written communication.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"291\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"342\"><strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"342\">Project Associate EMPL (HR), Level &ndash; (1&ndash;4)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"761\">The Project Associate EMPL (HR) will assist the HR team in executing routine human resource operations related to the deployment, monitoring, and management of consultants engaged through CHiPS&rsquo; empanelled manpower service providers. The role will focus on daily HR operations, documentation, vendor coordination, and administrative support to ensure smooth and compliant functioning of manpower deployment processes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"796\"><strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"796\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"834\"><strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"834\">1. HR Operations &amp; Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<li data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"921\">Assist in maintaining and updating personnel records of all deployed consultants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1022\">Support onboarding processes, including document collection, verification, and record maintenance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1061\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1061\">2. Vendor &amp; Resource Coordination</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1165\">Coordinate with empanelled manpower vendors for timely submission of deployment-related documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1256\">Follow up for consultant replacements, contract extensions, and manpower requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1344\">Ensure regular communication with vendors for compliance and resource status updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1374\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1374\">3. Compliance Monitoring</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1491\">Assist in tracking contract terms, service records, and compliance documentation (e.g., PF, ESI, salary slips).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1602\">Maintain trackers for statutory submissions and escalate delays or discrepancies to the reporting officer.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1681\">Ensure all HR documentation is aligned with CHiPS&rsquo; standards and guidelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1719\"><strong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1719\">4. Grievance Handling Assistance</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1986\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1815\">Maintain a register of consultant grievances and assist in their follow-up and resolution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1897\">Coordinate with vendors and internal stakeholders to ensure timely redressal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1986\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1986\">Document actions taken and ensure closure of grievance cases within defined timelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2010\"><strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2010\">5. MIS &amp; Reporting</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2078\">Support in preparing weekly/monthly HR dashboards and reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2153\">Help consolidate data for audit purposes and assist in internal reviews.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2184\"><strong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2184\">6. Administrative Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2388\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2272\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2272\">Assist in scheduling consultant reviews, document audits, and HR-related meetings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2388\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2388\">Coordinate logistics for performance evaluations, grievance meetings, and HR workshops/training sessions, if any.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2438\"><strong data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2438\">Minimum Qualifications &amp; Experience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2696\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2603\">Educational qualification: Graduate/Postgraduate degree in Human Resource Management, Business Administration, or a related field from a recognized university.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2696\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2696\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Work experience: Minimum 1 year and up to 4 years of relevant HR or operations experience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"594\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) or offline mode by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"665\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"665\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows -<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"573\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"82\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"82\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"69\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"82\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"573\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"169\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"233\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"246\">30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"327\">\r\n<td data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"251\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"314\" data-col-size=\"md\">Relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"327\">30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"409\">\r\n<td data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"332\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"396\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"409\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"491\">\r\n<td data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"478\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"491\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"573\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"496\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"560\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"507\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"573\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"569\" data-is-only-node=\"\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 25/07/2025; 17:00 Hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Proposed candidates CVs</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-23 15:13:47',4,1,'2025-12-23 15:13:09',62,'2025-12-23 15:13:47',NULL,'2025-12-23 15:14:14',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-23',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','For Recruitment of Three Dedicated HR Resources to Manage Consultant Deployment and Vendor Coordination under CHiPS Empanelment Framework','2025-12-23','2025-12-22','2025-12-25 17:00:00','2025-12-26 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-05',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/pZRo0ALnNguyrvI2RyEgCekQ2C4bZY1dYHZP0qNd.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (97,0,89,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/GoodGov/2025',1,'Deployment of Specialized Manpower for Government Process Re-engineering (GPR)','6','<p>CHiPS invites proposals exclusively from Tier-I and Tier-II empanelled Manpower Service Provider firms (as per the Tender No-160137/CEO/CHiPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024) to submit a proposal based on the Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualifications, Terms of Reference (ToR), and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI for providing manpower support for Government Process Re-Engineering (GPR) initiatives. I</p>',1,61,'2025-12-23 15:31:46',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<p>Government of Chhattisgarh has reaffirmed its unwavering commitment to the principles of &ldquo;Good Governance&rdquo;. This vision is centered on ensuring transparency, accountability, efficiency, and a citizen-first approach in the delivery of public services across the state.</p>\r\n<p>To realize this vision, the State Government has mandated comprehensive Government Process Re-engineering (GPR) and digital transformation initiatives across all departments. These aim to eliminate redundancies, reduce manual interventions, and ensure time-bound delivery of citizen services via a unified digital platform.</p>\r\n<p>At present, a significant number of services offered by departments function through offline or hybrid mechanisms, leading to fragmented workflows, manual delays, and limited accessibility for citizens. These issues undermine the overall effectiveness of governance and service delivery. Recognizing this, the government has instructed that all such services must be reviewed, analyzed, and migrated to a fully online mode via the e-District platform, which is operated by CHiPS. This platform currently hosts 89 citizen-centric services such as caste certificates, income certificates, and various other entitlements.&nbsp;<br><br>To ensure the successful implementation of these directives, it is imperative to deploy a dedicated and skilled team of professionals who can:</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:17fa721a-9111-4372-929c-b9929d737958-37\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-76\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"9c15fd7f-f7dc-44e2-9bd6-a43aaac11be1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"338\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"50\">Conduct comprehensive service workflow audits.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"102\">Facilitate process simplification and redesign.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"176\">\r\n<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"176\">Support digital migration and integration with the e-District system.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"257\">\r\n<p data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"257\">Provide training and capacity-building support to departmental stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"338\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"338\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Monitor progress to meet time-bound targets set forth by the state government.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Accordingly, this Expression of Interest (EoI) has been issued to empanelled manpower service providers for the engagement of a specialized team comprising GPR and functional consultants. The team will be engaged for an initial period of six (6) months, with the scope of work focused on driving the GPR agenda forward and ensuring measurable improvements in service delivery across departments.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"276\">The scope of work for the engagement encompasses a broad range of activities critical to the successful implementation of Government Process Re-engineering (GPR) and digital transformation initiatives. The specialized team will be responsible for the following key activities:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"281\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"321\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"321\">3.1 Process Analysis &amp; Mapping</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<li data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"475\">Conduct a detailed &ldquo;as-is&rdquo; analysis of existing departmental workflows and service delivery mechanisms, including offline, online, and hybrid modes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"645\">Utilize process mapping techniques and tools to document current workflows, identify redundancies, manual touchpoints, and inefficiencies impacting service delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"766\">Engage with departmental stakeholders at all levels to gather inputs, understand pain points, and validate findings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"866\">\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"866\">Develop comprehensive gap analyses highlighting bottlenecks, delays, and compliance challenges.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<p data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"1059\">Propose optimized &ldquo;to-be&rdquo; processes aligned with the State Government&rsquo;s vision of digital-first, citizen-centric service delivery, emphasizing simplicity, transparency, and accountability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1182\">Ensure that the redesigned processes support seamless interdepartmental coordination and data exchange where applicable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1234\"><strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1234\">3.2 Digitization &amp; Service Onboarding</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1414\">Collaborate closely with departmental teams, CHiPS, and technology partners such as NIC to facilitate the redesign and restructuring of citizen services for digital delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1543\">Lead efforts to convert all eligible offline and hybrid services to fully online services hosted on the e-District platform.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1647\">Develop detailed implementation plans, timelines, and resource requirements for service onboarding.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1818\">Oversee the integration of re-engineered workflows with the e-District portal, ensuring data security, system interoperability, and user experience standards are met.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1952\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1952\">Coordinate rigorous testing, validation, and pilot runs prior to full-scale rollout to ensure technical and functional readiness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2060\">Support the resolution of technical or procedural issues that arise during onboarding and go-live phases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2109\"><strong data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2109\">3.3 Training and Capacity Building</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2775\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2272\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2272\">Design and implement targeted training programs and workshops for departmental officials and end-users on the newly designed processes and digital platforms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2448\">Develop comprehensive training materials, including user manuals, standard operating procedures (SOPs), FAQs, and quick reference guides tailored to different user groups.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2541\">Provide on-site and remote handholding support to ensure smooth adoption of new systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2683\">Facilitate train-the-trainer programs to build internal departmental capacity for sustained knowledge transfer and future training needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2775\">Monitor training effectiveness through feedback mechanisms and adapt content accordingly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2819\"><strong data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2819\">3.4 Monitoring and Governance</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2995\">Establish a robust monitoring and evaluation framework incorporating clearly defined performance metrics, key performance indicators (KPIs), and service-level benchmarks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3134\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3134\">Develop and maintain real-time dashboards and reporting tools to track progress against GPR milestones and service onboarding targets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3304\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3304\">Prepare and submit periodic (weekly/monthly) progress reports highlighting achievements, challenges, and corrective action plans to CHiPS and respective departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3440\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3440\">Identify and analyze potential risks and issues related to process implementation, technology adoption, and stakeholder engagement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3570\">Provide actionable recommendations and mitigation strategies to address risks and ensure timely delivery of project objectives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3575\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3577\" data-end=\"3631\"><strong data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3631\">3.5 Central Coordination and Change Management</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"4496\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3798\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3798\">Serve as the nodal coordination point bridging CHiPS, various government departments, technology partners, and other stakeholders involved in the GPR initiative.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3947\">Facilitate effective interdepartmental communication and collaboration to harmonize process changes and share best practices across departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4068\">Coordinate schedules, resources, and dependencies to ensure synchronized implementation across multiple departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4220\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4220\">Design and execute change management strategies, including stakeholder engagement plans, awareness campaigns, and resistance management activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4223\" data-end=\"4357\">Conduct periodic awareness and sensitization sessions to foster acceptance and enthusiasm among government employees and leadership.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4496\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4496\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Address concerns, manage expectations, and ensure alignment with broader governance objectives through continuous dialogue and feedback.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"594\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) or offline mode by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking of candidates&rsquo; interview will be done as follows -<br><br></p>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"603\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"86\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"86\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"73\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"86\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"603\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"257\">\r\n<td data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"176\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"244\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"257\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"343\">\r\n<td data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"330\" data-col-size=\"md\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"343\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"431\">\r\n<td data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"348\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"418\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of design, development, best practices framework</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"431\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"517\">\r\n<td data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"504\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"517\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"603\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"522\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"590\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"603\" data-is-last-node=\"\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 06/06/2025,17:00 Hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001ceochips@nic.in&amp;empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Proposed candidates CVs as per tender no 160137/CEO/CHIPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development, Dated 18/10/2024</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-23 15:34:53',4,1,'2025-12-23 15:34:18',61,'2025-12-23 15:34:53',NULL,'2025-12-23 15:35:20',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-23',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EoI) For Deployment of Specialized Manpower for Government Process Re-engineering (GPR)','2025-12-23','2025-12-22','2025-12-25 12:00:00','2025-12-26 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-05',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/0BHK699eIxlFeTuLEe0hLpHPRCGKACtfysPLMNMX.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (98,4,60,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/BuildNXT/2025',1,'Selection of Manpower Services for BuildNXT Project of CHiPS','12','<p>CHiPS is inviting Tier-I &amp; Tier-II empanelled agencies (as per the Tender No-160137/CEO/ CHiPS/ EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/2024 dated 18/10/2024 to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Candidates, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>',1,60,'2025-04-17 14:23:58',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<p>CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br><br>CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM, GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ EGovernance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"47\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"47\">Jr. Programmer &ndash; ASP.NET, C#, MVC &ndash; Level 1</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"377\">The Jr. Programmer will support the design, development, testing, and maintenance of web applications based on the ASP.NET framework using C# and MVC architecture. This role is ideal for individuals at the beginning of their software development career who are eager to learn, grow, and contribute to technology-driven projects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"706\">The candidate will work under the guidance of senior developers and project managers to implement coding tasks, resolve bugs, and ensure the delivery of high-quality software modules. The role requires attention to detail, a basic understanding of software development principles, and the ability to work in a team environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"711\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"741\"><strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"741\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<li data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"876\"><strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"773\">Application Development:</strong> Assist in the development and maintenance of web applications using ASP.NET, C#, and MVC frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1006\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"903\">Code Implementation:</strong> Write clean, efficient, and maintainable code as per defined requirements and design specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1132\"><strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1034\">Bug Fixing &amp; Testing:</strong> Identify and resolve issues and bugs; participate in unit testing and ensure timely resolution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1242\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1242\"><strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1153\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain clear and structured documentation for code, modules, and features developed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1404\"><strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1268\">Team Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with senior programmers, QA teams, and project managers to understand requirements and deliver expected functionalities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1539\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1433\">Learning &amp; Adaptation:</strong> Stay updated with evolving technologies and development practices; adapt and apply them in ongoing tasks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1566\"><strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1566\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"2056\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1663\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1715\">0+ years of experience in software development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1801\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1825\">Basic knowledge of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1849\">ASP.NET framework</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1879\">C# programming language</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1902\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1902\">MVC architecture</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1946\">HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and SQL Server</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1994\">Good analytical and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2056\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2056\">Ability to work effectively in a collaborative environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2080\"><strong data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2080\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2162\">Knowledge of web services (REST APIs), Entity Framework, and LINQ is a plus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2214\">Familiarity with source control tools like Git.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2290\">Good communication skills in English and Hindi (both written and verbal).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2295\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2344\"><strong data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2344\">Programmer &ndash; PHP MVC Framework &ndash; Level 7</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2659\">The Programmer &ndash; PHP MVC Framework will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining web-based applications using modern PHP MVC frameworks such as Laravel, CodeIgniter, or Symfony. The role focuses on building secure, scalable, and maintainable applications to support ongoing and upcoming projects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2852\">The ideal candidate should have solid experience in backend development, a good grasp of software development life cycles, and the ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2857\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2887\"><strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2887\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2989\"><strong data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2919\">Application Development:</strong> Develop and maintain web applications using PHP and MVC frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3100\"><strong data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3016\">API &amp; Backend Logic:</strong> Create secure backend functionalities and integrate third-party or internal APIs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3195\"><strong data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3127\">Database Management:</strong> Design, optimize, and manage databases using MySQL or PostgreSQL.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3313\"><strong data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3225\">Code Quality &amp; Testing:</strong> Write clean, modular code and perform debugging, unit testing, and peer code reviews.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3437\"><strong data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3334\">Collaboration:</strong> Coordinate with frontend developers, designers, and other team members to meet project requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3558\"><strong data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3458\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain technical documentation for modules, APIs, and processes to ensure future maintainability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3563\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3585\"><strong data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3585\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"4129\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3662\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3589\" data-end=\"3662\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3739\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3739\">5+ years of hands-on experience in PHP development using MVC frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3825\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3825\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"4010\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3844\">Proficient in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"4010\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3884\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3884\">PHP (Object-Oriented Programming)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3943\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3943\">MVC frameworks like Laravel, CodeIgniter, or Symfony</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3966\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3966\">MySQL/PostgreSQL</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4010\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"4010\">JavaScript, jQuery, AJAX, HTML5, CSS3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4068\">Familiarity with version control systems such as Git.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4129\">Understanding of RESTful APIs and web security principles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4153\"><strong data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4153\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4308\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4188\">Laravel experience preferred.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4256\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4256\">Exposure to frontend frameworks like Vue.js or React is a plus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4308\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4308\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4313\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4358\"><strong data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4358\">Programmer &ndash; CMS Developer &ndash; Level 7</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4735\">The CMS Developer will be responsible for developing, customizing, and maintaining websites and web applications using popular Content Management Systems (CMS) such as WordPress, Drupal, or Joomla. The role includes creating custom themes and plugins/modules, optimizing website performance, and ensuring responsive, accessible, and secure front-end and back-end integration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4958\">This position is ideal for a developer with a strong understanding of CMS architecture, PHP programming, and front-end technologies, who can work independently and contribute effectively to cross-functional project teams.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4963\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"4993\"><strong data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"4993\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5814\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4995\" data-end=\"5133\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5133\"><strong data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5033\">CMS Development &amp; Customization:</strong> Develop, configure, and customize websites using CMS platforms (WordPress, Drupal, Joomla, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5254\"><strong data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5167\">Theme &amp; Plugin Development:</strong> Create and modify custom themes, plugins, and modules based on project requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5257\" data-end=\"5366\"><strong data-start=\"5257\" data-end=\"5281\">Content Integration:</strong> Work with design and content teams to structure and populate websites effectively.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5488\"><strong data-start=\"5369\" data-end=\"5394\">Website Optimization:</strong> Ensure websites are optimized for speed, performance, SEO, and cross-browser compatibility.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5600\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5600\"><strong data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5518\">Security &amp; Maintenance:</strong> Apply CMS security best practices and manage updates, backups, and maintenance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5603\" data-end=\"5705\"><strong data-start=\"5603\" data-end=\"5623\">API Integration:</strong> Integrate third-party services and APIs as required for extended functionality.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5814\"><strong data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5726\">Documentation:</strong> Prepare documentation for developed features, customizations, and deployment processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5816\" data-end=\"5819\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5821\" data-end=\"5841\"><strong data-start=\"5825\" data-end=\"5841\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"6301\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5845\" data-end=\"5918\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5919\" data-end=\"5965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5965\">5+ years of experience in CMS development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5966\" data-end=\"6051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5968\" data-end=\"6051\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6052\" data-end=\"6187\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6054\" data-end=\"6070\">Proficient in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6073\" data-end=\"6187\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6073\" data-end=\"6124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6075\" data-end=\"6124\">CMS platforms like WordPress, Drupal, or Joomla</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6127\" data-end=\"6167\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6129\" data-end=\"6167\">PHP, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6170\" data-end=\"6187\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6187\">MySQL/MariaDB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6188\" data-end=\"6247\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6247\">Experience with custom theme/plugin/module development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6248\" data-end=\"6301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6250\" data-end=\"6301\">Familiarity with Git and version control workflows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6303\" data-end=\"6306\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6308\" data-end=\"6325\"><strong data-start=\"6312\" data-end=\"6325\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6572\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6329\" data-end=\"6400\">Experience with page builders like Elementor, WPBakery, or Gutenberg.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6401\" data-end=\"6479\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6403\" data-end=\"6479\">Understanding of SEO fundamentals and performance optimization techniques.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6480\" data-end=\"6520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6482\" data-end=\"6520\">Familiarity with REST APIs and AJAX.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6521\" data-end=\"6572\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6523\" data-end=\"6572\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6574\" data-end=\"6577\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6624\"><strong data-start=\"6582\" data-end=\"6624\">Database Administrator (DBA) &ndash; Level 7</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6626\" data-end=\"7023\">The Database Administrator is responsible for the installation, configuration, maintenance, and performance tuning of relational database systems to ensure high levels of availability, security, and performance. The role involves managing production, development, and test databases across multiple projects and ensuring data integrity, backup, and recovery strategies are effectively implemented.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7025\" data-end=\"7278\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with RDBMS platforms such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MS SQL Server, and be capable of working collaboratively with development and infrastructure teams to support application performance and scalability.<br><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"81\"><strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"81\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<li data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"205\">\r\n<p data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"205\"><strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"109\">Database Management:</strong> Install, configure, upgrade, and maintain database systems (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MS SQL, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"334\"><strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"231\">Performance Tuning:</strong> Monitor and optimize database performance through indexing, query tuning, and resource optimization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"454\"><strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"359\">Backup &amp; Recovery:</strong> Develop and manage backup and recovery strategies to ensure data integrity and availability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"574\"><strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"487\">Security &amp; Access Control:</strong> Implement database security policies, user roles, and permissions to safeguard data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"688\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"596\">Data Migration:</strong> Support data import/export, transformation, and migration activities across environments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"724\">Monitoring &amp; Troubleshooting:</strong> Monitor database health and proactively resolve issues related to performance, security, or corruption.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"954\"><strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"851\">Collaboration:</strong> Work with developers, DevOps, and project teams to support efficient database integration and usage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1078\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"975\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain clear and up-to-date documentation for database architecture, procedures, and configurations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1105\"><strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1105\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1622\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1202\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1258\">5+ years of experience as a Database Administrator.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1344\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1363\">Proficient in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1431\">RDBMS platforms (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MS SQL Server, or Oracle)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1512\">Writing and optimizing SQL queries, stored procedures, triggers, and views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1563\">Backup, recovery, and replication techniques</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1622\">Experience with monitoring tools and performance tuning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1646\"><strong data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1646\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1708\">Knowledge of NoSQL databases (MongoDB, Redis) is a plus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1767\">Familiarity with Linux/Unix-based server environments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1847\">Experience in setting up high availability and disaster recovery solutions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1936\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1936\">Understanding of database automation and scripting (e.g., Bash, Python, PowerShell).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1988\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"1993\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2032\"><strong data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2032\">Senior iOS Developer &ndash; Level 8</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2432\">The Senior iOS Developer will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining high-quality iOS applications. The role demands strong technical skills, a passion for mobile technologies, and the ability to lead and mentor junior developers. The candidate will play a key role in delivering scalable, secure, and performance-optimized applications across a variety of user-centric projects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2622\">The ideal candidate should have extensive experience in Swift, Objective-C, and iOS SDKs, with a deep understanding of Apple&rsquo;s design principles and application development best practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2627\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2657\"><strong data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2657\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"3553\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2755\"><strong data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2681\">App Development:</strong> Design and build advanced iOS applications using Swift and Objective-C.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2888\"><strong data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2784\">Architecture &amp; Design:</strong> Lead the technical design and architecture of applications, ensuring maintainability and scalability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"3012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"3012\"><strong data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2908\">Code Quality:</strong> Write clean, maintainable, and testable code; conduct code reviews and enforce development standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3111\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3111\"><strong data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3035\">API Integration:</strong> Integrate RESTful APIs and third-party services into mobile applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3231\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3231\"><strong data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3138\">Testing &amp; Debugging:</strong> Perform thorough testing, troubleshoot issues, and ensure optimal application performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3340\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3340\"><strong data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3254\">Team Mentorship:</strong> Mentor junior developers, guide technical decisions, and promote knowledge sharing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3473\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3473\"><strong data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3368\">App Store Deployment:</strong> Manage the full mobile application development life cycle, including App Store submission and updates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3553\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3553\"><strong data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3494\">Documentation:</strong> Create and maintain comprehensive technical documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3580\"><strong data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3580\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"4175\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3660\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3660\">Bachelor&rsquo;s or Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3711\">6+ years of experience in iOS app development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3797\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3824\">Strong proficiency in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3852\">Swift and Objective-C</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3892\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3892\">iOS SDK, Xcode, Interface Builder</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"3965\">Core Data, Core Animation, Core Location, and other iOS frameworks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4022\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"4022\">Experience with version control systems (e.g., Git).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4098\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4098\">Solid understanding of mobile architecture patterns (MVC, MVVM, VIPER).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4175\">Experience with push notifications, background tasks, and offline storage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4180\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4199\"><strong data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4199\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4541\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4252\">Experience in publishing apps to the App Store.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4253\" data-end=\"4332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4332\">Knowledge of UI/UX standards for iOS and experience working with designers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4333\" data-end=\"4392\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4392\">Familiarity with CI/CD tools (e.g., Fastlane, Jenkins).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4489\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4489\">Experience in integrating analytics and crash reporting tools (e.g., Firebase, Crashlytics).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4541\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4546\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4576\"><strong data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4576\">UX Designer &ndash; Level 6</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4963\">The UX Designer is responsible for creating intuitive, user-centered design solutions that enhance the usability and user experience of web and mobile applications. The role involves collaborating closely with UI designers, developers, project managers, and stakeholders to gather requirements, conduct user research, and translate insights into wireframes, prototypes, and user flows.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5112\">The ideal candidate is creative, detail-oriented, and passionate about improving user experience through thoughtful design and usability practices.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5114\" data-end=\"5117\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5147\"><strong data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5147\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5893\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5149\" data-end=\"5276\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5276\"><strong data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5169\">User Research:</strong> Conduct user research, interviews, surveys, and usability tests to understand user needs and behaviours.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5277\" data-end=\"5411\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5279\" data-end=\"5411\"><strong data-start=\"5279\" data-end=\"5309\">Wireframing &amp; Prototyping:</strong> Create wireframes, mockups, and interactive prototypes using tools like Figma, Adobe XD, or Sketch.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5414\" data-end=\"5520\"><strong data-start=\"5414\" data-end=\"5439\">User Journey Mapping:</strong> Develop user personas, journey maps, and user flows to guide design decisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5653\"><strong data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5541\">Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with UI designers, developers, and project teams to ensure seamless user experience integration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5654\" data-end=\"5787\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5787\"><strong data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5679\">Feedback &amp; Testing:</strong> Incorporate feedback from stakeholders and users to refine designs; conduct A/B testing where applicable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5788\" data-end=\"5893\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5893\"><strong data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5815\">Design Documentation:</strong> Prepare design specifications and documentation to support development teams.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5898\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"5920\"><strong data-start=\"5904\" data-end=\"5920\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5922\" data-end=\"6449\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5922\" data-end=\"6035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5924\" data-end=\"6035\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Design, Human-Computer Interaction (HCI), Computer Science, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6094\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6094\">4+ years of experience in UX design or a similar role.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6095\" data-end=\"6180\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6180\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6181\" data-end=\"6263\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6183\" data-end=\"6263\">Proficient in UX tools such as Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch, InVision, or Balsamiq.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6264\" data-end=\"6370\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6266\" data-end=\"6370\">Understanding of design principles, responsive design, accessibility, and user-centered methodologies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6371\" data-end=\"6449\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6373\" data-end=\"6449\">Familiarity with HTML/CSS is a plus (for effective developer communication).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6454\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6456\" data-end=\"6473\"><strong data-start=\"6460\" data-end=\"6473\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6475\" data-end=\"6691\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6475\" data-end=\"6541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6477\" data-end=\"6541\">Basic understanding of UI design and visual design principles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6542\" data-end=\"6622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6544\" data-end=\"6622\">Experience working on government, enterprise, or public-facing applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"6691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6691\">Strong communication and presentation skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6693\" data-end=\"6696\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6698\" data-end=\"6748\"><strong data-start=\"6701\" data-end=\"6748\">Programmer &ndash; Full Stack Developer &ndash; Level 6</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6750\" data-end=\"7080\">The Full Stack Developer is responsible for developing both the front-end and back-end components of web applications. The role demands hands-on experience with modern web development technologies, the ability to build responsive user interfaces, and the integration of APIs and databases to deliver complete end-to-end solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7082\" data-end=\"7273\">This position is ideal for developers with foundational knowledge across the technology stack who are eager to grow into more complex, scalable systems in a collaborative project environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7275\" data-end=\"7278\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7280\" data-end=\"7308\"><strong data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7308\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7310\" data-end=\"7835\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7310\" data-end=\"7468\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7312\" data-end=\"7468\"><strong data-start=\"7312\" data-end=\"7338\">Front-End Development:</strong> Develop responsive and interactive user interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frameworks like React.js or Angular.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7469\" data-end=\"7597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7471\" data-end=\"7597\"><strong data-start=\"7471\" data-end=\"7496\">Back-End Development:</strong> Build scalable backend services and APIs using technologies such as Node.js, PHP, Python, or Java.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7598\" data-end=\"7722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7600\" data-end=\"7722\"><strong data-start=\"7600\" data-end=\"7625\">Database Integration:</strong> Design, implement, and manage relational (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and/or NoSQL (MongoDB) databases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7723\" data-end=\"7835\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7725\" data-end=\"7835\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"7725\" data-end=\"7759\">API Development &amp; Integration:</strong> Create and consume RESTful APIs to connect frontend and backend components.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"234\">\r\n<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"234\"><strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"137\">Debugging &amp; Testing:</strong> Identify bugs, write test cases, and ensure the application performs efficiently and reliably.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"348\">\r\n<p data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"348\"><strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"257\">Version Control:</strong> Collaborate with the team using version control systems like Git to manage code changes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"464\">\r\n<p data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"464\"><strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"374\">Team Collaboration:</strong> Work with designers, QA, and project managers to deliver user-focused features on time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"564\"><strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"485\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain technical documentation for code, processes, and system architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"591\"><strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"591\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"668\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"731\">4+ years of hands-on experience in full-stack development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"817\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"837\">Proficiency in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<li data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"913\"><strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"856\">Front-end:</strong> HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (React.js, Angular, or Vue.js)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"963\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"931\">Back-end:</strong> Node.js, PHP, Python, or Java</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1014\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"982\">Databases:</strong> MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1060\">Familiarity with Git and CI/CD practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1122\">Understanding of RESTful APIs and secure coding principles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1146\"><strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1146\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1409\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1211\">Exposure to cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or GCP) is a plus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1282\">Experience with containerization (Docker) or deployment pipelines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1357\">Ability to optimize performance and troubleshoot cross-browser issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1409\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1409\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1465\"><strong data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1465\">Programmer &ndash; AngularJS Developer &ndash; Level 6</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1737\">The AngularJS Developer is responsible for developing and maintaining dynamic web applications using the AngularJS framework. The role includes creating reusable components, integrating RESTful APIs, and ensuring application performance, responsiveness, and scalability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1951\">The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in front-end development, a good understanding of JavaScript frameworks, and the ability to collaborate effectively with backend developers and UI/UX designers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1956\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1986\"><strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1986\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2096\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2096\"><strong data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2016\">Front-End Development:</strong> Build responsive web interfaces using AngularJS, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2198\"><strong data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2120\">Component Design:</strong> Develop reusable UI components and integrate them into application modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2281\"><strong data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2221\">API Integration:</strong> Work with RESTful APIs to fetch and display dynamic data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2386\"><strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2316\">Cross-Browser Compatibility:</strong> Ensure applications function across different browsers and devices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2481\"><strong data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2406\">Code Quality:</strong> Write clean, modular, and maintainable code; conduct basic unit testing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2609\"><strong data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2502\">Collaboration:</strong> Coordinate with backend developers, designers, and QA teams for feature integration and troubleshooting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2704\"><strong data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2630\">Documentation:</strong> Maintain proper documentation for developed modules and coding practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2731\"><strong data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2731\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2808\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2861\">4+ years of experience in AngularJS development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2947\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2966\">Proficient in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2988\">AngularJS (1.x)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3024\">HTML, CSS, JavaScript, jQuery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3051\">REST API integration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3102\">Familiarity with version control tools like Git.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3107\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3126\"><strong data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3126\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3207\">Experience with modern JavaScript frameworks (Angular 2+, React) is a plus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3287\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3287\">Understanding of MVC architecture and single-page application (SPA) design.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3334\">Good debugging and troubleshooting skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3386\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3391\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3440\"><strong data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3440\">Programmer &ndash; Node.js Developer &ndash; Level 6</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3442\" data-end=\"3701\">The Node.js Developer is responsible for building server-side applications and APIs using Node.js. The role involves developing backend logic, managing databases, and integrating with front-end components to create scalable, high-performance web applications.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3916\">The ideal candidate should have solid experience in JavaScript and Node.js frameworks, be comfortable working in an agile environment, and demonstrate a strong understanding of backend architecture and API design.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3921\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"3951\"><strong data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3951\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4778\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"4080\"><strong data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3979\">Backend Development:</strong> Develop RESTful APIs and backend services using Node.js and related frameworks (e.g., Express.js).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4081\" data-end=\"4177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4177\"><strong data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4108\">Database Integration:</strong> Design and manage databases such as MongoDB, MySQL, or PostgreSQL.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4275\"><strong data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4209\">Performance Optimization:</strong> Optimize application performance, scalability, and reliability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4376\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4376\"><strong data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4298\">API Integration:</strong> Connect applications with external services or internal systems using APIs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4483\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4483\"><strong data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4409\">Security &amp; Error Handling:</strong> Implement security best practices and proper error-handling mechanisms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4590\"><strong data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4510\">Testing &amp; Debugging:</strong> Conduct unit testing, troubleshoot bugs, and resolve performance bottlenecks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4690\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4690\"><strong data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4613\">Version Control:</strong> Use Git for source code management and collaborate with development teams.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4778\"><strong data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4711\">Documentation:</strong> Create technical documentation for services, APIs, and data flows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4783\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4805\"><strong data-start=\"4789\" data-end=\"4805\">Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"5231\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4882\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4883\" data-end=\"4956\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4956\">4+ years of hands-on experience in backend development using Node.js.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"5042\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"5042\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5043\" data-end=\"5177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5045\" data-end=\"5061\">Proficient in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5177\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5087\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5066\" data-end=\"5087\">Node.js, Express.js</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5111\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5092\" data-end=\"5111\">JavaScript (ES6+)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5114\" data-end=\"5147\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5116\" data-end=\"5147\">MongoDB, MySQL, or PostgreSQL</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5177\">RESTful API development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5178\" data-end=\"5231\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5180\" data-end=\"5231\">Familiarity with Git and version control workflows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5236\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5255\"><strong data-start=\"5242\" data-end=\"5255\">Desirable</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5257\" data-end=\"5510\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5257\" data-end=\"5332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5259\" data-end=\"5332\">Experience with authentication (OAuth, JWT) and middleware development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5406\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5406\">Knowledge of microservices architecture and asynchronous programming.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5458\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5458\">Exposure to containerization tools like Docker.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5459\" data-end=\"5510\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5461\" data-end=\"5510\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"430\">A presentation will be made by the Empaneled companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"594\">During the presentation by the companies, the proposed candidates will be interviewed through online (Webex Link) or offline mode by the Evaluation Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking of candidates&rsquo; interview will be done as follows -</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"807\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"100\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"100\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"4\" data-col-size=\"sm\">#</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"87\" data-col-size=\"md\">Candidate Interview Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"100\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Max Marks</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"807\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"302\">\r\n<td data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"206\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"289\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitability of profile</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"302\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"403\">\r\n<td data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"390\">Your relevant experience</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"403\">15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"504\">\r\n<td data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"408\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"491\" data-col-size=\"md\">Good understanding of design, development, best practices framework management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"504\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<td data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"592\" data-col-size=\"md\">Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"605\">20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"706\">\r\n<td data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"693\" data-col-size=\"md\">Strong ability to understand, deliberate and report</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"706\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"807\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"794\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"722\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Total</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"803\" data-is-only-node=\"\">100</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.<br><br>The last date for submission of response is 05/05/2025, 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001 ceochips@nic.in &amp; empl.chips@cgchips.in Tel: *91-771-4014158; Fax:+91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Proposed candidate&rsquo;s CVs</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2025-12-26 14:28:48',4,1,'2025-12-26 14:28:04',60,'2025-12-26 14:28:48',NULL,'2025-12-26 14:29:19',1,NULL,0,1,'2025-12-26',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for BuildNXT Project of CHiPS','2025-04-17','2025-04-22','2025-05-05 17:00:00','2025-05-05 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-08',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/BzqX75o6blaLU6GOcUaF4xhdfSpoeFDANhdRsNXR.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (100,0,80,'EoI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/DLR/2025',1,'Selection of PMU for Directorate of Land Records','3','<p>CHIPS is inviting all Tier-I empaneled agencies (as per Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',2,80,'2025-08-21 15:50:27',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,'<p>The Chhattisgarh Revenue &amp; Disaster Management Department manages all land records in the state through its digital platforms Bhuiyaan and Bhu-Map. Bhuiyaan provides citizens with online access to essential land documents like B-1 and P-II, while Bhu-Map offers GIS-based khasra maps for verifying land boundaries and ownership. At the village level, Patwaris maintain records, which are updated at the Tehsil and District levels by Revenue Officers.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The role of the PMU under this contract shall be :-</p>\r\n<p>Detailed Project Conceptual document &amp; RFP Preparation for Directorate of Land Records, Chhattisgarh</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Understanding &amp; Baseline Assessment</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Review existing land record systems (Bhuiyan, BhuNaksha, GIS layers, mutation workflows)</li>\r\n<li>Assess current infrastructure hardware, software, connectivity, power backup, security</li>\r\n<li>Identify gaps in digitization, interoperability, and citizen service delivery</li>\r\n<li>Stakeholder consultations: Revenue Dept., Markfed, Agriculture etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Detailed Project Conceptual Note Preparation</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A.Technical Architecture</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Design proposed system architecture (cloud/on-prem, hybrid models)</li>\r\n<li>Define integration points with Integrated Analysis Cell, GIS, MIS, e-Governance platforms.</li>\r\n<li>Recommend scalable modules: land parcel mapping, mutation tracking, grievance redressal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>B.Infrastructure Planning</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Specify LAN, UPS, surveillance, biometric, and telephony requirements per site.</li>\r\n<li>Prepare equipment list with OEM benchmarks, warranty, AMC, and SLA parameters.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>C.Financial Estimation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>CAPEX &amp; OPEX projections with itemized costing</li>\r\n<li>Funding sources State budget, GoI schemes (e.g., Digital India Land Records Modernization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Programme)</p>\r\n<p><strong>D.Implementation Roadmap</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Phased rollout strategy: pilot districts, statewide expansion.</li>\r\n<li>Risk mitigation, audit-readiness, and exit strategy documentation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Page <strong>5</strong> of <strong>9</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>RFP Preparation</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A.Drafting of Tender Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Prepare Request for Proposal (RFP) aligned with CVC, DoE, and CG State Procurement Rules</li>\r\n<li>Include:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>oEligibility criteria</p>\r\n<p>oTechnical &amp; financial evaluation matrix</p>\r\n<p>oCompliance checklists</p>\r\n<p>oPerformance benchmarks</p>\r\n<p><strong>B.Terms of Reference (ToR)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Define scope for system integrator/consultant: development, deployment, training, support</li>\r\n<li>Include KPIs, reporting formats, and escalation matrix</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>C.Bid Process Design</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suggest eProcurement workflow: pre-bid, clarifications, corrigenda, evaluation.</li>\r\n<li>Draft model contract, SLA framework, and penalty clauses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>D.<strong>Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Detailed Project Conceptual Note document</li>\r\n<li>RFP document</li>\r\n<li>Presentation decks for internal approvals</li>\r\n<li>Compliance matrix with reference to national guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><!-- notionvc: 7d3db35c-93b4-4ef9-9ebe-fa2c1234399c --></p>','<p>N/A</p>','<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</li>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li>For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Penalty terms</strong></p>\r\n<p>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms. <strong>Important</strong> <strong>Note:</strong> All other terms and conditions of tender <strong>165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025</strong> shall be&nbsp;applicable to this EOI.</p>\r\n<p><!-- notionvc: 3fad98e4-4106-4839-bc53-8b3d634da6f6 --></p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows -<br><br>\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"823\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"75\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"75\">\r\n<th data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"22\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"48\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"47\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"75\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"73\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"823\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"201\">\r\n<td data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"170\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"169\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Maximum Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"185\" data-col-size=\"xl\"><strong data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"184\" data-is-only-node=\"\">50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"201\"><strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"199\" data-is-only-node=\"\">50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"823\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<td data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"232\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"231\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"520\" data-col-size=\"xl\">&bull; Approach and Methodology<br>&bull; Understanding of the Project<br>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project<br>&bull; Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management<br>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"xl\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"823\" data-is-last-node=\"\">&bull; Suitability of profile<br>&bull; Years of relevant experience<br>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework<br>&bull; Ability to negotiate/persuade/influence<br>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report<br>&bull; Monitor the key SLAs<br>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><!-- notionvc: c1684585-e72a-44b6-9a7f-444d14a910ca --></p>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.<br><br>The last date for submission of response is 05/09/2025; 17:00 Hrs Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001 <br>ceochips@nic.in, <a href=\"mailto:empl.chips@cgchips.in\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a> <br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-05 15:58:19',4,1,'2026-01-02 15:57:10',80,'2026-01-05 15:58:19',NULL,'2026-01-05 18:03:41',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-01-05',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of PMU for Directorate of Land Records','2025-08-21','2025-08-25','2025-09-25 17:00:00','2025-09-25 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-15',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/kM7nUZAFQ7AyxNgcwolHL2qGaEHmzgL1B9yTSRit.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,1,'1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,2175483.87,0,0,391587.1,2567070.97,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (101,0,72,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/CGMSCL/2025',1,'Providing PMU Services to Support Planning, Procurement, and Execution of Health Infrastructure Projects for CGMSCL','6','<p>The objective of this Expression of Interest (EOI) is to engage a qualified agency to establish a Project Management Unit (PMU) to provide comprehensive support to Chhattisgarh Medical Services Corporation Limited (CGMSCL). The selected agency will assist in planning, managing, monitoring, and coordinating technical, procurement, and infrastructure-related activities across healthcare and engineering sectors. The PMU will play a key role in supporting bid process management, project execution oversight, reporting, stakeholder coordination, and infrastructure development including medical colleges, hospitals, and health facilities under various state and centrally sponsored schemes.<br><br></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"296\">CHIPS is inviting all Tier-I empaneled agencies (as per Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025, Raipur, dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR, and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"301\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"370\"><strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"370\">Objectives to be Achieved through the Consultancy Engagement</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"448\">The consultant team will be established to achieve the following objectives:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"502\"><strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"502\">1. Strengthen Project Planning and Execution</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<li data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<p data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"688\">Assist in the strategic planning, scheduling, and timely execution of healthcare infrastructure projects, including medical colleges, specialized hospitals, critical care blocks, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"733\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"733\">2. Efficient Bid Process Management</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<li data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"933\">Support CGMSCL in managing bid processes for procurement of goods, services, and infrastructure by facilitating preparation, verification, and evaluation of bidding documents and vendor engagement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"973\"><strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"973\">3. Monitoring and Coordination</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\n<li data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1145\">Ensure systematic monitoring of ongoing projects through dashboards, reports, and review mechanisms while coordinating with multiple stakeholders and execution agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1193\"><strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1193\">4. Technical and Transactional Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1363\">Provide subject matter expertise in areas like hospital infrastructure, procurement (including GeM), and project governance, including risk, cost, and time management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1412\"><strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1412\">5. Development of Health Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1610\">Support the state in the development, refurbishment, and expansion of government medical colleges and other health facilities by aligning with technical standards, guidelines, and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1672\"><strong data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1672\">6. Capacity Building and Institutional Strengthening</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1858\">Contribute to the institutional strengthening of CGMSCL through the introduction of systems, tools, and practices that ensure better control, accountability, and performance tracking.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1904\"><strong data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1904\">7. Improved Governance and Reporting</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2037\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2037\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"2037\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Establish project governance frameworks and reporting mechanisms that enable transparent decision-making and escalation of issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',2,72,'2026-01-06 16:21:26',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,'<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"25\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"25\">Introduction</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"534\">Chhattisgarh Medical Services Corporation Limited (CGMSCL), under the Department of Health and Family Welfare, Government of Chhattisgarh, is responsible for procurement, logistics, and development of health infrastructure across the state. In order to strengthen the planning, implementation, and monitoring of its expanding portfolio of health-related infrastructure and procurement projects, CGMSCL proposes to engage a professional consultancy firm for the deployment of a Project Management Unit (PMU).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"987\">The PMU will provide specialized technical and management support in key areas such as bid process management, infrastructure project oversight, procurement planning (including GeM), monitoring and reporting, and coordination among various stakeholders. The consultancy engagement is expected to enhance CGMSCL&rsquo;s operational efficiency and ensure the successful and timely delivery of critical health infrastructure projects and procurement processes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1190\">This initiative aligns with the state government&rsquo;s broader objective to improve healthcare access and quality through systematic development of medical infrastructure and efficient resource management.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1217\"><strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1217\">Purpose</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1557\">The purpose of this consultancy engagement is to onboard a qualified agency to establish a Project Management Unit (PMU) within CGMSCL. The PMU will provide professional, technical, and managerial support to streamline and strengthen the implementation of healthcare infrastructure projects, procurement processes, and monitoring systems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1599\">Through this engagement, CGMSCL aims to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1655\">Ensure timely and efficient execution of projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1714\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1714\">Enhance transparency and effectiveness in procurement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1785\">Strengthen coordination among stakeholders and executing agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1856\">Improve overall project governance, reporting, and accountability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"2036\">This initiative is vital to meet the increasing demand for quality healthcare infrastructure and services across Chhattisgarh under various state and centrally sponsored schemes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2066\"><strong data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2066\">Background</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2449\">Chhattisgarh Medical Services Corporation Limited (CGMSCL) functions as the central procurement and infrastructure development agency under the Department of Health and Family Welfare, Government of Chhattisgarh. It plays a crucial role in ensuring the availability of essential drugs, medical equipment, and execution of public healthcare infrastructure projects across the state.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2793\">In recent years, the scale and complexity of CGMSCL&rsquo;s operations have significantly increased, particularly with the launch of new initiatives like the establishment of medical colleges, critical care hospitals, and implementation of centrally sponsored schemes such as PM-ABHIM (Prime Minister&ndash;Ayushman Bharat Health Infrastructure Mission).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"3142\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">To support this expanding scope, there is a need for professional project management support to assist in procurement, coordination, infrastructure planning, and execution monitoring. In this context, CGMSCL intends to engage a competent agency to deploy a Project Management Unit (PMU) to provide the necessary technical and managerial expertise.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"21\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"21\">Scope of Work</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"135\">The objective of the PMU is to provide support in supporting, managing, and monitoring the activities of CGMSCL.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"181\">The broad support areas are mentioned below:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"186\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"212\"><strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"212\">Team Leader &ndash; PMU</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"242\"><strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"242\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"284\"><strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"284\">Strategic Planning &amp; Leadership</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"516\">\r\n<li data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"359\">\r\n<p data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"359\">Develop and oversee annual and quarterly workplans for all verticals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"450\">\r\n<p data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"450\">Align PMU deliverables with CGMSCL\'s strategic objectives and state health priorities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"516\">Facilitate inter-vertical coordination and resolve bottlenecks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"561\"><strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"561\">Monitoring &amp; Performance Oversight</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"640\">\r\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"640\">Establish KPIs for procurement, IT, finance, and infrastructure projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n<p data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"703\">Review vertical progress and recommend course corrections.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<p data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"784\">Ensure timely achievement of procurement cycles and infrastructure milestones.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"817\"><strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"817\">Stakeholder Engagement</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<li data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"874\">Represent CGMSCL in government and vendor meetings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"929\">Engage with NHM, DHS, and MoHFW to align activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"968\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"968\">Compliance &amp; Risk Management</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1057\">\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1057\">Ensure adherence to GFR, CVC guidelines, WHO/GMP norms, and state procurement laws.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1111\">Anticipate risks and develop mitigation strategies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1139\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1139\">Capacity Building</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1191\">Mentor PMU team members and vertical officers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1278\">Facilitate periodic training for district store officers, pharmacists, and IT staff.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1314\"><strong data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1314\">Reporting &amp; Communication</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1451\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1395\">Prepare consolidated monthly, quarterly, and annual reports for MD, CGMSCL.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1451\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1451\">Develop performance dashboards for high-level review.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1456\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1487\"><strong data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1487\">Information Technology</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1536\"><strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1536\">Knowledge Analyst (Administration &amp; IT)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1646\"><strong data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1550\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1553\">Provide research, data-driven insights, and knowledge products to strengthen decision-making.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1672\"><strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1672\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1741\">Collect, analyze, and interpret procurement/health system data.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1810\">Prepare SOPs, policy briefs, and evidence-based recommendations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1861\">Support IT-enabled knowledge management systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1879\"><strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1879\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1913\">Bi-monthly knowledge briefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1955\">Annual SOPs and policy recommendations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1960\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1998\"><strong data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1998\">System Integration Architect</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2128\"><strong data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2012\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2015\">Ensure interoperability of CGMSCL IT systems with GeM, HMIS, NextGen, DPDMIS, and other state/national platforms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2154\"><strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2154\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2209\">Design APIs, data flows, and security frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2243\">Lead IT integration projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2284\">Ensure compliance with NDHM standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2302\"><strong data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2302\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2331\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2331\">API integration report.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2365\">Bi-annual IT performance audit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2401\"><strong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2401\">Digital Health Expert</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2482\"><strong data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2415\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2418\">Drive CGMBCL\'s digital health initiatives in line with NDHWABOM.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2508\"><strong data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2508\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2680\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2562\">Develop telemedicine and e-prescription modules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2616\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2616\">Support integration with NDHIM Health ID systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2680\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2680\">Provide capacity-building to health workers on digital tools.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2698\"><strong data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2698\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2785\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2746\">Annual digital health implementation plan.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2785\">Quarterly adoption progress reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2812\"><strong data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2812\">Data Analyst</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2918\"><strong data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2826\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2829\">Provide advanced analytics for forecasting, decision support, and performance monitoring.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2944\"><strong data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2944\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2990\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2990\">Apply ML/AI for procurement forecasting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3034\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3034\">Develop dashboards on Tableau/Power BI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3069\">Conduct trend and risk analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3087\"><strong data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3087\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3155\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3122\">Monthly analytics dashboards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3155\">Predictive procurement models.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3200\"><strong data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3200\">Technical (Drugs &amp; Consumables)</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3251\"><strong data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3251\">Bid Process Manager &ndash; Drugs &amp; Consumables</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3293\"><strong data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3293\">Procurement Planning &amp; Strategy</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3706\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3470\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3470\">Lead the preparation of annual and quarterly procurement plans for essential drugs and consumables based on demand forecasting, consumption patterns, and EDL requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3606\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3606\">Align procurement quantities with budgetary allocations and ensure compliance with NHM, World Bank, and state financing frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3706\">Develop cost-benefit analyses and market surveys to support evidence-based procurement decisions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3747\"><strong data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3747\">Bid Management &amp; Documentation</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"4144\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3917\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3917\">Draft comprehensive bid documents, including pre-qualification criteria, technical specifications, evaluation methodologies, contract terms, and delivery schedules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"4042\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3920\" data-end=\"4042\">Ensure incorporation of WHO GMP requirements, pharmacopoeia compliance (IP/BP/USP/EU), and cold chain/storage standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4144\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4144\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Conduct vendor and market consultations prior to tender release to ensure practical specifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"30\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"30\">Tendering &amp; Evaluation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"400\">\r\n<li data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"193\">Coordinate and manage the complete tendering process-publication, pre-bid meetings, clarifications, evaluation of bids, negotiations, and award of contracts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"327\">\r\n<p data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"327\">Prepare comparative evaluation reports (technical and financial) with detailed scoring and justification for selection/rejection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"400\">Ensure adherence to GFR, CVC guidelines, and State Procurement Policy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"405\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"443\">Vendor &amp; Contract Management</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<li data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"526\">\r\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"526\">Maintain and update an empaneled vendor database with performance scorecards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"645\">Monitor vendor compliance on delivery timelines, product quality, packaging standards, and supply chain integrity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"755\">Support contract drafting, negotiation of liquidated damages, penalty clauses, and risk-sharing mechanisms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"760\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"795\"><strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"795\">Reporting &amp; Documentation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"899\">Submit monthly procurement status reports with insights on delays, risks, and corrective measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"998\">Maintain digital archives of tenders, bid evaluations, and contracts for audit and compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1118\">Provide quarterly presentations to MD, CGMSCL on procurement performance, cost savings achieved, and risk management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1182\"><strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1182\">Bid Process Consultant &ndash; GeM (Drugs &amp; Consumables)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1279\"><strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1196\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1199\">Ensure smooth execution of drug and consumable procurement through GeM platform.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1305\"><strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1305\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1427\">GeM procurement operations &ndash; Support in publishing tenders, managing reverse auctions, and update product catalogs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1516\">Compliance &amp; documentation &ndash; Ensure adherence to GFR, CVC, and procurement manuals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1586\">Capacity building &ndash; Train procurement officers on GeM workflows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1673\">Vendor management &ndash; Maintain vendor database; assist suppliers in GeM onboarding.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1765\">Monitoring &ndash; Track order placement, invoice generation, and delivery through GeM portal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1831\"><strong data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1831\">Consultant &ndash; Quality Assurance (Drugs &amp; Consumables)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1936\"><strong data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1845\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\">Ensure quality assurance and compliance of all drugs and consumables procured by CGMSCL.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1962\"><strong data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1962\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2053\">QA systems strengthening &ndash; Develop QA protocols based on WHO-GSDP and ISO standards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2140\">Inspection &amp; testing &ndash; Ensure all supplies undergo NABL-accredited batch testing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2225\">Vendor compliance &ndash; Conduct supplier audits for GMP and quality certifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2301\">Capacity building &ndash; Train warehouse staff on quality control measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2383\">Reporting &ndash; Maintain QA scorecards for suppliers and prepare QA audit reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2401\"><strong data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2401\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2469\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2434\">Quarterly QA audit reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2469\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2469\">Supplier performance scorecards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2474\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2503\"><strong data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2503\">Equipment &amp; Reagents</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2555\"><strong data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2555\">Bid Process Manager &ndash; Equipment &amp; Reagents</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2675\"><strong data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2569\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2572\">Lead procurement of biomedical equipment and reagents in compliance with national and global standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2701\"><strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2701\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2763\">Develop technical specifications with clinical experts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2827\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2827\">Draft tender documents and lead bid evaluation committees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2896\">Ensure vendor compliance with ISO 13485, CE/FDA certifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2971\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2971\">Oversee delivery, installation, commissioning, and AMC/CMC contracts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3031\">Conduct vendor performance reviews and risk assessments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3049\"><strong data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3049\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3141\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3089\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3089\">Annual equipment procurement plan.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3141\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3141\">Quarterly equipment installation and AMC reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3146\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3207\"><strong data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3207\">Bid Process Consultant &ndash; GeM (Equipment &amp; Reagents)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3233\"><strong data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3233\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3563\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3295\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3295\">Develop technical specifications with clinical experts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3359\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3359\">Draft tender documents and lead bid evaluation committees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3428\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3428\">Ensure vendor compliance with ISO 13485, CE/FDA certifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3503\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3503\">Oversee delivery, installation, commissioning, and AMC/CMC contracts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3563\">Conduct vendor performance reviews and risk assessments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3568\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3584\"><strong data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3584\">Finance</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3630\"><strong data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3630\">Contract Management Expert (Finance)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3696\"><strong data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3644\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3647\">Draft, manage, and enforce procurement contracts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3722\"><strong data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3722\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3883\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3782\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3782\">Draft legally compliant procurement/service contracts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3840\">Monitor milestones, penalties, and payment schedules.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3883\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3883\">Resolve disputes and support litigation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3901\"><strong data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3901\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3903\" data-end=\"3935\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3935\">Contract compliance reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"3965\">Risk management dashboards.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3970\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"3994\"><strong data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3994\">Finance Expert</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4101\"><strong data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4008\">Purpose:</strong><br data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4011\">Manage procurement finance, budgeting, and disbursement in line with NHM/World Bank norms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4127\"><strong data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4127\">Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4295\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4175\">Prepare budgets and expenditure forecasts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4231\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4231\">Monitor financial disbursement and vendor payments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4295\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4295\">Ensure compliance with NHM, CAG, and World Bank requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4313\"><strong data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4313\">Deliverables</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4388\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4345\">Monthly financial reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4388\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4388\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Annual audited accounts for procurement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>N/A</p>','<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\">Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"124\">Payment to the selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"513\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"246\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a man-month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"513\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"513\" data-is-last-node=\"\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, the selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man-month payment in the event that the selected bidder has performed its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\">Penalty Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"92\">\r\n<li data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"92\">\r\n<p data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"92\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"112\"><strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"112\">Important Note</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"269\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">All other terms and conditions of Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025, Raipur, dated 20/02/2025 shall be applicable to this EOI.</p>',NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-694980ec-09e8-8320-8a86-6c84d951a007-5\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-130\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"65320b34-cf46-4354-89fc-610647a37cb6\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"444\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"444\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise (via video conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"590\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (physically/via video conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Maximum Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&bull; Approach and Methodology</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Understanding of the Project</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&bull; Suitability of profile</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Years of relevant experience</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Ability to negotiate/persuade/influence</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Monitor the key SLAs</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 15/09/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p>ceochips@nic.in, <a href=\"mailto:empl.chips@cgchips.in\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></p>\r\n<p>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-694980ec-09e8-8320-8a86-6c84d951a007-9\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-138\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"c20750f7-e8a0-447a-bacb-6b2590255deb\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"132\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"28\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"28\">Signed copy of this EOI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"79\">\r\n<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"79\">Copy of approach and methodology presentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"132\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"132\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-20 11:10:28',4,1,'2026-01-06 16:31:56',72,'2026-01-20 11:10:28',NULL,'2026-01-20 11:23:22',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-01-20',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Providing PMU Services to Support Planning, Procurement, and Execution of Health Infrastructure Projects for CGMSCL','2026-01-20','2026-01-19','2026-01-22 05:00:00','2026-01-23 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-19',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/9Iukc83QBwqKqoVV1pN29oJdFhquu11kdTLYQV6J.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,1,'3,4,5,8',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,25508306.45,0,0,4591495.16,30099801.61,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (102,0,73,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/CSPDCL/2025',1,'Availing Advisory / consultant Services for IT/Cyber Security In CSPDCL','4','<p>CHIPS is inviting Tier-I empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>',2,73,'2026-01-06 16:55:16',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,'<p>Chhattisgarh State Power Distribution Company Limited (CSPDCL) is the principal power distribution utility of the State of Chhattisgarh, entrusted with the responsibility of ensuring reliable, efficient, and secure delivery of electricity to millions of consumers across urban and rural areas. As part of its commitment to digital transformation and operational excellence, CSPDCL has adopted a range of IT systems, applications, and infrastructure to support its core business functions such as billing, customer management, network operations, SCADA, and data analytics.<br><br>With the increasing reliance on digital technologies, the complexity and scope of cybersecurity risks have also grown significantly. Recognizing the critical importance of safeguarding its information assets, infrastructure, and services, CSPDCL intends to undertake a comprehensive review and assessment of its current IT and cybersecurity posture. This initiative will help identify vulnerabilities, ensure regulatory compliance, and formulate a strategic roadmap for strengthening its cybersecurity capabilities.<br><br>Accordingly, CSPDCL invites Expressions of Interest (EOI) from reputed Tier-I consultancy firms with demonstrated expertise in cybersecurity advisory services, assessment, and roadmap development. The selected firm will be expected to carry out a detailed assessment of the \"As-Is\" cybersecurity landscape and assist in shaping a robust and future-ready cybersecurity framework for the organization.<br><br>As part of its commitment to efficiency, transparency, and service excellence, CSPDCL operates a centralized Data Centre that hosts critical applications and data. With increasing digitization and dependence on IT systems, the threat surface for cybersecurity risks has expanded, making it imperative to safeguard systems against potential cyber threats, data breaches, and regulatory non-compliance.<br><br>Data Centre, DR Centre , Customer Call Centre and Cyber Security Operation Centre in CSPDCL are ISO 27001:2022 certified. In light of emerging cyber challenges and evolving regulatory frameworks of cyber security , CSPDCL seeks to engage a reputed Tier-I consultancy firm, who will assist in conducting a comprehensive \"As-Is\" assessment of the current IT and cybersecurity environment, and formulating a robust cybersecurity roadmap aligned with best practices and compliance requirements as per the scope of work stipulated in Clause 4 of this EOI.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The scope of work includes but not limited to the following activities:<br><br></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>#</th>\r\n<th>Phase</th>\r\n<th>Activities</th>\r\n<th>Deliverables</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>1</td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase-I</strong>As-Is Assessment</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>1) Review Existing Security Landscape: </strong></p>\r\n<p>a) Review and assess the current security architecture/landscape in existing on-premise Data Centre and Cyber Security Operations Centre (C-SOC).</p>\r\n<p>b) Review of cyber security products/components deployed in CSPDCL Data Centre.</p>\r\n<p>c) Review of product integration with SIEM &amp; WAF.</p>\r\n<p>d) Review obsolescence of the products deployed, if any.</p>\r\n<p>e) Review the OEM support (AMC/ATS/Subscription) for various security products deployed in CSPDCL.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>As-Is Report</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase-II</strong>To-Be Assessment</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>2) Security Roadmap:</strong></p>\r\n<p>a) Prepare a blueprint and roadmap for strengthening cyber security envisaged in the next three to five years, including implementation model (on-prem or cloud).</p>\r\n<p>b) Advise on existing products, i.e. requirement/continual OEM support (AMC/ATS/Subscription) for products deployed in CSPDCL for cyber security (list attached).</p>\r\n<p>c) Advise on future product requirements to be deployed to further strengthen the security landscape (sample list attached).</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>To-Be Report</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td><strong>Phase-III</strong>Gap Assessment</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>3) Gap Assessment:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Submit a gap assessment report identifying weaknesses, risks, and areas of improvement in the company&rsquo;s cyber security framework. The report shall compare the current state of security practices against industry standards, best practices, or regulatory requirements.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>Gap Assessment Report</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Deployment can be done in any of the following pattern:-<br><br></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Months</th>\r\n<th>Option 1</th>\r\n<th>Option 2</th>\r\n<th>Option 3</th>\r\n<th>Option 4</th>\r\n<th>Option 5</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>First</td>\r\n<td>4</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Second</td>\r\n<td>4</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Third</td>\r\n<td>&ndash;</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Fourth</td>\r\n<td>&ndash;</td>\r\n<td>&ndash;</td>\r\n<td>&ndash;</td>\r\n<td>&ndash;</td>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>8</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>8</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>8</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>8</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>8</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"24\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"24\">Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"131\">Payment to the selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"520\">\r\n<li data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"253\">\r\n<p data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"253\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a man-month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"520\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, the selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man-month payment in the event that the selected bidder has performed its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"552\"><strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"552\">Penalty Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"625\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"630\">\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"650\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"650\">Important Note</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"807\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">All other terms and conditions of Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025, Raipur, dated 20/02/2025 shall be applicable to this EOI.</p>',NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-694980ec-09e8-8320-8a86-6c84d951a007-11\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-142\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e62e8630-68f1-4c9c-946c-7a51e63ee36f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"444\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"444\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise (via video conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"590\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (physically/via video conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows -</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Maximum Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&bull; Approach and Methodology</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Understanding of the Project</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&bull; Suitability of profile</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Years of relevant experience</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Ability to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. The last date for submission of response is 24/09/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p>ceochips@nic.in, <a href=\"mailto:empl.chips@cgchips.in\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></p>\r\n<p>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI.</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per Annexure - A.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-19 16:54:03',4,1,'2026-01-06 17:02:55',73,'2026-01-19 16:54:03',NULL,'2026-01-19 16:56:40',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-01-19',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest for Availing Advisory Consultant Services for IT Cyber Security In CSPDCL','2026-01-17','2026-01-18','2026-01-19 05:00:00','2026-01-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-19',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/gY0wJlg8ZCn2wB1Sda7ZjMQ20yUNRHshxWwGUKNc.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,1,'1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,12800000,0,0,2304000,15104000,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (103,0,77,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/CGBOCW/2025',1,'Engagement of Consultants to Strengthen Cess Collection under CGBOCW','12','<p>The objective of this Expression of Interest (EoI) is to engage suitable resources to support the Chhattisgarh Building and Other Construction Workers Welfare Board (CGBOCW) in strengthening and streamlining the Cess Collection process under the provisions of the Building and Other Construction Workers (Regulation of Employment and Conditions of Service) Act, 1996.</p>\r\n<p>CHIPS is inviting Tier-I all empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EOI.</p>\r\n<p>Issuer / Address for business query and Correspondence</p>\r\n<p>The CEO,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur State Data Centre Building,</p>\r\n<p>Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001,</p>\r\n<p>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 71-4014158</p>\r\n<p>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',2,77,'2026-01-06 17:30:05',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,'<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"25\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"25\">Introduction</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"444\">The Chhattisgarh Building and Other Construction Workers Welfare Board (CGBOCW) is responsible for the collection and management of cess under the provisions of the Building and Other Construction Workers (Regulation of Employment and Conditions of Service) Act, 1996. The cess serves as a critical financial resource to ensure welfare, safety, and better working conditions for construction workers across the state.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"809\">In order to strengthen the efficiency, transparency, and accountability of the cess collection process, CGBOCW proposes to engage competent resources with expertise in relevant domains. This initiative is aimed at modernizing the collection system through digital tools, data-driven monitoring, and improved coordination with related departments and institutions.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"836\"><strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"836\">Purpose</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"972\">The purpose of this EoI is to invite applications from eligible service providers/agencies to provide professional resources who will:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<li data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1037\">Support the Board in enhancing the cess collection process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1138\">Develop and implement digital and technical solutions to improve demand and recovery efficiency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1234\">Establish effective coordination mechanisms with stakeholder departments and organizations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1328\">Provide strategic and advisory support to strengthen compliance and streamline processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1436\">Ensure that cess revenues are optimized and effectively utilized for the welfare of construction workers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1610\">This engagement will enable CGBOCW to enhance revenue mobilization, improve compliance, and create a transparent, technology-driven system for sustainable welfare delivery.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1640\"><strong data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1640\">Background</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"2143\">The Chhattisgarh Building and Other Construction Workers Welfare Board (CGBOCW) is mandated under the Building and Other Construction Workers (Regulation of Employment and Conditions of Service) Act, 1996 to safeguard the interests of construction workers through welfare measures funded by cess collection. The cess is levied and collected as a statutory contribution from construction activities, and it constitutes a vital resource for financing welfare schemes and benefits for registered workers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2623\">In recent years, with the increase in infrastructure development and construction activities across the State, the scope of cess collection has expanded significantly. However, challenges remain in terms of ensuring timely collection, accurate assessment, digital monitoring, and effective recovery mechanisms. Strengthening these processes is essential for maximizing revenue, improving compliance, and ensuring that resources are available for the intended welfare objectives.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2993\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">To address these challenges, CGBOCW intends to engage professional resources who will support the Board in enhancing cess collection mechanisms through technology-driven solutions, data analytics, strategic planning, and streamlined operational practices. This initiative is expected to bring efficiency, transparency, and accountability to the cess management system.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-694980ec-09e8-8320-8a86-6c84d951a007-16\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-152\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"c017c5f1-e411-4412-a33b-cbc5833bdce2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"76\">The scope of work includes, but is not limited to, the following activities:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"378\">The selected agency/service provider shall deploy suitable resources to support the Chhattisgarh Building and Other Construction Workers Welfare Board (CGBOCW) in strengthening and streamlining the cess collection process. The scope of work will broadly include, but not be limited to, the following:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"383\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"427\"><strong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"427\">1. Digital and Technical Solutions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<li data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"535\">Design and implement updated digital platforms and technical mechanisms for effective cess collection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"621\">Ensure integration with existing systems for transparency and real-time monitoring.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"668\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"668\">2. Data Analytics and Monitoring</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"763\">Develop analytical tools and monitoring frameworks for tracking cess demand and recovery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"852\">Generate regular reports and dashboards for decision-making and compliance monitoring.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"908\"><strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"908\">3. Coordination and Institutional Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1035\">Establish coordination with concerned departments, agencies, and institutions for smooth cess collection and enforcement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1104\">Facilitate inter-departmental cooperation to streamline processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1152\"><strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1152\">4. Strategy and Advisory Services</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1253\">Provide strategic inputs and recommendations to improve cess compliance and revenue generation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1332\">Support in developing policies and procedures for efficient cess management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1388\"><strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1388\">5. Simplification and Process Improvement</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1583\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1463\">Review existing cess collection practices and recommend improvements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1583\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1583\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Simplify assessment, recovery, and reporting mechanisms to ensure accountability, efficiency, and ease of compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>','<p>N/A</p>','<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"24\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"24\">Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"131\">Payment to the selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"523\">\r\n<li data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"253\">\r\n<p data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"253\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a man-month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"523\">\r\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"523\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, the selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man-month payment in the event that the selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"528\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"555\"><strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"555\">Penalty Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"628\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\"><strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\">Important Note</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"810\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">All other terms and conditions of Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025, Raipur, dated 20/02/2025 shall be applicable to this EOI.</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"444\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"444\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise (via video conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"590\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (physically/via video conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"661\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows -</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Maximum Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&bull; Approach and Methodology</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Understanding of the Project</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&bull; Suitability of profile</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Years of relevant experience</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Good understanding of project management best practices framework</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Ability to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Excellent communication abilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\r\n<p>The last date for submission of response is 24/10/2025; 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</p>\r\n<p>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p>ceochips@nic.in, <a href=\"mailto:empl.chips@cgchips.in\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></p>\r\n<p>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"28\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"28\">Signed copy of this EOI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"79\">\r\n<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"79\">Copy of approach and methodology presentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"282\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"282\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number <strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"251\">165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025</strong>, Raipur, dated <strong data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"281\">20/02/2025</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-19 15:20:02',4,1,'2026-01-06 17:34:31',77,'2026-01-19 15:20:02',NULL,'2026-01-19 15:24:44',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-01-19',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EOI) for Engagement of Consultants to Strengthen Cess Collection under CGBOCW','2026-01-17','2026-01-18','2026-01-21 17:00:00','2026-01-22 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-19',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/4kVhzLiAmNwlz97jcsd5O8V1e4plq9qcsVRlJQEh.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,1,'2,3,4,5,7,8',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,5445354.84,0,0,980163.87,6425518.71,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (105,0,84,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/AWD/DS/2025',1,'Digital Secretariat Project of CHiPS','12','<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is inviting all empanelled agencies (as per the Tender No. <strong>160137/CEO/CHiPS/EMPL/Application &amp; Website Development/, dated 18/10/2024 </strong>to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><strong>Issuer</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">The CEO,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\">State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Civil Lines, Raipur,</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">Chhattisgarh - 492001</p>\r\n<p class=\"p5\">Tel: +91 7714014158; Fax: +91 7714014158</p>\r\n<p class=\"p6\"><span class=\"s1\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:ceochips@nic.in\"><span class=\"s2\">ceochips@</span><span class=\"s3\">nic.in</span></a></span></p>',1,84,'2026-01-10 16:30:18',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,'<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e Chief Minister heads the High Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, Digital Secretariat, SLCM, GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of 1 year to provide support and maintenance to the Digital Secretariat Project through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"ede59655-1e3a-4576-a1b5-041c117ea2a8\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-162\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"c22eac43-dee4-4385-b297-9be502ed9813\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"64\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"64\">Full Stack Senior Developer (Minimum 5 Years Experience)</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"90\"><strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"90\">Job Description</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<li data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"309\">\r\n<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"309\">Development, maintenance, and deployment of all websites and modules under the Digital Secretariat Project, as well as independent portals covered in DS such as e-Docket (for WCD) and e-Vidhaan (for Vidhan Sabha).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"396\">Instrumental in understanding the requirements and design of the product/software.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"477\">\r\n<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"477\">Investigating problem areas followed by the software development life cycle.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"574\">Work closely with clients to gather feedback and make necessary adjustments to the software.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"650\">Facilitate root cause analysis of system issues and problem statements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"724\">Identify ideas to improve system performance and impact availability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"863\">Stay up to date with emerging trends and technologies in full stack development and apply them to solve challenging business problems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"942\">Confer with project managers to obtain information on software capabilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"965\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"965\">Requirements</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<li data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1069\">Minimum 5 years of experience with frontend and backend technologies &ndash; Java, Angular, and Node.js.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1160\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1160\">Minimum 5 years of experience with front-end technologies &ndash; HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1223\">Hands-on experience with mobile technologies, i.e., IONIC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1296\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1296\">More than 5 years of experience in database management &ndash; PostgreSQL.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1371\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1371\">Hands-on experience with RESTful APIs and micro-services architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1454\">Understanding of agile methodologies and software development life cycle (SDLC).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1521\">Full Stack Developer (Minimum 3 Years of Experience)</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1547\"><strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1547\">Job Description</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"2245\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1705\">Development and maintenance of DS modules as well as e-Docket (for WCD) and e-Vidhaan (for Vidhan Sabha) portals, including web and mobile applications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1796\">Capturing all requirements and clarifications from the client for better quality work.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1876\">Analyze client requirements and convert requirements into feasible designs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"2014\">Document and demonstrate solutions by developing documentation, flowcharts, layouts, diagrams, charts, code comments, and clear code.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2085\">Handling and solving tickets as well as user requests efficiently.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2192\">Working with senior developers and the project manager to ensure smooth execution and timely delivery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2245\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2245\">Issue resolution of all the onboarded departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2268\"><strong data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2268\">Requirements</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2695\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2356\">Minimum 2 years of experience in web application development frameworks &ndash; Angular.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2407\">Knowledge of database management &ndash; PostgreSQL.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2471\">Familiarity with IT service delivery and project execution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2520\">Strong troubleshooting and debugging skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2576\">Proficiency in MS Office and project documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2647\">Hands-on experience in technical support and software maintenance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2695\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2695\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>','<p>N/A</p>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-17 16:34:38',4,1,'2026-01-10 16:33:37',84,'2026-01-10 16:34:38',NULL,'2026-01-10 16:35:31',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-01-10',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Digital Secretariat Project of CHiPS','2026-01-17','2026-01-18','2026-01-19 12:00:00','2026-01-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-23',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/OIc9GwL4BX6V8sjnLvMIoDU3I0DYP9dKQoefV548.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,1,'9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (106,0,63,'EoI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/2025',1,'Selection of Technology & Advisory Consultants to Support CHiPS','6','<p>Objective CHIPS is inviting all Tier-I empaneled agencies (as per the Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025) to submit a proposal based on Evaluation Criteria, Scope of Work, Proposed Team, Qualification, TOR and Deployment Duration as mentioned in this EoI.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Issuer / Address for business query and Correspondence</strong> <br>The CEO, <br>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur <br>State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, <br>Raipur, Chhattisgarh&ndash;492001 <br>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158 <br>Email: ceochips@nic.in empl.chips@cgchips.in</p>',2,63,'2026-01-12 11:29:55',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,18,5,'<p>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS) serves as the nodal agency and primary driver of IT growth and the implementation of digital initiatives in the state of Chhattisgarh. In this capacity, CHiPS oversees the execution of numerous IT projects aimed at enhancing governance and public service delivery. At CHiPS, we frequently receive a wide variety of software-related projects from different departments, driving the need for a dedicated core IT team. To ensure the successful delivery of these projects, we are establishing a team comprising of key roles: Procurement Specialist, Business Analyst, and Solution Architect. Procurement Specialist will be responsible for forming of DPR, RFP and bid management process. Business Analyst will work closely with stakeholders to gather and analyze requirements, ensuring solutions align with business needs. Solution Architects will design robust technical architectures, select appropriate technologies, and guide development teams to create scalable and secure solutions, will also help in drafting the financial estimate as per the solution required. This collaborative approach and internal expertise will enable CHiPS to efficiently manage projects and deliver the projects.</p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>The role of the consultants under this contract shall be:-</p>\r\n<p>1. Advice CHiPS on best practices around policy and technology for streamlined project planning, implementation and operations. <br>2. Prepare Project Concept Note / Preliminary Proposal, Detailed Project Report (DPR) by undertaking Stakeholder Consultation, Needs Assessment, Technology Assessment and Financial Estimation by Primary, Secondary Research and the knowledge of working on government technology projects in the past.<br>3. Perform technology feasibility study by assessing existing infrastructure (baseline survey), evaluating alternative technologies or approaches, conduct SWOT, risk, and sustainability analysis.&nbsp;<br>4. Perform financial and economic analysis, estimating the capital and operating costs (CapEx &amp; OpEx). <br>5. Undertake the responsibility for preparation of Bid document (RFP) covering the following points:-</p>\r\n<p>a. Objective <br>b. Scope of Services of the Bidders <br>c. Bidding Process evaluation/award schedule <br>d. Suggestion for Qualifying requirements <br>e. Instruction to Bidders for submitting the technical, commercial proposal; <br>f. Description of the Technical, Commercial &amp; Financial Evaluation criteria; <br>g. Formats for submission of Bid proposal by the Bidder; <br>h. Design Formats of proposed contract to be signed by the selected Bidder and other Documents required for Bid process management (including any revision as per requirement) till signing of contract with the successful Bidder. <br>i. Identifying Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) for monitoring and evaluating the performance of the Party, including the methodology for monitoring KPIs. </p>\r\n<p>6. Design scalable, secure, high-performance architectures that align with business goals, technical constraints, regulatory and compliance needs. <br>7. Define and document the application architecture, data architecture, integration architecture, cloud/infrastructure strategy, security and compliance framework. <br>8. Coordinate and liaise with government departments as necessary based on the instruction of CHiPS. <br>9. The consultants will perform any other job assigned by CHiPS from time to time.</p>','<p>N/A</p>','<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"24\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"24\">Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"127\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"509\">\r\n<li data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"247\">\r\n<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"247\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"509\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be, selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"514\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"541\">Penalty Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<li data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"616\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"645\"><strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"645\">Important Note</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"773\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">All other terms and conditions of tender<br data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"690\">165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025 shall be applicable to this EOI.</p>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"248\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"442\">\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"442\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"588\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows -&nbsp;<br><br></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Particulars</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Bidder Presentation</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Candidate Interview</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>50 Marks</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>&bull; Understanding of the Government Technology Projects&bull; Proposed methodology for adoption of emerging technology in the government sector&bull; Prior consulting engagements in IT / Technology domain in the government sector</td>\r\n<td>&bull; Suitability of profile&bull; Years of relevant experience&bull; Relevant certifications&bull; Good understanding of projects in the government and public sector&bull; Prior experience of IT implementation monitoring and operations management in the government sector&bull; Excellent communication abilities</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications. <br><br>The last date for submission of response is 22/08/2025; 17:00 Hrs; Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</p>\r\n<p>CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001</p>\r\n<p>ceochips@nic.in, <a href=\"mailto:empl.chips@cgchips.in\">empl.chips@cgchips.in</a></p>\r\n<p>Tel: +91-771-4014158; Fax: +91 771-4014158</p>','<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"30002fbf-3d9d-44b5-8e8a-59a61d6778a0\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-170\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"80c2db2e-c511-4452-832d-a06f29ff2c31\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"329\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"28\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"28\">Signed copy of this EOI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"106\">Experience of the bidding firm along with relevant work orders/documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"157\">Copy of approach and methodology presentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"329\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\n<p data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"329\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number <strong data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"328\">165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-12 11:42:21',4,1,'2026-01-12 11:41:15',63,'2026-01-12 11:42:21',NULL,'2026-01-12 11:43:08',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-01-12',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Technology & Advisory Consultants to Support CHiPS','2025-08-08','2025-08-13','2025-08-22 17:00:00',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-08-25',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/TpwVU09iCW0p1pbfry83dWyFEMzrrJ33v29NbcGJ.pdf',NULL,0,3,1,0,'1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,7349516.13,0,0,1322912.9,8672429.03,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (110,0,29,'EoI/PMU/CGSAMVAD/2026',1,'Project Management Unit (PMU)-1 for Chhattisgarh Samvad, Public Relations Department','12','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 13.1pt 13.95pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Chhattisgarh Samvad, Public Relations Department is seeking to establish a Program Management Unit (PMU) with professional consultants for the planning, implementation, and monitoring of various activities of the department. The scope of work for the PMU will broadly encompass the comprehensive management of projects, activities, and components of Chhattisgarh Samvad, ensuring alignment with the government guidelines.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: HI;\">The PMU will provide end-to-end consultancy support and handholding to Chhattisgarh Samvad, facilitating the preparation of all necessary plans for the State to fulfil its role as a medium and a liaison in the regular exchange of government information between the government and the public. This support will include planning, policy formulation, and the monitoring of progress of the projects. Additionally, the PMU will focus on capacity building, knowledge management, and other critical aspects of program management and implementation.</span></p>',2,29,'2026-01-30 15:59:13',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,'<p class=\"MsoToc1\" style=\"tab-stops: 55.55pt right dotted 508.0pt;\">1. Factsheet&nbsp;<br>2. Introduction&nbsp;<br>3. Scope of Work&nbsp;<br>4. Team Composition&nbsp;<br>5. Duration of the Assignment<br>6. Payment Terms&nbsp;<br>7. Critical Information and Last Date for Response&nbsp;<br>8. Evaluation Process&nbsp;<br>9. Documents Required as response to this EoI</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if supportFields]><span style=\'font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";\r\n mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\n EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\'><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span></span><![endif]--></p>',NULL,'<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">The scope of work to be undertaken by Project Management Unit is given herein after and the same is merely illustrative and not exhaustive. The Project Management Unit shall thus have to consider the required output and include all further incidental activities that may be necessary for efficient and successful implementation and for achieving the ultimate objective of the assignment. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">The key activities for the proposed engagement will primarily consist of the following: <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Planning and Management Support</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Assisting in the strategic planning and management of Chhattisgarh Samvad projects and activities. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Project Design and Development</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Developing detailed project designs and ensuring they meet the required standards and guidelines.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Media Monitoring</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Monitoring of print, electronic, digital and social media, perception analysis, negative sentiment analysis and reporting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">PR Activities</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Plan and monitor PR activities on an ongoing basis across print media, electronic media, digital media and social media.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Campaign Planning</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Plan PR weekly/monthly/quarterly PR campaigns for the department.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">IT Related Support</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Assist Chhattisgarh Samvad and DPR in IT systems and processes.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">MIS Support</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Design solutions for Management Information Systems (MIS) for better project and activities tracking and reporting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Coordination and Stakeholder Management</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Ensuring effective coordination among various stakeholders, including state authorities, district authorities and other partners.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Other Support</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Providing additional support as required for the successful implementation of Chhattisgarh Samvad initiatives.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">1 Planning and Management Support</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Prepare all plans as per guidelines of Chhattisgarh Samvad based on the latest data available.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support for project identification, planning, design, procurement, monitoring, and reporting required for the project and activities.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support in planning, scheduling, and monitoring the projects using MIS/PMIS/latest IT tools and techniques.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assist in conducting regular meetings with all stakeholders, contractors, and other government entities to discuss progress and issues related to implementation and prepare minutes for recording and circulation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Establish all necessary records and procedures for maintaining/updating records for the entire project.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support in identifying activities eligible under Capacity Building, IEC funds, and developing annual action plans for the same.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assist in project planning for major project components.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">2 Progress Monitoring and Reporting Support</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support monitoring and reviewing project and activities progress in terms of physical and financial targets and against overall monitoring parameters.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support developing and monitoring annual work plans and budgets, including annual milestones.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Prepare consolidated progress reports for project management, including identifying emerging issues and recommendations to resolve them.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Generate reports on physical and financial progress. The reports will summarize the State-wise and project-wise work performed during the reported period, identifying problems encountered, and indicating corrective actions taken or recommended.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Prepare and submit project progress reports on behalf of Chhattisgarh Samvad, describing the physical and financial progress of each sub-project, highlighting impediments to the quality and progress of the works, and recommending remedial actions.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">3 PR Activities</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Plan weekly and monthly campaigns for PR of the Government of Chhattisgarh.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Plan PR activities across print media, electronic media, digital media and social media.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Monitor PR activities in co-ordination with DPR and other agencies of DPR.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Suggest PR plan for special occasions like Labor day, women&rsquo;s day, Good governance week, etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Plan two-way communication activities between government and citizens.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">4 IT Related Support</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support the preparation of robust data base of the content produced by Chhattisgarh Samvad.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support speedy internalization of the MIS Portal and accurate reporting through the same and strive to improve the IT systems at State level and proactively recommend ways to make it more user-friendly and efficient.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Coordination of data entry and file uploads into systems to be used by the Chhattisgarh Samvad on a regular basis.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Work for the development appropriate MIS.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Furnishing of reports/Quarterly Progress report to the State Government, Central Government and other committees.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Encourage use of IT to produce training materials and manuals, increasingly impart an understanding and use of e-learning among staff.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Stay abreast of latest developments in the IT sector and transfer emerging technology as relevant to both to the Chhattisgarh Samvad and district authorities.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">5 Knowledge Management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Develop of a Strategy for overall capacity enhancement of all stakeholders of Chhattisgarh Samvad.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Facilitate in organizing workshops.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Improvement of technical capacities of Chhattisgarh Samvad officials towards resource optimization, monitoring, new technologies, emerging trends, etc. in Public Relations.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Suggest on best practices other countries and Indian States, which can be adapted for Chhattisgarh.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Explore and formulate suitable partnerships and collaborations with research and training institutions to build capacities in the domain of Public Relations.</span></p>',NULL,'<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt 12.0pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"> &nbsp;</span></span>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]-->For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>PENALTY TERMS</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the terms and conditions mentioned in Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025, Raipur dated 20/02/2025.</span></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-</span></p>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 95.4832%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; height: 292px;\" border=\"1\" width=\"93%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 11.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.6671%; border: 1pt solid black; padding: 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.4338%; border-top: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-left: none; padding: 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.15pt 0in .0001pt 4.2pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Bidder Presentation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8816%; border-top: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-left: none; padding: 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 63.6pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Candidate Interview</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 21.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.6671%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0in; height: 21.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.4338%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; padding: 0in; height: 21.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.65pt 0in .0001pt 20.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">50 <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Marks</span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8816%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; padding: 0in; height: 21.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">50 <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Marks</span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 21.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.6671%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in -.75pt .0001pt 6.2pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.2pt;\">Key </span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Evaluation Criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.4338%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; padding: 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Approach and Methodology</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Understanding of the Project</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8816%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; padding: 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Suitability of profile</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Years of relevant experience</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Good understanding of project management best practices framework</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Ability<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;</span>to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Excellent communication abilities</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>','<ul>\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 23-02-2026. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Presentation&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-30 17:20:41',4,1,'2026-01-30 16:45:42',29,'2026-01-30 17:20:41',NULL,'2026-02-03 12:22:57',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-02-03',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU)-1 for Chhattisgarh Samvad, Public Relations Department','2026-02-02','2026-02-09','2026-03-05 17:00:00','2026-03-06 12:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-09-12',1,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/70nRNqy2j4QzicQo1GwGgvE9f2B5S3S9aA8nr3G0.pdf',NULL,0,1,1,1,'1,2,3,4,5',0,0,1,NULL,'',1,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,15254196.43,0,0,2745755.36,17999951.79,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (111,0,29,'EoI/PMU/CGSAMVAD/PMS/2026',1,'Project Management Unit (PMU)-2 for Chhattisgarh Samvad, Public Relations Department','12','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 13.1pt 13.95pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Chhattisgarh Samvad, Public Relations Department is seeking to establish a Program Management Unit (PMU) with professional consultants for the planning, implementation, and monitoring of various activities of the department. The scope of work for the PMU will broadly encompass the comprehensive management of projects, activities, and components of Chhattisgarh Samvad, ensuring alignment with the government guidelines.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: HI;\">The PMU will provide end-to-end consultancy support and handholding to Chhattisgarh Samvad, facilitating the preparation of all necessary plans for the State to fulfil its role as a medium and a liaison in the regular exchange of government information between the government and the public. This support will include planning, policy formulation, and the monitoring of progress of the projects. Additionally, the PMU will focus on capacity building, knowledge management, and other critical aspects of program management and implementation.</span></p>',2,29,'2026-01-30 16:10:21',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,'<p>1. Factsheet&nbsp;<br>2. Introduction&nbsp;<br>3. Scope of Work&nbsp;<br>4. Team Composition&nbsp;<br>5. Duration of the Assignment<br>6. Payment Terms&nbsp;<br>7. Critical Information and Last Date for Response&nbsp;<br>8. Evaluation Process&nbsp;<br>9. Documents Required as response to this EoI</p>',NULL,'<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">The scope of work to be undertaken by Project Management Unit is given herein after and the same is merely illustrative and not exhaustive. The Project Management Unit shall thus have to consider the required output and include all further incidental activities that may be necessary for efficient and successful implementation and for achieving the ultimate objective of the assignment. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">The key activities for the proposed engagement will primarily consist of the following: <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Planning and Management Support</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Assisting in the strategic planning and management of Chhattisgarh Samvad projects and activities. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Financial Management</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Assist Chhattisgarh Samvad in managing finances through active facilitation of recovery of unpaid bills from other state government departments, districts and agencies and clear previous backlogs. Also assist Chhattisgarh Samvad in developing systems and processes for payment reconciliation between Samvad, government agencies and vendors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Bid Process Management</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Assist Chhattisgarh Samvad and DPR during the entire bidding process, including the preparation of bid documents, evaluation of bids, and contract management.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Other Support</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">: Providing additional support as required for the successful implementation of Chhattisgarh Samvad initiatives.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">1 Planning and Management Support</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Prepare all plans as per guidelines of Chhattisgarh Samvad based on the latest data available.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support for project identification, planning, design, procurement, monitoring, and reporting required for the project and activities.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support in planning, scheduling, and monitoring the projects using MIS/PMIS/latest IT tools and techniques.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assist in conducting regular meetings with all stakeholders, contractors, and other government entities to discuss progress and issues related to implementation, and prepare minutes for recording and circulation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Establish all necessary records and procedures for maintaining/updating records for the entire project.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support in identifying activities eligible under Capacity Building, IEC funds, and developing annual action plans for the same.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assist in project planning for major project components.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">2 Financial Management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Assist Chhattisgarh Samvad in managing finances through active facilitation of recovery of unpaid bills from other state government departments, districts and agencies and clear previous backlogs. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Assist Chhattisgarh Samvad in developing systems and processes for payment reconciliation between Samvad, government agencies and vendors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Prepare dashboards for real time analysis of pendency of receivables from source departments, districts and agencies.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Prepare dashboards for real time analysis of budget utilization of DPR across various media and various heads.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">3 Monetization of assets</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Explore the feasibility of undertaking projects on various financial models.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Identification of major revenue heads- Lease Rent/ User Charges/ other fee etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Explore best practices in revenue augmentation and technology interventions in Public Relations Department from other States.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assistance in finding multiple options including State departments/corporations and platforms that can be leveraged for increasing revenue.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">4 Bid Process and Contract Management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assist in all aspects of procurement, including issuing bid invitations, addenda/corrigenda, and clarifications to bidders\' queries, bid evaluation, selection of contractors, awarding contracts, and signing contracts.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Prepare contract documentation, including Letters of Invitation, conditions of contract, specifications, design parameters, bills of quantities, etc., for all sub-project components in close coordination with Chhattisgarh Samvad.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Finalize arrangements for contracting, including exploring options for Service Level Agreements.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Provide advice and guidance on modern procedures and guidelines for project implementation and management in general.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Arrange and coordinate multi-stage consultations proposed under the project and ensure modification of project components accordingly.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assist in contract administration and management of sub-projects.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Interpret the technical specifications for each sub-project.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 13.95pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: windowtext;\">5 Policy implementation and regulation</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Review of all policies and frameworks of Chhattisgarh Samvad, identifying policy gaps, if any, and the need for implementation of guidelines/rules/regulatory frameworks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Assess the current tariff and pricing structure as well as mechanisms for cost recovery and revenue generation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Suggest recommendations for revenue augmentation and improved collection practices by establishing simple, transparent, and consultative tariff regime and enforcement strategy.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Support Chhattisgarh Samvad in identifying suitable policy needs (such as Reuse, tariff, O&amp;M policies) and drafting the same, in order to achieve improved efficiency and better resource utilization.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Explore avenues of convergence of Chhattisgarh Samvad between existing institutions at state and district levels, and leveraging the same towards efficient resource management, O&amp;M and improved usage.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm 10.65pt 49.45pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: HI;\">f) Undertake an as-is assessment of Chhattisgarh Samvad usage by different departments.</span></p>',NULL,'<p class=\"MsoBodyText\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>\r\n<p>&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp;For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</p>\r\n<p><strong>PENALTY TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the terms and conditions mentioned in Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025, Raipur dated 20/02/2025.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</p>\r\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</p>\r\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</p>\r\n<p>The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 93.96%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 480; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 0in 0in; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid black; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid black;\" border=\"1\" width=\"93%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 11.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.64%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.48%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.15pt 0in .0001pt 4.2pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">BidderPresentation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.88%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 63.6pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">CandidateInterview</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 21.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.64%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.48%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.65pt 0in .0001pt 20.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">50 <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Marks</span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.88%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">50 <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Marks</span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 21.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.64%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in -.75pt .0001pt 6.2pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.2pt;\">Key </span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Evaluation Criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.48%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Approach and Methodology</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Understanding of the Project</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.88%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"42%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Suitability of profile</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Years of relevant experience</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Good understanding of project management best practices framework</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Ability<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Excellent communication abilities</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>','<ul>\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 23/02/2026. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:<br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n<li>Presentation</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2026-01-30 17:23:15',4,1,'2026-01-30 16:52:13',29,'2026-01-30 17:23:15',NULL,'2026-02-03 12:38:43',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-02-03',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU)-2 for Chhattisgarh Samvad, Public Relations Department','2026-02-02','2026-02-09','2026-02-23 17:00:00','2026-02-24 17:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-09-12',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/CCFDvCDUrrCRj54HDHqIqor2EdviXXfIr61KoUo8.pdf',NULL,0,2,1,1,'7,8',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,10897697.14,0,0,1961585.49,12859282.63,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (112,0,93,'EoI/DMFT/RAIGARH/CSF/PMU/2026',1,'Project Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation Trust (DMFT), Raigarh District','12','<p>The Project Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation Trust (DMFT), Raigarh District, will provide professional support to ensure effective planning, execution, monitoring, and evaluation of DMFT programs aimed at welfare in mining-affected areas.</p>',2,93,'2026-01-30 18:57:04',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,'<p>1. Factsheet&nbsp;<br>2. Introduction&nbsp;<br>3. Scope of Work&nbsp;<br>4. Team Composition&nbsp;<br>5. Duration of the Assignment&nbsp;<br>6. Payment Terms&nbsp;<br>7. Critical Information and Last Date for Response&nbsp;<br>8. Evaluation Process&nbsp;<br>9. Documents Required as response to this EoI&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<p>The PMU aims to strengthen DMFT\'s capacity for program management, achieving objectives through efficient human and financial resource handling. It focuses on timely delivery of project outputs, conceptualizing innovative public service projects, and serving as the key communication link between agencies and DMFT\'s&nbsp;Chairman/Managing Committee.</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Team Leader </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0.7pt 13.5pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Responsible for overall functioning of the Programme Management Unit (PMU). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0.6pt 13.5pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Build and maintain a high performing team in the PMU. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.85pt 0.8pt 13.5pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Provide effective program management, managing human and financial resources to effectively achieve the objectives of the DMFT. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0.95pt 13.5pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Ensure that deliverables are satisfied in a timely manner. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0.95pt 13.5pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Conceptualize a wide range of innovation projects for improved public service delivery. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0.85pt 13.5pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Act as a formal channel of communication between the selected Agency and DMFT.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Report to the Chairman and Managing Committee DMFT.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Project Officer (Engineering)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Study drawings and estimates of projects submitted by various line departments for approval under the District Mineral Foundation (DMFT).<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0.7pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Propose alterations and revisions required, if any. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Supervise various construction activities taken up under DMFT through regular field visits and raise flags at appropriate levels in case of potential delays, quality issues or cost overruns. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.65pt 0.5pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Ensure that the construction is following the drawings and estimates approved. Assess value of works done and assist DMFT in clearing bills/ vouchers for release of funds to the implementing agency.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.65pt 0.5pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Report to the Team Leader, PMU DMFT for any other work.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 2.65pt .5pt 14.75pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 2.65pt .5pt 14.75pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Project Officer (Finance)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 2.65pt .5pt 14.75pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Carry out the financial activities for DMFT.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Develop and maintain a comprehensive MIS for DMFT </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Oversee the collection, validation, and processing of data from various line departments. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Develop data entry forms, templates, and dashboards to facilitate data capture and analysis. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Upload relevant data points into the state and central portals, as per guidelines. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Generate periodic reports and dashboards to track KPIs/progress. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Conduct data analysis to identify trends, anomalies, and insights that inform decision-making.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.75pt 0.8pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Present findings and recommendations to Chairman-cum-Managing Trustee, DMFT. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.65pt 0.5pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Report to the Team Leader, PMU DMFT for any other work.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 2.65pt 0.5pt 14.75pt; padding-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</span></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 92.58%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 480; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 0in 0in; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid black; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid black;\" border=\"1\" width=\"92%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 15.9pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.46%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 15.9pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.16%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 15.9pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.15pt 0in .0001pt 4.2pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Bidder</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.3pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Presentation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.38%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 15.9pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"45%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 115%;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Candidate</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.45pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Interview</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 17.35pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.46%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 17.35pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.16%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 17.35pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.65pt 0in .0001pt 20.25pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">50 <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Marks</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.38%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 17.35pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"45%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 115%;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">50 <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Marks</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 29.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.46%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 29.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in -.75pt .0001pt 6.2pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\">Key </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Evaluation Criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.16%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 29.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Approach and Methodology</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of the Project</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.38%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 29.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"45%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Suitability of profile</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Years of relevant experience</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Good understanding of project management best practices framework</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ability<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Excellent communication abilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>','<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; tab-stops: 51.5pt; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 51.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">The last date for submission of response is XX/XX/2026, 05:00 PM. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">The<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>preferred<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>mode<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.35pt;\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\"> </span>communication<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>for<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>query<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.4pt;\"> </span>resolution<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>is<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\"> </span>through<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>email<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>to: </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines, Raipur 492001 </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:Empl.chips@cgchips.in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Empl.chips@cgchips.in</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">, </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:ceochips@nic.in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; color: blue; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">ceochips@nic.in</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">, </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Tel:<span style=\"letter-spacing: 3.8pt;\"> </span>+91-771-4014158;<span style=\"letter-spacing: 3.85pt;\"> </span>Fax: +91<span style=\"letter-spacing: 3.75pt;\"> </span>771-<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">4014158</span></span></p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EoI</li>\r\n<li>Copy <span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">of Approach and methodology presentation.</span></li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'555555','2026-02-03 17:27:36',4,1,'2026-02-03 17:05:02',93,'2026-02-03 17:27:36',NULL,'2026-02-03 23:10:40',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-02-03',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation Trust (DMFT), Raigarh District','2026-02-03','2026-02-10','2026-02-24 17:00:00','2026-02-27 1