 New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>Support audit processes and statutory compliance.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 2.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Associate Consultant (Social &amp; Other Sectors)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0in .0001pt 22.95pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Sectoral planning and social impact monitoring.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0in .0001pt 22.95pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Community and stakeholder engagement.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 2.4pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Support monitoring, evaluation, and documentation.</span></p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Key Deliverables</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Annual DMF Action Plan and implementation support</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Monthly and quarterly progress reports</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Financial and compliance reports</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">MIS dashboards and monitoring frameworks</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Impact assessment and documentation reports</span></li>\r\n</ul>','<p>P<span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">ayment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</span></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 480; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 0in 0in; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid black; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid black;\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 11.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.76%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.32%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 11.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 3.15pt 0in .0001pt 4.2pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: nor