 the institutional capacity of the State Aviation Department in the following areas:</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 87.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>i.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Formulation of the State Aviation Policy including policy research, stakeholder consultations, benchmarking with national and global practices, and drafting.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 87.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>ii.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Providing end-to-end PMU support for:</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 123.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Drafting of tenders (RFPs, RFQs, EOIs) </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 123.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Procurement of goods and services </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 123.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Airport upgradation and infrastructure development activities </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 123.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Activities related to airports under Regional Connectivity Scheme (RCS) </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Operationalisation and development of the New State Hangar</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 87.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>iii.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Supporting the state in:</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 123.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Effective implementation of aviation norms, rules, regulations, and industry best practices.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 123.55pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Promotion of employment in the aviation sector, including pilot training, cabin crew training, and other aviation-related skill development initiatives.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Promotion of aviation-related activities including Flying Training Organisations (FTOs).</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 16.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 87.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>iv.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; letter-spacing: -.1pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Coordination with national level flying academies for training, capacity building, and expansion opportunities</span></h1>',2,94,'2026-02-04 17:08:14',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,'<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Factsheet&nbsp;<br>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Background<br>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Objective<br>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Scope of Work<br>5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Team Composition<br>6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Change Management<br>7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Duration and Resource Deployment Plan for the Assignment&nbsp;<br>8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Evaluation Process<br>9.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Duration of Engagement&nbsp;<br>9.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Evaluation Process<br>10.&nbsp;&nbsp; Payment Terms<br>11.&nbsp;&nbsp; Penalty Terms<br>12.&nbsp;&nbsp; Documents required as response to this EoI&nbsp;<br>13.&nbsp; &nbsp;Critical Information and Last date for response&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<h1 style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The State Aviation Department seeks to engage a highly qualified professional resource to strengthen its institutional capacity in policy formulation, project management, and sectoral development for civil aviation. This engagement represents a strategic initiative to enhance the Department\'s capabilities in aviation sector development, infrastructure planning, and regulatory compliance. The selected professionals/firm will be responsible for:</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -90.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 90.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>I.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Policy Development</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Conduct comprehensive research on aviation sector trends, regulatory frameworks, and emerging technologies </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Drafting and finalizing the State Aviation Policy. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 126.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Undertaking stakeholder consultations, workshops, and coordination.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -90.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 90.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>II.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">PMU Support &amp; Project Management</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Drafting technical and financial documents including RFPs, RFQs, DPRs, contracts, MoUs etc.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the Department in the procurement of goods and services as per applicable State/GoI procurement norms. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Supporting airport development and upgradation under RCS and other State initiatives.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Monitoring and reporting progress of aviation infrastructure projects. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 126.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Providing technical assistance for operationalising the State Hangar.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -90.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 90.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>III.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Sectoral Coordination &amp; Promotion</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Guiding the Department in implementing aviation rules, safety norms, and compliance frameworks. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Facilitating partnerships with FTOs, aviation institutes, and industry stakeholders.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Liaising with National Aviation Academies and DGCA-approved institutions for training, collaboration, and establishment of training centres in the State. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 126.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Developing initiatives to promote aviation employment opportunities such as pilot training, cabin crew training, AME/ATC training etc.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -90.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 90.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>IV.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Administrative &amp; Analytical Support</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Preparing presentations, briefs, proposals, reports, and documentation. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting in stakeholder communication, meeting coordination, and follow-up actions. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left: 126.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Any other task assigned by the State Aviation Department related to aviation sector development.</span></h1>','<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 12.05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 51.55pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The envisaged duration of the assigned is 12 months. The resource may be extended as per requirement of project need.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 12.05pt 49.5pt 12.0pt 51.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Change Management</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0in 49.5pt .0001pt 87.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The selected agency (PMU) will have to give 2 weeks of advance notice to CHiPS for any change of deployed resource during the course of the assignment. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0in 49.5pt .0001pt 87.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The selected agency (PMU) will have to ensure that the knowledge transfer and handover during change of any resource for smooth transition. </span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0in 49.5pt .0001pt 87.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The replacement of any resource should be approved by CHiPS in writing.</span></h1>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.5pt; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 51.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Payment terms</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br><br>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule -</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 51.5pt; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 51.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Penalty Terms</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; tab-stops: 51.5pt; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 51.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0in 49.5pt 0.0001pt 76.5pt; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></p>\r\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A presentation will be made by the bidding companies about their understanding of the proposed area of work and solution proposed and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise. During the presentation by the companies the proposed candidates will be interviewed by the Evaluation Committee. The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-<br><br></span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"margin-left: 33.6pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.7pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"339\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Bidder Presentation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.9pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Key Resource Interview</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Max Marks</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.7pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"339\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\">50 Marks</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.9pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\">50 Marks</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt 0in;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Key Evaluation Criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.7pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"339\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of the project</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Approach and Methodology</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Work Plan</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Previous relevant work</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.9pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Educational qualification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Years of relevant experience</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 49.5pt .0001pt .5in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Good understanding of project requirements</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; tab-stops: 51.5pt; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 51.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; tab-stops: 51.5pt; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 51.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The last date for submission of response is 25/02/2026, 05:00 PM. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,Raipur 492001</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:Empl.chips@cgchips.in\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Empl.chips@cgchips.in</span></a><span style=\"letter-spacing: .25pt;\">, </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:ceochips@nic.in\"><span style=\"color: blue; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">ceochips@nic.in</span></a>,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tel:+91-771-4014158;Fax:+91771-<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">4014158</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Signed copy of this EoI</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Resumes of resource that will face the interview.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'547552','2026-02-06 20:31:15',3,1,'2026-02-06 20:19:48',94,'2026-02-06 20:31:15',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:37:10',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-02-06',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Setting up of Onsite Program Management Unit (PMU) for Directorate of Aviation, Chhattisgarh','2026-02-06','2026-02-11','2026-03-10 17:00:00','2026-03-11 12:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-09-19',0,0,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/ddJIrppJou2ugU0v4QZ1gv9lBl5djvd7XSecBMBe.pdf',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1,2,3,4,5',1,0,1,NULL,'',1,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (117,4,60,'EOI/CHiPS/EMPL/BuildNXT/2026',1,'Selection of Manpower Services for BuildNXT 2.0 Project of CHiPS','7','<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS, a Registered Society promoted by the Government of Chhattisgarh, is the nodal agency and prime mover for propelling IT growth and implementation of IT plans in the State. The Hon&rsquo;b1e Chief Minister heads the High-Powered Governing Council of CHiPS. It includes Minister for Finance &amp; Commercial Taxes, Minister for Commerce &amp; Industry, Minister for Education, and Minister for Panchayat &amp; Rural Development, Chief Secretary, representative from the Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology in Government of India and eminent persons from IT industry.<br><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">CHiPS is involved as State Designated Agency (SDA) in NeGPMMP&rsquo;s implementation of some mega IT Projects like CHOiCE, e-Procurement, SDC, SWAN, Wi-Fi, AMP, GIS and CSCs. A professional approach is being adopted for the implementation of IT Projects using the services of e-governance experts and consultants from corporate and academia. Chhattisgarh Infotech&nbsp;Promotion Society (CHiPS) intends to on-board an agency for a period of Three (3) year to assist and support Various State Government Departments in order to Implement IT Services/ E- Governance Services through Empanelment Project of CHiPS.</p>',1,60,'2026-02-10 15:28:55',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,11,18,0,NULL,'<p>1. Factsheet<br>2. Introduction<br>3. Scope of Work<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; 3.1&nbsp; Programmer &ndash; PHP Developer &ndash; Level 6<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3.1.1&nbsp; Key Responsibilities<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3.1.2&nbsp; Requirements<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3.1.3&nbsp; Desirable<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;3.2&nbsp; Asst. Programmer &ndash; Java J2EE &ndash; Level 4<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.2.1&nbsp; Key Responsibilities<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.2.2&nbsp; Requirements<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.2.3&nbsp; Desirable<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;3.3&nbsp; Assistant Programmer &ndash; Angular JS &ndash; Level 4<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.3.1&nbsp; Key Responsibilities<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.3.2&nbsp; Requirements<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.3.3&nbsp; Desirable<br>4. Team Composition<br>5. Resource Replacement<br>6. Duration of the Assignment<br>7. Critical Information and Last Date for Response<br>8. Evaluation Process<br>9. Documents Required as Response to this EoI</p>',NULL,'<h3 style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: 23.65pt;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>1. Programmer &ndash; PHP Developer &ndash; Level 6</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">The Programmer &ndash; PHP Developer will be responsible for the design, development, testing, deployment, and maintenance of scalable web applications using PHP and MVC frameworks. This role is suitable for experienced professionals<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>who can independently handle complex projects, mentor junior developers, and ensure delivery of high-quality and secure solutions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><strong>1.1 Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Application Development: Design, develop, and maintain advanced applications using PHP and MVC frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Database Management: Develop and optimize database structures, queries, and stored procedures in MySQL/PostgreSQL.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">API Development &amp; Integration: Build and consume RESTful APIs.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Code Review &amp; Optimization: Ensure clean, secure, reusable, and optimized code; conduct code reviews.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Documentation: Prepare and maintain structured technical documentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Team Leadership: Mentor junior/assistant programmers.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Collaboration: Work closely with UI/UX, QA, and project managers.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Security &amp; Compliance: Implement security best practices and ensure compliance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><strong>1.2 Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li6\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s degree in computer science, IT or related field.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li6\">Minimum 6 years of professional experience for candidates with a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree, or 4 years of professional experience for candidates with a Master&rsquo;s degree.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Strong knowledge of Core PHP, PHP frameworks, MySQL/PostgreSQL, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery, AJAX, Node.JS, rest API, React JS.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li6\">Ability to work independently and lead a team.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li6\">The candidate will not be required to work exclusively on a single technology stack; however, basic knowledge of other relevant technologies and readiness to learn additional frameworks or backend systems as per project requirements is essential.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li6\">The candidate should also have working knowledge of server-related activities including application deployment, configuration, and basic troubleshooting.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>1.3</strong>&nbsp; <strong>Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Familiarity with cloud platforms and containerization tools.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Knowledge of Server environment for code deployment.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Experience with Git, GitLab, Bitbucket.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>2. Asst. Programmer &ndash; Java J2EE &ndash; Level 4</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">The Assistant Programmer &ndash; Java J2EE will support design, development, testing, and maintenance of enterprise-level web applications using Java/J2EE technologies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><strong>2.1 Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Assist in development and maintenance of applications using Java/J2EE.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Participate in coding, debugging, and unit testing.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Collaborate with team for project execution.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Maintain technical documentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Stay updated with new Java technologies.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p5\"><strong>2.2 Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li7\">Bachelor&rsquo;s/master&rsquo;s in computer science, IT, or related field.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li7\">Minimum 3 years of professional experience for candidates with a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree, or 2 years of professional experience for candidates with a Master&rsquo;s degree.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Knowledge of JSP, Servlets, JDBC, Hibernate, Spring, Node.JS, rest API, React JS.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li7\">Understanding of SQL and relational databases.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li7\">The candidate will not be required to work exclusively on a single technology stack; however, basic knowledge of other relevant technologies and readiness to learn additional frameworks or backend systems as per project requirements is essential.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Preference will be given to experienced <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>candidates of work in Govt. Organization.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><strong>2.3 Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Experience in REST APIs, web services.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Knowledge of Server environment for code deployment.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Familiarity with Git.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li9\">Good communication skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p10\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p10\"><strong>3. Assistant Programmer &ndash; Angular JS &ndash; Level 4</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p7\">The <strong>Assistant Programmer &ndash; Angular JS<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span></strong>will be responsible for the design, development, testing, deployment, and maintenance of responsive and scalable web applications using Angular and related front-end technologies. This role is suitable for professionals who can work independently on assigned modules, collaborate effectively with backend and QA teams, and contribute to high-quality, secure application delivery.<br><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>3.1 Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Application Development: Design, develop, test, and maintain dynamic and responsive web applications using Angular JS and related front-end frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">UI Development: Implement user-friendly interfaces using HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, TypeScript, and Angular components.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">API Integration: Integrate front-end applications with backend services and RESTful APIs.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Code Quality &amp; Optimization: Write clean, modular, reusable, and optimized code following best practices.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Debugging &amp; Testing: Identify, troubleshoot, and resolve application issues; support unit and integration testing.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Documentation: Prepare and maintain technical documentation related to development and deployment activities.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Collaboration: Coordinate with backend developers, UI/UX designers, QA teams, and project managers to ensure timely delivery.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Security &amp; Compliance: Follow prescribed security guidelines and coding standards to ensure application safety and compliance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>3.2 Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Bachelor&rsquo;s or Master&rsquo;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Minimum 3 years of professional experience for candidates with a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree, or 2 years of professional experience for candidates with a Master&rsquo;s degree.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Strong knowledge of Angular JS, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, and responsive web design principles.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Experience in integrating RESTful APIs and working with JSON-based services.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Familiarity with version control systems such as Git.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively in a team environment.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">The candidate will not be required to work exclusively on a single technology stack; however, basic knowledge of other relevant technologies and readiness to learn additional frameworks or backend systems as per project requirements is essential.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Preference will be given to candidates with prior experience working in Government organizations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p5\"><strong>3.3 Desirable</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li5\">Experience in REST APIs, web services.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">Knowledge of Server environment for code deployment.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">Familiarity with Git.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">Good communication skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: 23.65pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--></h3>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to the selected firm for the audit of <strong>Please provide project name</strong>, CHiPS, Government of Chhattisgarh, will be released upon submission of the invoice and corresponding deliverables on a quarterly basis.</li>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a quarterly basis.</li>\r\n<li>Each payment will be made only after the delivery of the corresponding deliverable and its acceptance by CHiPS.</li>\r\n<li>Taxes will be applicable as per prevailing government norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>PENALTY TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the terms and conditions mentioned in Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025, Raipur dated 20/02/2025.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise (via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Key Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th>Bidder Presentation<br>(50 Marks)</th>\r\n<th>Candidate Interview<br>(50 Marks)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the Project Framework</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed methodology for such a specific kind of project</li>\r\n<li>Prior experience in project interaction with senior Government officials</li>\r\n<li>Prior exposure to Auditing Government projects</li>\r\n<li>Resource deployment at multiple government offices in multiple locations</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of key SLAs of project management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Suitability of profile</li>\r\n<li>Years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Good understanding of project management best practices framework</li>\r\n<li>Ability to Negotiate / Persuade / Influence</li>\r\n<li>Strong ability to understand, deliberate, and report / monitor the key SLAs</li>\r\n<li>Excellent communication abilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<ul>\r\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\r\n<li>The last date for submission of response is dd/mm/YYYY. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\r\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\r\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EoI</li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per Empanelment Tender No-.</li>\r\n<li>Presentation showing strategy and action plan for conducting Impact Assessment</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'118078','2026-02-11 17:06:15',4,1,'2026-02-11 13:25:52',60,'2026-02-11 17:06:15',NULL,'2026-02-12 10:38:09',1,NULL,0,1,'2026-02-12',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Manpower Services for BuildNXT 2.0 Project of CHiPS','2026-02-11','2026-02-16','2026-03-02 17:00:00','2026-03-03 12:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-09-24',0,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/anlsRmd8jD28Meb3NouxGYDcmmyxEF0vXstylMtJ.pdf',NULL,0,1,1,0,'9,10,11,12,13,17',0,0,1,NULL,'',0,0,0,0,NULL,1,1,0,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (118,0,99,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/DSW/2026',1,'For Providing Consultant Services to the Directorate of Social Welfare, Chhattisgarh','12','<p>The objective of the State Consultant is to provide strategic leadership and high-level technical advisory support to strengthen governance, policy formulation, and institutional performance of social welfare programs across the State. The consultant will drive systemic reforms with a focus on disability rights, social inclusion, and equitable access to entitlements, ensuring alignment with national legislations and global best practices. The role includes spearheading digital transformation of schemes, enhancing data intelligence and evidence-based decision-making frameworks, fostering inter-departmental convergence, optimizing resource utilization, and building sustainable institutional capacities to improve transparency, accountability, service efficiency, and measurable social impact across vulnerable populations.</p>',2,99,'2026-02-12 15:18:00',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Supervise implementation of the project in the designated Department/ State/Region under Directorate of Social Welfare Govt of C.G.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Ensure that the assigned activities are fully accomplished, meet expected technical and management quality standards, and are delivered on schedule.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Ensure that the project is implemented in accordance with partnership. agreement and in line with Standard Operating Protocol of the Department of Social Welfare Govt of Chhattisgarh.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Ensure that information, records and documentation necessary to monitor the project are maintained and are available at all times for inspection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Conduct visits/travel to States/districts for organizing and evaluating deprogrammers for at least 15-20 days each month.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Ensure that relevant data and records are maintained with full confidentiality and responsibility</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Foster and maintain effective and professional relationships with and between all project staff, partners and stakeholders</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Organize and facilitate meetings between key stakeholders and regular coordination meetings in accordance with the governance structure of the project.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Conduct research and study on Schemes which are running and bridge the gap with new Policies and programme in accordance with our rules and regulation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Propose and formulate new Schemes which is beneficial by implementation for target group in Chhattisgarh state in accordance with prevailing roles.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Conceptualize, develop, and implement innovative and best practices to enhance the efficiency of departmental service delivery</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Provide technical inputs for policy formulation and program development related to persons with disabilities, and rehabilitation of destitute individuals etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Document best practices, success stories, process guidelines, and toolkits to ensure organizational knowledge is captured, preserved, and accessible for future use</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Collaborate with relevant line departments, UNICEF, and other national and international development partners to facilitate convergence and resource mobilization</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Design and deliver targeted training programmes, workshops, and mentoring sessions for government staff and implementing partners to enhance programme execution capabilities</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 146.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Additional Task/work Assigned by Department.</span></p>',NULL,'<p><strong>PAYMENT TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Payment to selected bidder for technical and operational support to be released on person month basis, post submission of the invoice for payment. The payment will be as per current resources person month rates applicable under empanelment and payment terms will be governed terms and conditions of Empanelment agreement.</p>',NULL,'<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\n<li class=\"li1\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</li>\n<li class=\"li1\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</li>\n<li class=\"li1\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-<br><br>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 2px; border-spacing: 0px; width: 100%; height: 266px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 49px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 12.846%; height: 49px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 59.732%; height: 49px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong>&nbsp; Bidder</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Presentation</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 26.4764%; height: 49px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong>&nbsp; Candidates&nbsp;</strong><strong>Profile</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 49px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 12.846%; height: 49px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 59.732%; height: 49px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong>&nbsp; 50&nbsp;</strong><strong>Marks</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 26.4764%; height: 49px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong>&nbsp; 50&nbsp;</strong><strong>Marks</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 168px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 12.846%; height: 168px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong>&nbsp; Key&nbsp;</strong><strong>Evaluation&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Criteria</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 59.732%; height: 168px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<ul>\n<li>Approach&nbsp;and&nbsp;Methodology</li>\n<li>Understanding&nbsp;of the&nbsp;Project</li>\n<li>Quality&nbsp;of&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;methodology&nbsp;for&nbsp;such&nbsp;specific&nbsp;kind&nbsp;of&nbsp;a project. (Sports Consulting/Sports Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ Sports Events)</li>\n<li>Prior&nbsp;exposure&nbsp;in&nbsp;similar&nbsp;government&nbsp;projects&nbsp;related&nbsp;to Sports Consulting/ Sports Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ Sports Events along with experience in education sector for youth empowerment.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; width: 26.4764%; height: 168px;\" valign=\"top\">\n<ul>\n<li>Suitability&nbsp;of the&nbsp;profile</li>\n<li>Educational&nbsp;Qualification</li>\n<li>Years&nbsp;of&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;Experience</li>\n<li>Experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;Working&nbsp;in Government Projects</li>\n<li>Excellent communication abilities</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</li>\n</ul>','<p class=\"p1\">Agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">The last date for submission of response is <b>to be declared</b>. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.<br><br>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email <span class=\"s4\">to:</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</p>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this&nbsp;<span class=\"s3\">EOI</span></li>\r\n<li>Copy of Approach and methodology&nbsp;<span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">presentation</span></li>\r\n<li>Resumes of resources that will face the interview. The format of resumes will be as per annexed format.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'384985','2026-02-26 12:06:43',4,1,'2026-02-12 18:11:38',99,'2026-02-26 12:06:43',NULL,'2026-03-05 18:41:10',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-03-05',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Expression of Interest (EoI) for Providing PMU Services for Directorate of Social Welfare, Chhattisgarh','2026-03-05','2026-03-10','2026-03-26 17:00:00','2026-04-07 11:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-09-25',1,0,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/pEQHSllUp3i0wBgtJEb67ldChS2D4gN8lFM1pi43.pdf',NULL,0,2,1,0,'7,8',0,0,1,NULL,'uploads/floated_eois/baR7GsdNrmccK7XpFYAUaeoeRV6NuarSeqA7Pc69.pdf',0,0,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (119,0,102,'EoI/DMFT/DANTEWADA/CSF/PMU/2026',1,'Selection of Expert Team for Setting up the Project Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation, Dantewada','36','<ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Establish and operate a Programme Management Unit (PMU) to provide planning, technical, and monitoring support for effective implementation of DMF projects across priority and other priority sectors.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Strengthening institutional capacity through innovation, best practices, stakeholder training, knowledge management, and technical support to the DMF Trust Board and Executive Committee.</span></li>\r\n</ul>',2,102,'2026-02-13 17:23:43',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">The selected agency will function as a &ldquo;DMF Resource and Function Hub&rdquo; and will be responsible for the following activities:</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Programme Management Unit (PMU)</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing managerial support to the DMFT in sync with state DMF Rules and Guidelines for implementing and monitoring&nbsp; projects/schemes under DMF Trust.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing assistance to DMF for efficient and effective allocation of resources for development and welfare schemes for the mining affected areas and people.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sectoral support in major priority sectors including Health and Nutrition, Livelihoods, Agriculture and Irrigation, Environmental Preservation, Infrastructure Development, IT &amp; MIS etc.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing guidance for project formulation, project designing and reporting.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Compliance to the requirements of State DMF Rules, PMKKKY Guidelines and regulatory authorities &ndash; statutory and administrative.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing strategic direction and innovative ideas for effective utilization of DMF for comprehensive development of people in mining affected areas.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Acting as an interface between Administrative (Line) Department/State and District level Agencies and development agencies at the district level for facilitating and expediting field level implementation.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Support coordination between district administration and common public for the outreach of government scheme.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Collection of credible data on relevant sectors from District level, Line Departments and other stakeholders.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Support and strengthening procurement and financial functions related to DMF projects</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Facilitating generation of periodic MIS reports for concurrent monitoring of projects.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Documentation of best practices and creation of a data repository for cross learning among the implementing agencies/District.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Design parameters and framework to assess the performance and to monitor progress of the convergence activities undertaken by different Line departments.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Conducting periodic monitoring and evaluation of programmatic interventions, quality control, ensuring value for money and financial accountability.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Support in management and maintenance of centralized web-based MIS/ existing DMF Portal for real time monitoring.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Any other task assigned by the District Collector.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Provide technical and facilitation support to the DMF Trust Board and Executive Committee for informed governance and oversight.</span></li>\n</ul>',NULL,'<p><strong>PAYMENT TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li>For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or DMFT, Dantewada, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">DMFT, Dantewada will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise. (Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p5\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-<br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5532%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.8906%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; Bidder Presentation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5562%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; Candidate Interview</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5532%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.8906%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; 50 Marks</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5562%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; 50 Marks</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5532%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Key Evaluation Criteria</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.8906%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Approach and Methodology</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Understanding of the Project</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of project</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5562%;\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Suitability of profile</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Years of relevant experience</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Good understanding of project management best practices framework</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Ability to Negotiate/Persuade /Influence</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Excellent communication abilities</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<ul>\r\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\r\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 06/03/2026 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\r\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\r\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EoI</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Copy of Approach and methodology <span class=\"s4\">presentation.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,'579717','2026-02-16 11:45:38',4,1,'2026-02-13 19:56:30',102,'2026-02-16 11:45:38',NULL,'2026-02-19 23:00:02',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-02-19',NULL,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)','Selection of Expert Team for Setting up the Project Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation, Dantewada','2026-02-19','2026-02-24','2026-03-16 17:00:00','2026-03-17 12:00:00',NULL,NULL,'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in','2026-09-26',1,1,0,'uploads/authorizationletters/L974yKKpPZpK1MuxCoNmnEp1FIJWySfckZhobV6U.pdf',NULL,0,1,1,0,'1,2,3,4,5',0,0,1,NULL,'uploads/floated_eois/DpPiBLHskGUICw4S5NdkMYKxDOvewML2MtGFACS1.pdf',0,0,0,0,NULL,1,1,0,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,101900058.93,0,0,18342010.61,120242069.54,1,0,NULL,NULL);
insert  into `eoi_request`(`requestid`,`projectid`,`userid`,`eoinumber`,`isgenerated`,`projecttitle`,`projectduration`,`projectobjective`,`categoryid`,`createdby`,`creationdate`,`isapproved`,`approvedby`,`approvedon`,`approvalremark`,`totalbudget`,`totaladmincharge`,`totalamount`,`operatingmargin`,`tax`,`admincharge`,`aboutproject`,`page_indexing`,`chips_objective`,`scopeofwork`,`anyother`,`termsandcondition`,`evaluation_index`,`evaluationprocess`,`criticalinformation`,`documentrequired`,`replywithremark`,`acceptanceotp`,`acceptancedatetime`,`eoistatus`,`sentby`,`senton`,`confirmedby`,`confirmedon`,`authletter`,`eoifloatdate`,`floatedby`,`presentationfile1`,`isfileuploaded1`,`iscommittee`,`floatdate`,`expirydate`,`issuername`,`engagementname`,`releasedate`,`prebidlastdate`,`deadlinedate`,`interviewdate`,`interview_place`,`selection_method`,`communicationaddress`,`eoiexpirydate`,`isinprebid`,`isordered`,`isupdated`,`authorizationletter`,`draftedeoi`,`isUpdateRequired`,`tier_choice`,`isInterviewSet`,`project_type`,`vendorids`,`iscancelled`,`approvalStatus`,`approvalClosed`,`approvalOtp`,`eoi_file`,`isExtended`,`isSecondCall`,`hasOldPreBid`,`oldRequestId`,`notesheet_file`,`isInterviewDone`,`isMomReceived`,`isDemandNoteRaised`,`isPaymentReceoved`,`isOrderFileReceived`,`corrigendum_file`,`corrigendum_date`,`corrigendum_remark`,`isClosed`,`closedOn`,`closure_file`,`eoi_resource_value`,`eoi_admincharge`,`eoi_operatingcost`,`eoi_tax`,`eoi_total_value`,`isCalculated`,`allowResourceAdd`,`addition_resource_letter`,`upload_time`) values (120,0,109,'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/SSADA/2026',1,'Appointment of PROJECT MANAGEMENT UNIT (PMU) FOR PROVIDING ADVISORY SERVICES TO SIRPUR SPECIAL AREA DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY (SSADA)','12','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 18.2pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Sirpur Special Area Development Authority (the &ldquo;Authority&rdquo;) is engaged in development of Sirpur special area in Chhattisgarh. As part of this endeavour, the Authority has decided to appoint the consultant to provide advisory services as per scope of this Tender document for the development of the special area. The geographical scope of the consultants shall not be limited to the SSADA area but shall be the larger landscape surrounding the Sirpur Special Area or as any other area decided by the Authority.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: HI;\">The engagement will be for a period of 12 (twelve) months from the date of issue of work order and shall be extendable for 2 (two) terms of 12 (twelve) months each on sole discretion of the Authority.</span></p>',2,109,'2026-02-19 11:40:18',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,18,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 18.2pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Scope of Work - &ldquo;Project Support Consultant&rdquo;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.75pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.75pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Scope of Services </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 54.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">The PMU will work in tandem with the existing department staff and shall be responsible, amongst others, for the following services:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -36.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level3 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.1<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Mandatory Scope of work: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 54.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">The Scope of work defined in the clauses 1.1.1.1 to 1.1.1.8 shall be mandatory for the consultant and the same has to be executed by onsite team.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.1.1<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Formulation of Strategy Plan: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The consultant shall assist the Authority in preparing a comprehensive Strategy Plan that provides the overarching development vision for the Sirpur Special Area. The Strategy Plan will serve as a roadmap to guide decision-making, prioritize interventions, and align investments with long-term goals of sustainable heritage-led development.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Strategy Plan shall include the following key elements:</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Vision and Development Framework</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Formulate a vision statement for the Sirpur Special Area that reflects its unique identity as a centre of cultural heritage, spiritual tourism, and sustainable regional development.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Translate this vision into a strategic framework consisting of development objectives, guiding principles, and thematic focus areas (e.g., heritage conservation, tourism promotion, infrastructure improvement, community development, environmental sustainability).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Align the framework with state and national-level policies, tourism strategies, and heritage development missions.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 112%; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Infrastructure Gap Assessment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Conduct a baseline study of existing physical, social, and economic infrastructure in the region.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Identify deficiencies in basic services such as transport connectivity, utilities (water, sanitation, power), hospitality infrastructure, public amenities, healthcare, and educational facilities.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Highlight infrastructure needs that directly support tourism and heritage development, such as visitor amenities, cultural centres, interpretation facilities, eco-trails, and digital infrastructure.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Recommend interventions to address both immediate bottlenecks and long-term infrastructure needs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 112%; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Identification of Early-bird and Flagship Projects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Develop a project shelf categorized as short-, medium-, and long-term based on feasibility, investment requirement, and impact potential.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Propose early-bird projects or \"quick wins\" that can be implemented rapidly to showcase visible outcomes and build investor confidence.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Identify flagship projects with transformative potential - such as heritage hotels, eco-tourism circuits, craft villages, wellness resorts, and cultural festivals - that reinforce Sirpur\'s identity and attract large-scale investment.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Establish clear criteria for project selection, including socio-economic impact, cultural relevance, financial viability, and sustainability.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 112%; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Business Model, Financial Model, and Project Structuring</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Formulate business models for priority projects, indicating roles of public and private stakeholders, modes of financing, and expected returns.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Develop financial models projecting costs, revenues, and risk-adjusted returns, while exploring funding options such as PPP, viability gap funding, CSR investments, or international heritage/tourism funds.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Recommend appropriate project structuring strategies to maximize efficiency, transparency, and investor confidence.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 112%; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Phasing, Prioritization, and Implementation Roadmap</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Develop a phasing plan that sequences projects logically, ensuring early successes while planning for long-term transformation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Prioritize interventions based on need, feasibility, and alignment with the broader development vision.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Prepare an implementation roadmap with timelines, responsible agencies, funding mechanisms, and key performance indicators (KPIs).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Recommend institutional strengthening measures to enable the Authority to effectively execute and monitor the Strategy Plan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 112%; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 66.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.1.2<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Investment</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> Promotion: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assisting Authority in investors connect, organizing investor meets, and facilitating potential investors.<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assisting the authority in project identification and project prioritization, business and industry assessment, industry connect, formulation of strategies for improving investment in the area. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Facilitate structured engagement with potential investors, developers, and operators from hospitality, tourism, culture, and allied sectors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Develop a database of prospective investors and industry associations with demonstrated interest in heritage, tourism, and wellness projects.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Support the Authority in conducting one-on-one investor interactions and business-to-government dialogues.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Organize investor meets, roadshows, workshops, and seminars at State, National, and International levels to showcase investment opportunities as per the requirements of Authority.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Provide end-to-end support for conceptualization, content development, outreach, and event management in coordination with the Authority.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Facilitate follow-up actions post-events to ensure meaningful conversion of investor interest into proposals.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.1.3<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Transaction Advisory Services: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assistance in bid process management, project structuring, drafting tender documents and consultation for private investment. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assisting the authority in attaining the objective of eco-sensitive, tourism centric and heritage oriented development of the project.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Performing site visits, collection of information and assisting the authority in understanding the minimum development commitments of individual projects. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"