 industry associations to expand outreach and credibility.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo10; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Provide periodic reports, policy briefs, and best practices to guide the Authority on heritage tourism, cultural branding, and sustainable development as per requirement.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo10; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assistance in aligning the Authority&rsquo;s initiatives with the state/central government&rsquo;s programmes and schemes.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo10; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Representing Authority at various national/international platforms, conferences, summits, etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo10; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">The consultants shall assist Authority in collaborating with various National/International institutions (academic, heritage, tourism, cultural, bilateral, government, etc.) for various purposes as and when required.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.1.8<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"m