<span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">tendering </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">process</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">31.03.2030</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><br>The Project &ldquo;Digital City Platform Pilot Project&rdquo; is under extended O&amp;M Period and is likely to be completed by 31.03.2026. This Project was executed through NRANSCCL. A new RFP has been floated by NRANVP for Upgradation of the existing ICCC and further O&amp;M of the Project for 3 years.<br><br>The PMC team would be responsible for managing all the ICT Projects under NRANSCCL and the Upgradation Project of the ICCC under NRANVP.<br><br>The details of the ongoing Projects are mentioned below: <br>1. Digital City Platform Pilot Project (ICCC Project phase I): <br>a. Project Start Date: April 2017 <br>b. Project End Date: July 2024<br>c. Project extended Period: Till March 2026 <br>d. The Tracks and Components of the Project:<br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 94.2308%; border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.70988%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Sl.</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>No.</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.6605%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Name</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>of</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>the</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Track</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.784%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Components</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.70988%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">1.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.6605%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">City</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Surveillance</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">System</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.784%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">138</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Surveillance</span><span