Science / Chemistry) OR Equivalent Degree from a recognized University. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Minimum 7+ Years\' relevant experience in solid and/or liquid waste management projects, prefaerably in government / PSU / State level assignments.</span></p>','<p>For the Subject Matter Expert role, we understand that &ldquo;Equivalent Degree&rdquo; would include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Planning, Architechture, Environmental Science, or a related technical/scientific discipline; or</li>\r\n<li>A Master&rsquo;s or Post‑Graduate degree in Environmental Engineering, Planning, Business Administration, Public Policy, Environmental Law, Environment Management or M.Tech in Environmental fields;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Provided that the candidate meets the minimum 7+ years of relevant experience in solid and/or liquid waste management and demonstrates strong subject‑matter expertise.</p>\r\n<p>Kindly confirm whether this interpretation of &ldquo;Equivalent Degree&rdquo; for the Subject Matter Expert position is acceptable.</p>','2026-05-25 16:22:28',1,'<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">As per EOI document</span></p>','2026-06-02 17:21:12',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (176,36,162,4,'<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Section 2, </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Introduction / Objective, Page No 3</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">The selected team will work in close coordination with CECB\'s technical and administrative wings and will be based at </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">CECB\'s Headquarters, Paryavaran Bhawan, Sector 19, Atal Nagar – Nava Raipur, Chhattisgarh.</span></p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Since the team is required to be based at CECB HQ, Paryavaran Bhawan, Atal Nagar, Nava Raipur.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br>1. Will furniture, internet connectivity, and printing infrastructure will be provided by CHiPS / CECB , or is this the bidder\'s responsibility?</span></p>','2026-05-25 16:22:45',1,'<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">As per EOI document and Empanelment Agreement with CHiPS</span></p>','2026-06-02 17:24:33',NULL,1);
