0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">B.E./ B.Tech (Civil/ Environmental/ Chemical) OR LL.B. / LL.M. (Environment Law /Administrative Law) OR M.Sc. (Environmental Science) OR M.E./ M.Tech (Environmental/ Civil/Chemical Engineering) with a PG Diploma in Environmental Law OR Equivalent Degree from a recognized University. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Minimum 5+ Years\' experience in environmental compliance, administrative coordination with regulatory forums, or policy advisory roles in government/NGO/consulting organizations.</span></p>','<p>For the Governance Managing Consultant (Domain Expert) role, we understand that &ldquo;Equivalent Degree&rdquo; would include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; A Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Planning, Architecture, Environmental Science, or a related technical/scientific field; and</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; A Master&rsquo;s or Post‑Graduate degree in Engineering, Planning, Business Administration, Public Policy, Environmental Law, or M.Tech in Environmental fields;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>provided that the candidate meets the minimum 5+ years of experience in environmental compliance, administrative coordination with regulatory forums, or policy advisory roles, and demonstrates strong subject‑matter expertise.</p>\r\n<p>Kindly confirm whether this interpretation of &ldquo;Equivalent Degree&rdquo; for the Governance Managing Consultant position is acceptable.</p>','2026-05-25 16:23:33',1,'<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">As per EOI document</span></p>','2026-06-02 17:23:36',NULL,1);
