and the Man-month rates for this position will be </span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">the “Managing Consultant” rate under the Governance domain, as per the empanelment rate card</span><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">.</span></p>','2026-05-25 16:24:32',1,'<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; letter-spacing: -.05pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: EN-US;\">With reference to Section 4, Team Requirement, S. No. 3 &amp; 4, it is hereby clarified that the resource requirement shall be read as <strong>Governance Senior Consultant</strong>. The qualification and experience criteria shall remain unchanged and shall be as specified in the EOI document.</span></p>','2026-06-02 17:25:23',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (179,37,162,1,'<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">Section 1, Factsheet</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Page No. 3</span></p>','<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Last Date for Submission of Proposals: 09/06/2026 17:00 Hrs.</span></p>','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">We request an extension of three weeks from the publication of the pre-bid response for submitting the Expression of Interest (EoI) responses. This is required to ensure completion of our internal review and approval processes and duly submit the proposal.</span></p>','2026-05-25 16:25:31',1,'<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">As per EOI document</span></p>','2026-06-02 17:25:49',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (180,37,162,1,'<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Section 5, Evaluation Process<br>Page No. 5</span></p>','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</span></p>','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: JA; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">We understand that, based on the evaluation of the EoI submissions and the subsequent presentations/interviews (as applicable), CHiPS will directly issue the Letter of Award (LoA) to the selected empanelled agency, and that no separate, subsequent RFP will be floated for this engagement.</span></p>','2026-05-25 16:26:24',1,'<p><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">As per EOI document</span></p>','2026-06-02 17:26:17',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (181,38,161,2,'<p>3. Scope of work,</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Baseline Survey</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Page number 3</p>','<p>Baseline Survey:<br>&bull; Conduct a comprehensive socio-economic and infrastructure baseline survey in mining-affected areas of Sukma.<br>&bull; Identify critical gaps in health, education, water, sanitation, livelihoods, and infrastructure.<br>&bull; Map existing resources, community needs, and opportunities for sustainable development.</p>','<p>Comrehensive baseline survey within time limit requires involvement of a survey team and Survey data evaluation team. There are only 2 resources proposed in this assignment. None of the resources qualification and proposed experience empower them to carry out baseline survey. More often it is not possible on the part of only two resources to visit all the villages and collect data for baseline within propsed time frame. Hence, we are requesting to add at least 3 resources for initial 4 months to carry out baseline survey for Sukma.</p>','2026-05-25 16:57:06',1,'<p>Human resource will be provided by district to conduct baseline survey</p>','2026-05-29 12:22:38',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (182,38,161,2,'<p>4. Team Requirements,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Qualification of proposed resources</p>','<p>Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in HR, business administration.<br>Master&rsquo;s degree in HR, business administration.</p>\r\n<p>Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in HR, business administration , life science or nursing.<br>Master&rsquo;s degree in HR, business administration , life science , health administration.</p>','<p>Proposed qualification is very close ended. Qualification in HR don\'t comensurate with Education and Healthcare. Hence, we are requesting to consider additional qualification as per CHiPS empanelment of allow all other relevant Master degree such as (MBA, MSW, PG Degree, M Tech, MED, MPH etc.) to carry out the assignment</p>','2026-05-25 17:01:29',1,'<p>-</p>','2026-05-29 12:22:54',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (183,38,161,2,'<p>Others</p>','<p>Others</p>','<p>From our experience of working in DMFs across India, we understand Civil Engineering is an enevitale part as larger number of projects involves construction. Hence, we are requesting to add one Civil/ Architectural expert to this project.</p>','2026-05-25 17:04:01',1,'<p>-</p>','2026-05-29 12:23:10',NULL,1);
insert  into `eoi_request_prebid_query`(`questionid`,`queryid`,`requestid`,`vendorid`,`clause_reference`,`clause_detail`,`queries_with_justification`,`creationdate`,`iseditable`,`answer`,`answeredon`,`subuserid`,`isprebid`) values (184,39,168,3,'<p>Page no: 4 &amp; 5/ Caluse Reference: 5</p>','<p>Team Requirements</p>','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'EYInterstate Light\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">With reference to the EoI for all six positions, we respectfully suggest that the qualification requirements be modified to include the term &lsquo;or equivalent&rsquo; across all eligibility criteria for each position</span></p>','2026-06-03 16:29:12',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,1);
