n<li>Emerging Tech Adoption- Explore the use of Blockchain for supply cain transparency or AI for demand forecasting.</li>\r\n</ol>',134,'378000.00','378000.00','0.00','0.00','18.00','777600.00','5.00','254880.00','5352480.00',0,NULL,0,2,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0);
