k Service Level Agreements of IT vendors to ensure 99.9% system uptime.</li>\r\n</ol>',135,'336000.00','336000.00','0.00','0.00','18.00','691200.00','5.00','226560.00','4757760.00',0,NULL,0,2,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0);
