ce- Help in the preparation of tender documents and technical specifications for office equipment.</li>\r\n<li>Administrative Coordination- Facilitate the logistical needs of the consulting team and liaison with the CEO&rsquo;s office.</li>\r\n</ol>',146,'288750.00','288750.00','0.00','0.00','18.00','594000.00','5.00','194700.00','4088700.00',0,NULL,0,2,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0);
