st: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt;\">Should have exposure to: Master Plans/Development Plans, Zonal Plans. Local Area Plans, Town Planning Schemes (TPS)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in preparing DPRs, concept plans, sectoral plans, and implementation frameworks</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Proficiency in GIS. AutoCAD, MS Excel/ PowerPoint, and familiarity with land information systems and remote sensing basics.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Palatino Linotype\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">At least 4 years in advising Central Govt. And/or Govt. Undertaking/ Agencies/ Authorities/ Boards/ ULBs.</span></p>','FULL TIME',12,'<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; 