d;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Ensure alignment of projects with DMF guidelines, district priorities, and statutory frameworks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Conceptualize a wide range of innovative projects.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Guide preparation of annual action plans, budgets, and progress reports.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Review outputs from sector experts and ensure convergence and coherence across components.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Support decision-making, risk management, and issue resolution at the district level. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Represent the PMU in review meetings, workshops, and consultations.</span></p>',159,'378000.00','378000.00','0.00','0.00','18.00','395280.00','5.00','129564.00','2720844.00',0,NULL,0,2,'2026-05-25','2026-11-24',0,NULL,0,0);
