nelment agreement<br>6. Other Terms and Condition: As per Empanelment agreement<br>7. Man month rate beyond 16 February 2024 would be governed as per extended terms &amp; conditions mentioned<br>in Empanelment Agreement.<br>8. The above to extension will be valid for maximum period of one year subjected to changes in rate discovered<br>in any RFP floated by CHiPS in this regards, in future.</li>\r\n</ol>',0,0,3,0,'2025-10-28 19:03:17',1,'uploads/demandnotefiles/69jUaW42kejxa3DXI2gqP89fj6VnwA3e1H9Nd05o.pdf',NULL,NULL,NULL,'uploads/workorderpayment/ibFCWSJpiUAtPVShoHd7TGUX6m6dWLejCYje7C0N.pdf',0,0,194580000,241084620,11480220,0,241084620,0,18,5,1,'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society','225/ACEO/CHiPS/EMPL/CSF/2025/ Raipur Dated 13/05/2025','Add. Chief Executive Officer','M/s ERNST & YOUNG LLP, Raipur (C.G.)',0,0,3,'M/s ERNST & YOUNG LLP','2025-10-28 21:05:42','uploads/signedorder/NX3eIyRcgFBZ72RTt8wWotJoVlitFwuzr6PnVjP7.pdf','2025-03-25',NULL,1,'2026-04-09 14:13:01',0,30,36,'Project Management Unit (PMU) for Technical Support and Transaction Advisory Support For AMRUT 2.0',12,1,415,'Assigned by M/s Ernst & Young LLP (CSF) on 06-05-2026, 02:06 PM',0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0);
